#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:4
msgid "Working in Xsheet/Timeline"
msgstr "在Xsheet/Timeline中工作"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:5
msgid ""
"The Xsheet, the digital version of the traditional exposure sheet, allows you "
"to control the timing of all of the elements of a scene. It is organized in "
"columns and rows: each column contains a layer of the animation and each row "
"represents a frame contents. Columns are divided into cells, representing the "
"content of that column in a particular frame."
msgstr ""
"Xsheet是传统曝光表的数字版本，允许您控制场景中所有元素的时间。它按列和行组织：每"
"列包含一层动画，每行表示一个帧内容。列被划分为单元格，表示特定帧中该列的内容。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:7
msgid ""
"The Timeline is the horizontal counterpart of the Xsheet, it serves the same "
"purpose, and has the same functionality. The main differences with the Xsheet "
"are that in the Timeline the different levels are laid out in horizontal "
"layers, while each frame content is represented by the columns of the Timeline."
msgstr ""
"Timeline是Xsheet的横向对应物，它具有相同的目的和功能。与Xsheet的主要区别在于，在"
"时间线中，不同的级别以水平层的形式排列，而每个帧内容都由时间线的列表示。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:9
msgid ""
"In both of them, different items, generically called here as levels, can be "
"loaded into the scene: animation levels, images for the background and "
"overlays, and video clips."
msgstr ""
"在这两个场景中，可以将不同的项目（这里统称为级别）加载到场景中：动画级别、背景和"
"覆盖的图像以及视频剪辑。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:11
msgid ""
"Other OpenToonz scenes can be loaded there as well: they will be nested inside "
"a column/layer, and considered as a Sub-Xsheet of the current Xsheet/Timeline."
msgstr ""
"其他OpenToonz场景也可以加载到那里：它们将嵌套在列/层中，并被视为当前Xsheet/"
"Timeline的子Xsheet。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:13
msgid ""
"All of the Xsheet/Timeline contents can be checked in the viewer, where the "
"animation can be played back, and the scene contents edited."
msgstr ""
"可以在查看器中检查所有Xsheet/Timeline内容，在查看器中可以播放动画并编辑场景内"
"容。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:19
msgid "Using the Viewer"
msgstr "使用查看器"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:20
msgid ""
"The viewer has different modes of visualizing the scene contents. According to "
"your needs you can view the whole work area, only the elements included in the "
"current camera shot, or visualize the whole scene in a 3D environment. The "
"viewer can also be frozen, so that the visualization is not updated until you "
"enter with the pointer in the viewer. When the preview mode is activated, the "
"viewer can display the rendered animation as in the final render (see  :ref:"
"`Previewing the Animation <previewing_the_animation>`  )."
msgstr ""
"观众有不同的方式来可视化场景内容。根据您的需要，您可以查看整个工作区域，仅查看当"
"前相机拍摄中包含的元素，或在3D环境中可视化整个场景。查看器也可以被冻结，这样在您"
"使用查看器中的指针输入之前，可视化效果不会更新。当预览模式被激活时，观众可以像在"
"最终渲染中一样显示渲染的动画（请参阅：ref:“预览动画"
"<Previewing_the_animation>”）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:24
msgid "Camera Stand view, 3D view and Camera view modes."
msgstr "相机支架视图、3D视图和相机视图模式。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:26
msgid ""
"At the bottom of the viewer another customizable set of buttons is available. "
"Some are used for playback (see  :ref:`Using the Viewer "
"<using_the_work_area>`  ), some others are relevant only when using the Animate "
"tool (|animate|) to animate objects and when previewing the animation in the "
"viewer (see :ref:`Animating Objects <animating_objects>`  and :ref:`Previewing "
"the Animation <previewing_the_animation>`  )."
msgstr ""
"在查看器的底部，另一组可定制的按钮可用。有些用于播放（请参阅：ref:“使用查看器"
"<Using_the_work_area>`”），有些仅在使用动画工具（|Animate|）为对象设置动画以及在"
"查看器中预览动画时才相关（请参见：ref:`动画对象<animation_objects>和：ref:'预览"
"动画<previewing_the_anima"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:28
msgid ""
"Additional elements like a field guide, or the table, can be displayed or "
"hidden, and the background color can be set (see  :ref:`Customizing the Viewer "
"<customizing_the_work_area>`  )."
msgstr ""
"可以显示或隐藏字段指南或表格等其他元素，也可以设置背景颜色（请参阅：ref:`自定义"
"查看器<Customizing_the_work_area>`）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:30
msgid "**To switch the view mode in the viewer:**"
msgstr "**要在查看器中切换视图模式，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:32
msgid "Use the buttons available in the viewer title bar to do the following:"
msgstr "使用查看器标题栏中的可用按钮执行以下操作："

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:34
msgid ""
"The **Camera Stand View** button (|camera_stand|) is for standard view, where "
"any part of the work area can be displayed. When playing back the scene, the "
"work area stands still, while all of the other elements, including the camera, "
"move in relation to its position."
msgstr ""
"**相机支架视图**按钮（|Camera_Stand|）用于标准视图，可以显示工作区域的任何部分。"
"播放场景时，工作区静止不动，而包括相机在内的所有其他元素都会相对于其位置移动。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:36
msgid ""
"The **3D View** button (|3d|) is for activating or deactivating the 3D view of "
"the elements composing the scene (see  :ref:`Working in a 3D Environment "
"<working_in_a_3d_environment>`  )."
msgstr ""
"**3D View**按钮（|3D|）用于激活或停用组成场景的元素的3D视图（参见：ref:“在3D环境"
"中工作<Working_in_a_3D_Environment>”）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:38
msgid ""
"The **Camera View** button (|camera_view|) is for keeping the box representing "
"the camera still, while all of the other elements move in relation to its "
"position. It can help you to better understand the shot when there are camera "
"trucks, or rotations."
msgstr ""
"**相机视图**按钮（|Camera_View|）用于在所有其他元素相对于其位置移动时保持代表相"
"机的框静止。当有摄像机车或旋转时，它可以帮助您更好地理解镜头。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:40
msgid ""
"When a frame is selected in the Level Strip, the view mode is set accordingly "
"to display that level only. Pressing one of these buttons will revert the "
"viewer back to showing the whole scene content."
msgstr ""
"在标高栏中选择框架时，视图模式会相应地设置为仅显示该标高。按下其中一个按钮将使观"
"众恢复显示整个场景内容。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:42
msgid "**To freeze/un-freeze the viewer:**"
msgstr "**要冻结/取消冻结查看器，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:44
msgid ""
"Click the Freeze button (|freeze|) in the viewer title bar to freeze/unfreeze "
"the displayed content; when activated the word frozen is displayed at the "
"center of the work area."
msgstr ""
"点击查看器标题栏中的冻结按钮（|Freeze|），冻结/解冻显示的内容；当激活时，单词冻"
"结显示在工作区的中心。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:46
msgid "**To update the viewer content when it is frozen:**"
msgstr "**要在查看器内容冻结时进行更新，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:48
msgid "Move the pointer over the viewer."
msgstr "将指针移到查看器上。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:54
msgid "Using the File Browser"
msgstr "使用文件浏览器"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:55
msgid ""
"All the elements you need for a scene can be retrieved by using a file browser."
msgstr "使用文件浏览器可以检索场景所需的所有元素。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:57
msgid "|file_browser|"
msgstr "|文件浏览器|"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:59
msgid ""
"You can either use the standard OpenToonz file browser to drag and drop levels "
"or folders to the Xsheet/Timeline or the Scene Cast window, or use the Load "
"Level... and Load Folder... commands from the File menu. In both cases you can "
"perform a multiple selection to load several levels or folders at the same "
"time, that will be exposed each in a separate column; if you use the Load "
"Level... command, when loading an animation level you can also specify the "
"frame range to load. When you use the Load Folder... command all the files "
"contained in the folder (if supported) are loaded into the Xsheet/Timeline."
msgstr ""
"您可以使用标准的OpenToonz文件浏览器将级别或文件夹拖放到Xsheet/Timeline或Scene "
"Cast窗口，也可以使用“加载级别”。..并加载文件夹。..文件菜单中的命令。在这两种情况"
"下，您都可以执行多选以同时加载多个级别或文件夹，每个级别或文件夹都将在单独的列中"
"显示；如果使用负载级别。..命令，加载动画级别时，您还可以指定要加载的帧范围。当您"
"使用“加载文件夹”时。..命令将文件夹中包含的所有文件（如果支持）加载到Xsheet/"
"Timeline中。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:61
msgid ""
"When a level is loaded, OpenToonz checks if its syntax matches one of the level "
"formats specified into Preferences...  →  Loading  →  **Level Settings by File "
"Format**. In this case the Level Settings specified will be applied. It is "
"possible to add as many formats as you want, defining them by using a Regular "
"Expression. This way, different settings can be automatically applied to "
"different kind of levels."
msgstr ""
"加载级别时，OpenToonz会检查其语法是否与“首选项”中指定的级别格式之一匹配。..  →  "
"加载中→  **按文件格式设置级别**。在这种情况下，将应用指定的级别设置。可以添加任"
"意数量的格式，并使用正则表达式定义它们。这样，不同的设置可以自动应用于不同类型的"
"级别。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:63
msgid ""
"It is possible to **Ignore Alpha Channel on Levels in Column 1** by activating "
"the option in Preferences...  →  Xsheet dialog section."
msgstr ""
"通过激活“首选项”中的选项，可以**在第1列的级别上忽略Alpha通道**。..  →  Xsheet对"
"话框部分。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:65
msgid "In the file tree available on the left there are the following main items:"
msgstr "在左侧可用的文件树中，有以下主要项目："

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:67
msgid "**My Computer** contains files and folders located in your computer."
msgstr "**“我的电脑”**包含位于您电脑中的文件和文件夹。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:69
msgid "**Network** allows the access to network computers."
msgstr "**网络**允许访问网络计算机。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:71
msgid ""
"**My Documents** contains files and folders located in the OS My Documents "
"folder."
msgstr "**My Documents**包含位于操作系统My Documents文件夹中的文件和文件夹。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:73
msgid ""
"**Library** displays files and folder located in the ``Projectroot\\library``  "
"folder (see  :ref:`Setting the Projectroot <setting_the_projectroot>`  )."
msgstr ""
"**Library**显示位于“Projectroot\\Library”文件夹中的文件和文件夹（请参阅：ref:“设"
"置Projectroot<Setting_the_Projectroot>”）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:75
msgid ""
"**History** contains recently saved scenes, organized in folders, one for each "
"of the last seven days OpenToonz was used."
msgstr ""
"**历史记录**包含最近保存的场景，按文件夹组织，过去七天使用OpenToonz的每一天都有"
"一个。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:77
msgid ""
"**Projectroot** lists all the projects that have been created as folders "
"containing the project information and material; the actual path of the "
"projectroot is displayed in brackets (see  :ref:`Using the Project Browser "
"<using_the_project_browser>`  )."
msgstr ""
"**Projectroot**列出了所有已创建为包含项目信息和材料的文件夹的项目；项目根的实际"
"路径显示在括号中（请参阅：ref:“使用项目浏览器<Using_the_Project_Browser>”）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:79
msgid ""
"In case more than one projectroot is defined, each will be displayed with the "
"related projectroot path in brackets (see  :ref:`Setting the Projectroot "
"<setting_the_projectroot>`  )."
msgstr ""
"如果定义了多个项目根，则每个项目根都将在括号中显示相关的项目根路径（请参阅：ref:"
"`设置项目根<Setting_the_projectroot>`）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:81
msgid ""
"**Version control** repository folder, labeled according to the version control "
"configuration, contains the folders and files under the version control system "
"(see  :ref:`Using the Version Control <using_the_version_control>`  )."
msgstr ""
"**版本控制**存储库文件夹根据版本控制配置进行标记，包含版本控制系统下的文件夹和文"
"件（请参阅：ref:`使用版本控制<Using_the_Version_control>`）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:83
msgid ""
"In case several repositories are defined, each will be displayed with its "
"appropriate label (see  :ref:`Configuring the Version Control in OpenToonz "
"<configuring_the_version_control_in_toonz>`  )."
msgstr ""
"如果定义了多个存储库，则每个存储库都将显示其相应的标签（请参阅：ref:“在OpenToonz"
"中配置版本控制<Configuring_the_Version_Control_In_toonz>”）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:85
msgid ""
"You can open folders and sub-folders in order to retrieve files that are "
"displayed in the area on the right. The current location path is displayed at "
"the top of the browser; existing folders can be renamed and new folders can be "
"created. Files can be displayed as icons or as a list, displaying additional "
"informations that can be also used to sort them."
msgstr ""
"您可以打开文件夹和子文件夹，以检索右侧区域中显示的文件。当前位置路径显示在浏览器"
"顶部；可以重命名现有文件夹，也可以创建新文件夹。文件可以显示为图标或列表，显示也"
"可用于排序的其他信息。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:87
msgid ""
"The way file icons are generated in the OpenToonz browser depends on the images "
"resolution and on the **Level Strip Thumbnail Size** option set for the Level "
"Strip frames in the Preferences...  →  Interface dialog section (see  :ref:"
"`Using the Level Strip <using_the_level_strip>`  )."
msgstr ""
"在OpenToonz浏览器中生成文件图标的方式取决于图像分辨率和“首选项”中为“水平条”帧设"
"置的“水平条缩略图大小”选项。..  →  界面对话框部分（请参阅：ref:`使用水平条"
"<Using_the_Level_Strip>`）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:93
msgid "Loading Levels"
msgstr "加载级别"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:95
msgid ""
"As part of the scene you can load Toonz Vector and Toonz Raster animation "
"levels (PLI and TLV), Toonz palettes (TPL), Raster full-color images or image "
"sequences (BMP, JPG, NOL, PNG, RGB, SGI, TGA, TIF and TIFF), video clips (AVI, "
"MOV, and MP4 and WebM with the aid of FFMPEG, if installed), Photoshop "
"documents (PSD), vector images (SVG) and audio files (AIFF, WAV and MP3 with "
"the aid of FFMPEG, if installed). Images or clips with alpha channel "
"information will retain their transparency information, once imported."
msgstr ""
"作为场景的一部分，您可以加载Toonz矢量和Toonz光栅动画级别（PLI和TLV）、Toonz调色"
"板（TPL）、光栅全色图像或图像序列（BMP、JPG、NOL、PNG、RGB、SGI、TGA、TIF和"
"TIFF）、视频剪辑（AVI、MOV和MP4以及WebM，如果安装了FFMPEG）、Photoshop文档"
"（PSD）、矢量图像（SVG）和音频文件（AIFF、WAV和MP3，如果安装的话，借助FFMPEG）。"
"导入后，带有阿尔法通道信息的图像或剪辑将保留其透明度信息。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:97
msgid ""
"It is also possible to load legacy TZU and TZP files created with Toonz version "
"4.x: in this case the files will be automatically converted and loaded in the "
"TLV format."
msgstr ""
"也可以加载使用Toonz 4.x版本创建的传统TZU和TZP文件：在这种情况下，文件将自动转换"
"并加载为TLV格式。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:99
msgid "SVG files are automatically converted and loaded in PLI format."
msgstr "SVG文件会自动转换并加载为PLI格式。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:101
msgid ""
"Photoshop files can be loaded taking into account the layers the document is "
"made of (see  :ref:`Loading Photoshop Documents "
"<loading_photoshop_documents>`  )."
msgstr ""
"加载Photoshop文件时可以考虑文档的图层（请参阅：ref:“加载Photoshop文档"
"<Loading_Photoshop_Documents>”）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:103
msgid ""
"*Single image* files can have numbers and letters as part of their names, but "
"they must comply with certain rules to be considered valid ones. Following are "
"several descriptive examples of valid and invalid image file names:"
msgstr ""
"*单个图像*文件的名称中可以包含数字和字母，但它们必须符合某些规则才能被视为有效文"
"件。以下是有效和无效图像文件名的几个描述性示例："

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:105
msgid "Valid name types: ``a1.tga``, ``1a1.tga``, ``1aa.tga``, ``1aaa.tga``"
msgstr "有效的名称类型：“a1.tga”、“1a1.tga”、“1a-tga”和“1aa.tga”``"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:107
msgid "Invalid name types: ``1.tga``, ``111.tga``, ``1a.tga``, ``111a.tga``"
msgstr "无效的名称类型：“1.tga”、“111.tga”，“1a.tga”、“111a.tga”``"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:109
msgid ""
"*Image sequences* are recognized and loaded by OpenToonz file browser as a "
"single animation level, if they are named with a progressive four-digits number "
"written between the *base* file name and the file *extension*, e.g. "
"``animation.0001.tif`` , ``animation.0002.tif`` , ``etc.`` or ``animation_0001."
"tif`` , ``animation_0002.tif`` , ``etc.``. They are displayed in the file "
"browser with a *double dot* or *an underscore and a dot* before the file "
"extension: e.g. ``animation..tif`` or ``animation_.tif``"
msgstr ""
"*如果图像序列*是用写在*base*文件名和文件扩展名*之间的递增四位数命名的，例"
"如“animation.0001.tif”、“animation_0002.tif”、“等”或“animation-0001."
"tif“、”animation_0001.tif“、”等，则OpenToonz文件浏览器会将其识别为单个动画级别并"
"加载。它们在文件浏览器中以*双点*或*下划线和点*显示在文件扩展名之前：例"
"如“animation”。.tif或animation_.tif``"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:111
msgid ""
"From the browser, you can **View** images and clips you are going to load as "
"levels by opening a flipbook whose default shrink factor and step can be set in "
"the preferences dialog, and see the related file information by opening an "
"**Info** box (see  :ref:`Using the Flipbook <using_the_flipbook>`  )."
msgstr ""
"从浏览器中，您可以通过打开一本翻页书来**查看**要作为级别加载的图像和剪辑，该翻页"
"书的默认收缩系数和步长可以在首选项对话框中设置，并通过打开**信息**框来查看相关文"
"件信息（请参阅：ref:`使用翻页书<Using_the_flipbook>`）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:113
msgid ""
"OpenToonz scenes (TNZ files) can be loaded as part of another scene as well, in "
"such a case they are loaded as Sub-Xsheets (see  :ref:`Loading a Scene as a Sub-"
"Xsheet <loading_a_scene_as_a_sub-xsheet>`  )."
msgstr ""
"OpenToonz场景（TNZ文件）也可以作为另一个场景的一部分加载，在这种情况下，它们可以"
"作为子Xsheets加载（参见：ref:`将场景加载为子Xsheet<Loading_a_scene_as_Sub-"
"Xsheet>`）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:115
msgid ""
"When you load levels using the standard OpenToonz file browser, you can set "
"whether to automatically expose them in the Xsheet/Timeline or not, by setting "
"the **Expose Loaded Levels in Xsheet** option in the Preferences...  →  Loading "
"dialog section. If activated, each level will be placed in a different column/"
"layer, starting from the first empty one. If deactivated, the loaded levels "
"will be stored in the Scene Cast, from where they can be selectively exposed in "
"Xsheet columns or Timeline layers (see  :ref:`Using the Scene Cast "
"<using_the_scene_cast>`  )."
msgstr ""
"使用标准OpenToonz文件浏览器加载层级时，可以通过在“首选项”中设置“在Xsheet**中显示"
"加载的层级”选项，设置是否在Xsheet/Timeline中自动显示它们。..  →  正在加载对话框"
"部分。如果激活，每个级别将从第一个空级别开始放置在不同的列/层中。如果禁用，加载"
"的级别将存储在“场景投射”中，从那里可以选择性地在Xsheet列或时间线层中显示（请参"
"阅：ref:“使用场景投射<Using_the_Scene_Cast>”）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:117
msgid ""
"If you are loading one or several files located outside the default current "
"project folders, you are prompted whether to **Import** them to the project "
"database or to **Load** them from where they are. In the former case files will "
"be copied to the appropriate project folder (PLI, TLV levels and their palettes "
"in the *+drawings* folder; raster images, video clips and audio files in the *"
"+extras* folder; standalone palettes in the *+palettes* folder, etc.) and "
"loaded with a relative path from this new location (see  :ref:`Managing "
"Projects <managing_projects>`  ); in the latter case they will be loaded using "
"an absolute path to their original location."
msgstr ""
"如果要加载位于默认当前项目文件夹之外的一个或多个文件，系统会提示您是将它们**导入"
"**到项目数据库，还是从它们所在的位置**加载**。在前一种情况下，文件将被复制到相应"
"的项目文件夹中（PLI、TLV级别及其调色板在*+图纸*文件夹中；光栅图像、视频剪辑和音"
"频文件在*+extras*文件夹中，独立调色板在*+palettes*文件夹中等），并从这个新位置加"
"载相对路径（请参阅：ref:“管理项目<manageing_Projects>”）；在后一种情况下，它们将"
"使用到其原始位置的绝对路径加载。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:119
msgid ""
"If any of the files you want to import has the same name of a file already "
"existing in the destination project folder, you will prompted whether to keep "
"the existing file, overwrite it with the new one, or rename it by adding a "
"suffix you can choose. In this way you can control if files you are importing "
"have already been imported previously, or manage files that just share the same "
"name."
msgstr ""
"如果要导入的任何文件与目标项目文件夹中已存在的文件同名，系统将提示您是保留现有文"
"件、用新文件覆盖还是通过添加您可以选择的后缀重命名。通过这种方式，您可以控制要导"
"入的文件是否以前已导入，或者管理仅共享相同名称的文件。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:121
msgid ""
"**WARNING:** It is heavily recomended to **Import** assets to the current "
"project folders, as OpenToonz can ovewrite the files associated with levels "
"exposed in the Xsheet/Timeline, each time the **Save Level**, **Save All "
"Levels**, or **Save All** commands are invoked."
msgstr ""
"**警告：**强烈建议**将**资产导入当前项目文件夹，因为每次调用**保存级别**、**保存"
"所有级别**或**保存所有**命令时，OpenToonz都可以重写与Xsheet/Timeline中公开的级别"
"相关的文件。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:123
msgid ""
"Files loaded in a scene without importing can be imported later all at once by "
"using the **Collect Assets** command (see  :ref:`Collecting Assets "
"<collecting_assets>`  )."
msgstr ""
"稍后可以使用**Collect Assets**命令一次性导入场景中加载但未导入的文件（请参见："
"ref:` Collecting Assets<Collecting_Assets>`）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:125
msgid ""
"The OpenToonz file browser displays only the relevant files that can be loaded "
"in OpenToonz. To check the full content of a folder you can use the **Show "
"Folder Contents** option (see below)."
msgstr ""
"OpenToonz文件浏览器仅显示可以在OpenToonz中加载的相关文件。要查看文件夹的完整内"
"容，您可以使用**显示文件夹内容**选项（见下文）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:127
msgid "**To choose the browser display mode:**"
msgstr "**要选择浏览器显示模式，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:129 ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:161
#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:177 ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:207
