#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:131
msgid ""
"Click the Icon button (|thumbnails|) in the bottom bar of the browser to "
"display files with the related icons."
msgstr "单击浏览器底部栏中的图标按钮（|缩略图|）以显示具有相关图标的文件。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:133
msgid ""
"Click the List button (|list|) in the bottom bar of the browser to display "
"files in a list with related s; click the labels at the top of the  columns to "
"sort files accordingly; right-click the label at the top of the  columns to "
"open the menu that allows to toggle the visualization of the  columns."
msgstr ""
"点击浏览器底部栏中的列表按钮（|List|），以列表形式显示文件及其相关内容；单击列顶"
"部的标签，对文件进行相应排序；右键单击列顶部的标签，打开允许切换列可视化的菜单。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:135
msgid "**To resize the browser sections:**"
msgstr "**要调整浏览器部分的大小，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:137 ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:563
#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1451
msgid "Do any of the following:"
msgstr "执行以下任一操作："

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:139 ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:565
msgid "Click and drag the separator to resize sections."
msgstr "单击并拖动分隔符以调整截面大小。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:141 ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:567
msgid "Click and drag the separator towards the window border to hide a section."
msgstr "单击并将分隔符拖动到窗口边框以隐藏部分。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:143
msgid ""
"Click and drag the separator collapsed to the window border toward the window "
"center to display again the hidden section."
msgstr "单击并将折叠的分隔符向窗口中心拖动到窗口边界，以再次显示隐藏部分。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:145 ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:571
msgid "**To rename an existing folder:**"
msgstr "单击并将折叠的分隔符向窗口中心拖动到窗口边界，以再次显示隐藏部分。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:147 ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:573
msgid "Double-click the folder name and rename it."
msgstr "双击文件夹名称并重命名。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:149 ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:575
msgid "**To create a new folder:**"
msgstr "**要创建新文件夹，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:151
msgid ""
"Click the new folder button (|new_folder|) in the bottom bar of the browser."
msgstr "单击浏览器底部栏中的新文件夹按钮（|new_folder|）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:153
msgid "**To move one folder up in the file tree:**"
msgstr "**要在文件树中向上移动一个文件夹，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:155
msgid "Click the folder up button (|folder_up|) in the bottom bar of the browser."
msgstr "单击浏览器底部栏中的文件夹向上按钮（|folder_up|）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:157
msgid "**To load levels from the Load Level browser:**"
msgstr "**要从“加载级别”浏览器加载级别，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:159 ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:173
msgid ""
"Select the Xsheet/Timeline cell where you want to start exposing the level; if "
"any level is already exposed in that cell, a new column/layer will be inserted "
"to expose the new level."
msgstr ""
"选择要开始显示级别的Xsheet/Timeline单元格；如果该单元格中已经暴露了任何级别，则"
"将插入一个新的列/层来暴露新级别。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:163
msgid "Choose Level  →  **Load Level...**"
msgstr "选择级别→  **负载水平。..**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:165
msgid ""
"Right-click in the Xsheet/Timeline cell and choose **Load Level...** from the "
"menu that opens."
msgstr ""
"在Xsheet/Timeline单元格中单击鼠标右键，然后选择**加载级别。..**从打开的菜单中选"
"择。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:167
msgid ""
"In the browser that opens select the file you want to load as a level; if you "
"select a video or image sequence file, you can select the frame range you want "
"to load by using the **Load Subsequence Level** options."
msgstr ""
"在打开的浏览器中，选择要作为级别加载的文件；如果选择视频或图像序列文件，则可以使"
"用**加载子序列级别**选项选择要加载的帧范围。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:169
msgid "Click the Load button."
msgstr "单击“加载”按钮。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:171
msgid "**To load levels from the OpenToonz standard browser:**"
msgstr "**要从OpenToonz标准浏览器加载级别：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:175
msgid "In the OpenToonz browser select the file you want to load as a level."
msgstr "在OpenToonz浏览器中，选择要作为级别加载的文件。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:179
msgid "Drag and drop the selection to the Scene Cast pane or to the Viewer."
msgstr "将所选内容拖放到“场景投射”窗格或查看器中。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:181 ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:666
msgid ""
"Drag and drop the selection to the Xsheet/Timeline cell where you want to start "
"exposing it."
msgstr "将所选内容拖放到要开始显示它的Xsheet/Timeline单元格中。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:183
msgid "Right-click the selection and choose **Load** from the menu that opens."
msgstr "右键单击所选内容，然后从打开的菜单中选择**加载**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:185
msgid ""
"Files can also be loaded by dragging and dropping them from the Windows "
"Explorer or macOS Finder to the Scene Cast, Xsheet/Timeline or Viewer."
msgstr ""
"也可以通过将文件从Windows资源管理器或macOS Finder拖放到场景投射、Xsheet/Timeline"
"或查看器来加载文件。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:187
msgid "**To load folders:**"
msgstr "**要加载文件夹，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:189
msgid ""
"Select the Xsheet/Timeline cell where you want to start exposing the levels; if "
"any level is already exposed in that cell, a new column/layer will be inserted "
"to expose the new levels."
msgstr ""
"选择要开始显示级别的Xsheet/Timeline单元格；如果该单元格中已经暴露了任何级别，则"
"将插入一个新的列/层来暴露新的级别。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:191
msgid "Use the File  →  **Load Folder...** command."
msgstr "使用文件→  **加载文件夹。..**命令。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:193
msgid "In the File Browser that opens select the folder you want to load."
msgstr "在打开的文件浏览器中，选择要加载的文件夹。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:195
msgid "Press the **OK** button."
msgstr "按下**确定**按钮。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:197
msgid ""
"Folders can also be loaded by dragging and dropping them from the Windows "
"Explorer or macOS Finder to the scene cast, Xsheet/Timeline, or Viewer."
msgstr ""
"还可以通过将文件夹从Windows资源管理器或macOS Finder拖放到场景投射、Xsheet/"
"Timeline或查看器来加载文件夹。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:199
msgid ""
"When a level is loaded, OpenToonz checks if its syntax matches one of the level "
"formats specified in Preferences  →  Loading  →  **Level Settings by File "
"Format**. In this case the Level Settings specified when the corresponding "
"**Edit** button is opened will be applied. It is possible to add as many file "
"formats as you want, defining them by using a Regular Expression. This way, "
"different settings can be automatically applied to different kind of levels."
msgstr ""
"加载级别时，OpenToonz会检查其语法是否与首选项中指定的级别格式之一匹配→  加载中"
"→  **按文件格式设置级别**。在这种情况下，将应用打开相应的**编辑**按钮时指定的级"
"别设置。可以添加任意数量的文件格式，并使用正则表达式定义它们。这样，不同的设置可"
"以自动应用于不同类型的级别。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:201
msgid "**To load back a recently loaded level:**"
msgstr "**要重新加载最近加载的级别：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:203
msgid ""
"Choose Level  →  **Open Recent Level File**, then select the level you want to "
"load from the available submenu."
msgstr "选择级别→  **打开“最近级别文件”**，然后从可用子菜单中选择要加载的级别。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:205
msgid "**To make a multiple selection in the file browser:**"
msgstr "**要在文件浏览器中进行多选，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:209
msgid "Click to select a file."
msgstr "单击以选择文件。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:211
msgid ""
"Ctrl-click (PC) or Cmd-click (Mac) to add to or remove a file from the "
"selection."
msgstr "Ctrl键单击（PC）或Cmd键单击（Mac）可在选择中添加或删除文件。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:213 ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:591
#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:656 ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:872
msgid "Shift-click to extend the selection."
msgstr "按住Shift键并单击以扩展选择。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:215
msgid ""
"Right-click in the right area of the browser and choose **Select All** from the "
"menu that opens to select all the files contained in the current folder."
msgstr ""
"在浏览器的右侧区域单击鼠标右键，然后从打开的菜单中选择**全选**，以选择当前文件夹"
"中包含的所有文件。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:217
msgid "**To view a level in the flipbook:**"
msgstr "**要查看活页夹中的标高，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:221
msgid ""
"In the OpenToonz browser or in the Xsheet/Timeline right-click the level you "
"want to view and choose **View** from the menu that opens."
msgstr ""
"在OpenToonz浏览器或Xsheet/Timeline中，右键单击要查看的级别，然后从打开的菜单中选"
"择**查看**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:223
msgid ""
"Choose Windows  →  **Flipbook** and drag and drop in the window the file you "
"want to view."
msgstr "选择Windows→  **动画书**，然后将要查看的文件拖放到窗口中。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:225
msgid ""
"By opening several Flipbook windows you can view several levels at the same "
"time."
msgstr "通过打开多个动画书窗口，您可以同时查看多个级别。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:227
msgid "**To set the default shrink factor and step for the file Viewer:**"
msgstr "**要设置文件查看器的默认收缩因子和步长，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:229
msgid "Choose File  →  Preferences...  →  Interface."
msgstr "选择文件→  偏好。..  →  接口。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:231
msgid "Set the default **Viewer Shrink** and **Step** values."
msgstr "设置默认的**查看器收缩**和**步进**值。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:233
msgid "**To view a level file information:**"
msgstr "**要查看级别文件信息，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:235
msgid ""
"In the OpenToonz browser or in the Xsheet/Timeline right-click the level whose "
"info you want to view and choose **Info** from the menu that opens; if the file "
"is a video or a sequence of images, use the slider at the bottom of the box to "
"change the current frame and see the related information."
msgstr ""
"在OpenToonz浏览器或Xsheet/Timeline中，右键单击要查看其信息的级别，然后从打开的菜"
"单中选择**信息**；如果文件是视频或图像序列，请使用框底部的滑块更改当前帧并查看相"
"关信息。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:237
msgid "**To view the entire contents of the current folder:**"
msgstr "**要查看当前文件夹的全部内容，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:239
msgid ""
"Right-click in the right area of the browser and choose **Show Folder "
"Contents** from the menu that opens: the entire folder contents are displayed "
"in a default OS window."
msgstr ""
"在浏览器的右侧区域单击鼠标右键，然后从打开的菜单中选择**显示文件夹内容**：整个文"
"件夹内容显示在默认操作系统窗口中。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:245
msgid "Loading Photoshop Documents"
msgstr "加载Photoshop文档"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:246
msgid ""
"Photoshop documents (PSD files) can be loaded as a scene element in OpenToonz "
"taking into account the layers the document is made of, and their layering "
"order; text layers are considered as standard layers, while layer styles are "
"considered only when loading the document as a single image (see below)."
msgstr ""
"Photoshop文档（PSD文件）可以在OpenToonz中作为场景元素加载，同时考虑到文档的图层"
"及其分层顺序；文本图层被视为标准图层，而图层样式仅在将文档作为单个图像加载时才被"
"考虑（见下文）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:248
msgid ""
"Supported formats are RGB or grayscale images, using 8 or 16 bits per channel "
"color depth."
msgstr "支持的格式是RGB或灰度图像，每个通道使用8或16位颜色深度。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:250
msgid "|load_psd|"
msgstr "|load_psd|"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:252
msgid ""
"When a Photoshop document is loaded, a dialog opens to set the way the document "
"has to be exposed in the Xsheet. Options are the following:"
msgstr ""
"加载Photoshop文档时，会打开一个对话框，设置文档在Xsheet中的显示方式。选项如下："

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:254
msgid ""
"**Single Image**, flattens all the document layers into a single image. Only "
"layers that were visible when the Photoshop document was saved are considered. "
"The level name and path in Level Settings, and the scene cast, refer to the "
"original name of the Photoshop document (see  :ref:`Editing Level Settings "
"<editing_level_settings>`  and  :ref:`Using the Scene Cast "
"<using_the_scene_cast>`  )."
msgstr ""
"**单张图像**，将所有文档层平铺成一张图像。仅考虑保存Photoshop文档时可见的图"
"层。“级别设置”中的级别名称和路径以及场景投射是指Photoshop文档的原始名称（请参"
"阅：ref:“编辑级别设置<Editing_level_Settings>”和：ref：“使用场景投射"
"<Using_The_scene_cast>”）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:256
msgid ""
"Photoshop documents can be loaded as a Single Image only if the *Maximize "
"Compatibility* option was checked when saving the original file from Photoshop. "
"If the option was deactivated, a dummy image is displayed instead; loading and "
"saving again the document with the option activated fixes the problem."
msgstr ""
"只有在从Photoshop保存原始文件时选中了“最大化兼容性”选项，Photoshop文档才能作为单"
"张图像加载。如果该选项被禁用，则会显示一个虚拟图像；在激活选项的情况下再次加载和"
"保存文档可以解决问题。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:258
msgid ""
"**Frames**, loads each document layer as a frame, and exposes them as a "
"sequence in an Xsheet column. Any layer group defined in the original document "
"is ignored. The level name and path in Level Settings, and the Scene Cast, "
"refer to the original name of the Photoshop document with the #frames suffix "
"(see  :ref:`Editing Level Settings <editing_level_settings>`  and  :ref:`Using "
"the Scene Cast <using_the_scene_cast>`  )."
msgstr ""
"**Frames**，将每个文档层作为框架加载，并在Xsheet列中将其作为序列公开。原始文档中"
"定义的任何图层组都将被忽略。“级别设置”中的级别名称和路径以及“场景投射”是指带有"
"#frames后缀的Photoshop文档的原始名称（请参阅：ref:“编辑级别设置"
"<Editing_level_Settings>”和：ref：“使用场景投射<Using_The_Scene_Cast>”）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:260
msgid ""
"**Columns**, loads each document layer as a column, and it is possible to "
"automatically create a Sub-Xsheet containing the columns by activating the "
"**Expose in a Sub-Xsheet** option."
msgstr ""
"**Columns**，将每个文档层作为一列加载，并且可以通过激活**在子Xsheet**中显示**选"
"项自动创建包含这些列的子Xsheet。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:263
msgid ""
"When a Photoshop document is loaded as Columns, it is also possible to set how "
"new Level Names asre assigned. Options are the following:"
msgstr ""
"当Photoshop文档作为列加载时，还可以设置如何重新分配新的级别名称。选项如下："

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:265
msgid ""
"**FileName#LayerName**, uses the PSD file name and layer names as the names of "
"newly created levels."
msgstr "**FileName#LayerName**使用PSD文件名和图层名作为新创建的级别的名称。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:267
msgid ""
"**LayerName**, uses the PSD layer names as the names of newly created levels."
msgstr "**LayerName**使用PSD层名称作为新创建的级别的名称。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:270
msgid ""
"When a Photoshop document is loaded as Columns, it is also possible to set the "
"way groups of layers have to be considered. Options are the following:"
msgstr "当Photoshop文档作为列加载时，还可以设置考虑图层组的方式。选项如下："

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:272
msgid ""
"**Ignore groups**, overlooks any group of layers defined in the document, and "
"each layer is exposed in a different column. The level name and path in Level "
"Settings, and the scene cast, for each level refer to the original name of the "
"Photoshop document with the #layerName suffix (see  :ref:`Editing Level "
"Settings <editing_level_settings>`  and  :ref:`Using the Scene Cast "
"<using_the_scene_cast>`  )."
msgstr ""
"**忽略组**，忽略文档中定义的任何图层组，每个图层都显示在不同的列中。“级别设置”中"
"的级别名称和路径，以及每个级别的场景转换，都是指带有#layerName后缀的Photoshop文"
"档的原始名称（请参阅：ref:“编辑级别设置<Editing_level_Settings>”和：ref：“使用场"
"景转换<Using_The_scene_cast>”）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:274
msgid ""
"**Expose layers in a group as columns in a Sub-Xsheet**, creates for each group "
"a Sub-Xsheet containing each layer of the group as a column. If a group "
"contains other groups, the Sub-Xsheet will contain other Sub-Xsheets that will "
"contain the related layers as columns. The level name and path in Level "
"Settings, and the scene cast, for each level refer to the original name of the "
"Photoshop document with the #layerID suffix (see  :ref:`Editing Level Settings "
"<editing_level_settings>`  and  :ref:`Using the Scene Cast "
"<using_the_scene_cast>`  )."
msgstr ""
"**将组中的图层显示为子Xsheet**中的列，为每个组创建一个子Xsheet，其中包含该组的每"
"个图层作为列。如果一个组包含其他组，则子X表格将包含其他子X表格，这些子X表格会将"
"相关图层作为列。“级别设置”中的级别名称和路径，以及每个级别的场景转换，都是指带有"
"#layerID后缀的Photoshop文档的原始名称（请参阅：ref:“编辑级别设置"
"<Editing_level_Settings>”和：ref：“使用场景转换<Using_The_scene_cast>”）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:276
msgid ""
"**Expose layers in a group as frames in a column**, creates for each group a "
"column containing each layer of the group as a cell. If a group contains other "
"groups, they will be ignored. The level name and path in Level Settings, and "
"the scene cast, for each level refer to the original name of the Photoshop "
"document with the #groupID#group suffix (see  :ref:`Editing Level Settings "
"<editing_level_settings>`  and  :ref:`Using the Scene Cast "
"<using_the_scene_cast>`  )."
msgstr ""
"**将组中的图层显示为列**中的框架，为每个组创建一个列，其中包含该组的每一层作为单"
"元格。如果一个组包含其他组，它们将被忽略。“级别设置”中的级别名称和路径，以及每个"
"级别的场景投射，都是指带有#groupID#组后缀的Photoshop文档的原始名称（请参阅："
"ref:“编辑级别设置<Editing_level_Settings>”和：ref：“使用场景投射"
"<Using_The_scene_cast>”）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:278
msgid ""
"In order to be properly displayed in the final rendering, images based on "
"Photoshop document layers have to be premultiplied either using the "
"**Premultiply** option in the Level Settings dialog, or the Premultiply effect "
"(see  :ref:`Editing Level Settings <editing_level_settings>`  and  :ref:"
"`Premultiply <premultiply>`  )."
msgstr ""
"为了在最终渲染中正确显示，基于Photoshop文档层的图像必须使用“级别设置”对话框中的"
"**预乘**选项或预乘效果进行预乘（请参阅：ref:“编辑级别设置"
"<Editing_Level_Settings>”和：ref:`预乘<premultiple>”）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:284
msgid "Executing Tasks in the File Browser"
msgstr "在文件浏览器中执行任务"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:285
msgid "Some tasks concerning files can be executed directly in the File Browser."
msgstr "一些与文件有关的任务可以直接在文件浏览器中执行。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:287
msgid ""
"Files can be duplicated, converted to a different format, converted to TLV "
"(Toonz Raster image) format, renamed, premultiplied, and you can choose to "
"separate their colors."
msgstr ""
"文件可以复制、转换为其他格式、转换为TLV（Toanz Raster图像）格式、重命名、预倍"
"增，您可以选择分离它们的颜色。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:289
msgid ""
"When duplicating files, the new files will be renamed by appending an "
"underscore followed by progressive numbering."
msgstr "复制文件时，新文件将通过添加下划线和递增编号进行重命名。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:291
msgid ""
"You can also separate the colors of an image or image sequence by using the "
"**Separate Colors...** command. For more details on its options, please see "
"the  :ref:`Separate Colors <separate_colors>`  section."
msgstr ""
"您还可以使用**分离颜色来分离图像或图像序列的颜色。..**命令。有关其选项的更多详细"
"信息，请参阅：ref:`单独的颜色<Separate_Colors>部分。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:293
msgid ""
"When renaming, files will be renamed according to the name you specify; an "
"option allows you also to delete the original files. This can be used both for "
"renaming sequences of image files in one shot, and for converting sequence "
"numbering modes to the OpenToonz standard one (i.e. a progressive four-digits "
"number written between the file name and the file extension) by selecting only "
"the first file of a sequence."
msgstr ""
"重命名时，文件将根据您指定的名称重命名；一个选项还允许您删除原始文件。这既可用于"
"重命名一次拍摄中的图像文件序列，也可用于通过仅选择序列的第一个文件将序列编号模式"
"转换为OpenToonz标准模式（即在文件名和文件扩展名之间写入的递增四位数）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:295
msgid ""
"When premultiplied, the file alpha channel is modified to be properly displayed "
"in OpenToonz. Images which have a meaningful alpha channel come in two types: "
"premultiplied or straight. A non-premultiplied (straight) image can be "
"recognized when it's loaded in OpenToonz because its edges, where there is a "
"complete transparence on one side and opacity on the other, are not smooth, but "
"displays show a solid halo; by premultiplying the image it's possible to fix "
"this problem. This is available only for full-color images."
msgstr ""
"当预乘时，文件alpha通道会被修改为在OpenToonz中正确显示。具有有意义阿尔法通道的图"
"像有两种类型：预乘或直线。当在OpenToonz中加载非预乘（直）图像时，可以识别出它，"
"因为它的边缘是不平滑的，一侧是完全透明的，另一侧是不透明的，但显示器显示出一个实"
"心光晕；通过对图像进行预乘，可以解决这个问题。这仅适用于全色图像。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:297
msgid ""
"When converting files, a dialog prompts the frame range to convert, a saving "
"location, a name, the new format with related options and a color for the "
"background of the converted file. It is also possible to select more files at "
"once but, in this case, the frame range and the file name fields won’t be "
"available. All levels, images and clips supported by OpenToonz can be "
"converted. The PLI vector files can also be converted to the SVG format."
msgstr ""
"转换文件时，会出现一个对话框，提示要转换的帧范围、保存位置、名称、具有相关选项的"
"新格式以及转换文件背景的颜色。也可以一次选择更多文件，但在这种情况下，帧范围和文"
"件名字段将不可用。OpenToonz支持的所有级别、图像和剪辑都可以转换。PLI矢量文件也可"
"以转换为SVG格式。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:299
msgid ""
"The **Convert...** command is also available in the File menu as **Convert "
"File...**."
msgstr "**转换。..**命令在“文件”菜单中也可用作**转换文件。..**."

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:301
msgid ""
"When converting files to TLV format, it's possible to choose the painted or "
"unpainted TLV formats; all levels, images and clips supported by OpenToonz can "
"be converted, except for PSD files."
msgstr ""
"在将文件转换为TLV格式时，可以选择已绘制或未绘制的TLV格式；OpenToonz支持的所有级"
"别、图像和剪辑都可以转换，PSD文件除外。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:303
msgid ""
"The conversion to the unpainted TLV format is available when one or several "
"files are selected and it's meant for lineart images: the images and levels are "
"converted into black lineart images with a transparent background, so that they "
"can be painted with the same techniques and tools you can use for other Toonz "
"Raster levels (see  :ref:`Painting Animation Levels "
"<painting_animation_levels>`  ). In particular if images have some "
"transparency, transparent pixels remain transparent, while solid pixels are "
"transformed into black ones; if images have no transparency, white and lighter "
"pixels will be assumed as transparent, while dark pixels are transformed into "
"black ones."
msgstr ""
"当选择一个或多个文件时，可以转换为未绘制的TLV格式，这是针对线条图像的：图像和级"
"别被转换为具有透明背景的黑色线条图像，这样它们就可以使用与其他Toanz光栅级别相同"
"的技术和工具进行绘制（请参阅：ref:“绘制动画级别<Painting_Animation_levels>”）。"
"特别是如果图像具有一定的透明度，透明像素保持透明，而实心像素则转换为黑色像素；如"
"果图像没有透明度，则白色和较亮的像素将被视为透明，而暗像素将被转换为黑色。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:305
msgid ""
"The conversion to the painted TLV format is available when two files are "
"selected or when the selected files are Raster Full color without antialiasing. "
"In the case of the two files, one is meant to be the lineart and the other a "
"painted version of the same image: the images and levels are converted into "
"painted lineart images with a palette, so that they can be edited with the same "
"techniques and tools you can use for other Toonz Raster levels (see  :ref:"
"`Managing Palettes and Styles <managing_palettes_and_styles>`  and  :ref:"
"`Painting Animation Levels <painting_animation_levels>`  ). In the case of "
"conversion from Raster Full color without antialiasing, an Heuristic is used to "
"recognize lines and painted areas creating a TLV level where the lines are seen "
"as ink and the painted areas as paint."
msgstr ""
"当选择两个文件或所选文件为无抗锯齿的光栅全色时，可以转换为绘制的TLV格式。对于这"
"两个文件，一个是线性艺术，另一个是同一图像的绘制版本：图像和级别通过调色板转换为"
"绘制的线性艺术图像，这样就可以使用与其他Toanz光栅级别相同的技术和工具进行编辑"
"（请参阅：ref:“管理调色板和样式<manageing_pletes_and_Styles>”和：ref:`绘制动画级"
"别<Painting_Animation_levels>”）。在不进行抗锯齿的情况下从光栅全色转换的情况下，"
"使用启发式方法来识别线条和绘制区域，从而创建TLV级别，其中线条被视为墨水，绘制区"
"域被视为油漆。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:307
msgid ""
"In particular if images have some transparency, transparent pixels remains "
"transparent, while solid pixels are transformed into lines according to their "
"color; if images have no transparency, white and lighter pixels will be assumed "
"as transparent, while dark pixels are transformed into black lines."
msgstr ""
"特别是如果图像具有一定的透明度，透明像素保持透明，而实心像素则根据其颜色转换为线"
"条；如果图像没有透明度，则白色和较亮的像素将被视为透明，而暗像素将被转换为黑线。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:309
msgid ""
"When converting to the TLV format, sequence numbering modes different from the "
"OpenToonz standard one (i.e. a progressive four-digits number written between "
"the file name and the file extension) are supported, so that only the first "
"file of a sequence is required to be selected to include the whole sequence in "
"the conversion."
msgstr ""
"转换为TLV格式时，支持与OpenToonz标准不同的序列编号模式（即在文件名和文件扩展名之"
"间写入的递增四位数），因此只需要选择序列的第一个文件，即可将整个序列包含在转换"
"中。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:311
msgid "**To Duplicate files:**"
msgstr "**要复制文件，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:313
msgid "Select the files you want to duplicate."
msgstr "选择要复制的文件。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:315
msgid ""
"Right-click any of the selected files and choose **Duplicate** from the menu "
"that opens."
msgstr "右键单击任何选定的文件，然后从打开的菜单中选择**复制**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:317
msgid "**To Rename files:**"
msgstr "**要重命名文件，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:319
msgid "Select the files you want to rename."
msgstr "选择要重命名的文件。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:321
msgid ""
"Right-click any of the selected files and choose **Rename** from the menu that "
"opens."
msgstr "右键单击任何选定的文件，然后从打开的菜单中选择**重命名**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:323
msgid "|rename|"
msgstr "|rename|"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:325
msgid ""
"In the dialog that opens assign a new name to the file and choose whether to "
"**Delete Original Files** by activating the related option."
msgstr ""
"在打开的对话框中，为文件指定一个新名称，并通过激活相关选项选择是否删除原始文件。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:327
msgid "Click the **Rename** button."
msgstr "单击**重命名**按钮。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:329
msgid "**To Premultiply full-color images:**"
msgstr "**要预乘全彩图像，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:331
msgid "Select the files you want to premultiply."
msgstr "选择要预乘的文件。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:333
msgid ""
"Right-click any of the selected files and choose **Premultiply** from the menu "
"that opens."
msgstr "右键单击任何选定的文件，然后从打开的菜单中选择**预乘**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:335
msgid "**To Convert a file to a different format:**"
msgstr "**要将文件转换为其他格式，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:337
msgid ""
"Right-click the file you want to convert and choose **Convert...** from the "
"menu that opens. The Convert window change depending on the format of the "
"selected files."
msgstr ""
"右键单击要转换的文件，然后选择**转换。..**从打开的菜单中选择。“转换”窗口会根据所"
"选文件的格式而变化。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:339
msgid "|convert|"
msgstr "|convert|"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:341
msgid ""
"Choose the frame range to convert, the saving location, a name, the new format, "
"and the background color of the converted file."
msgstr "选择要转换的帧范围、保存位置、名称、新格式和转换文件的背景颜色。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:343 ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:361
msgid ""
"Activate the **Skip Existing Files** to to prevent overwriting already exixting "
"files."
msgstr "激活**跳过现有文件**以防止覆盖已存在的文件。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:345
msgid ""
"If needed, set the options for the file format chosen pressing the **Options** "
"button and inserting the new values."
msgstr "如果需要，按**选项**按钮并插入新值，为所选文件格式设置选项。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:347 ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:365
#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:387 ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:413
#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:431
msgid "Click the **Convert** button."
msgstr "单击**转换**按钮。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:349
msgid "**To Convert several files at once to a different format:**"
msgstr "**要同时将多个文件转换为其他格式，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:351
msgid "Select the files you want to convert."
msgstr "选择要转换的文件。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:353 ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:393
msgid ""
"Right-click any of the selected files and choose **Convert...** from the menu "
"that opens."
msgstr "右键单击任何选定的文件，然后选择**转换。..**从打开的菜单中选择。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:355
msgid "|convert_several|"
msgstr "|转换器_多个|"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:357
msgid ""
"Check the number of files you are going to convert reading the value from the "
"header of the Convert window."
msgstr "从“转换”窗口的标题读取值，检查要转换的文件数量。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:359
msgid ""
"Choose the saving location, the new format, and the background color of the "
"converted files."
msgstr "选择转换文件的保存位置、新格式和背景颜色。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:363
msgid ""
"If needed, set the options for the file format chosen pressing the Options "
"button and inserting the new values."
msgstr "如果需要，按“选项”按钮并插入新值，为所选文件格式设置选项。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:367
msgid "**To Convert files to the unpainted TLV format:**"
msgstr "**要将文件转换为未绘制的TLV格式，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:369
msgid "Select the lineart files you want to convert."
msgstr "选择要转换的线性艺术文件。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:371
msgid ""
"Right-click any of the selected files and choose **Convert** from the menu that "
"opens."
msgstr "右键单击任何选定的文件，然后从打开的菜单中选择**转换**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:373
msgid "|convert_tlv_unpainted|"
msgstr "|convert_tlv_unpainted|"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:375
msgid "Select **Unpainted tlv** from the Mode drop down menu."
msgstr "从模式下拉菜单中选择**未涂漆tlv**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:377 ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:399
#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:421
msgid ""
"Choose the saving location and, if you have selected one sequence, the frame "
"range."
msgstr "选择保存位置，如果选择了一个序列，则选择帧范围。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:379 ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:401
#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:423
msgid ""
"Activate the **Skip Existing Files** to to prevent overwriting already existing "
"files."
msgstr "激活**跳过现有文件**以防止覆盖现有文件。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:381 ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:407
msgid "Activate the **Apply Autoclose**."
msgstr "激活**应用自动关闭**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:383 ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:409
msgid ""
"Choose how to manage Antialiasing fom the drop down menu. You can preserve the "
"original antialiasing selecting **Keep Original Antialiasing**; add some "
"antialiasing selecting **Add Antialiasing with Intensity:** and writing an "
"intensity value in the righthand input field; remove the antialiasing selecting "
"the **Remove Antialiasing using Threshold:** option and writing a threshold "
"value in the righthand input field."
msgstr ""
"从下拉菜单中选择如何管理抗锯齿。您可以选择保留原始抗锯齿**；选择**添加抗锯齿和强"
"度：**并在右侧输入字段中写入强度值；删除抗锯齿，选择**使用阈值删除抗锯齿：**选"
"项，并在右侧输入字段中写入阈值。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:385 ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:411
msgid ""
"Choose how to manage the Palette of the TLV file(s) you are going to create. By "
"default a new palette will be created. If you prefer to use an existing palette "
"press the button next the palette field and use the Browser to locate the "
"palette file (TPL) you wish to use. Set a **Tolerance** value for the "
"correlation between the RGB value of the areas and the indexes color of the "
"palette."
msgstr ""
"选择如何管理要创建的TLV文件的调色板。默认情况下，将创建一个新的调色板。如果您更"
"喜欢使用现有的调色板，请按调色板字段旁边的按钮，并使用浏览器查找要使用的调色板文"
"件（TPL）。为区域的RGB值和调色板的索引颜色之间的相关性设置一个**容差**值。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:389
msgid "**To Convert files to the painted TLV format from two images:**"
msgstr "**要将文件从两个图像转换为绘制的TLV格式：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:391
msgid ""
"Select the lineart file and the painted version of the same file you want to "
"convert."
msgstr "选择要转换的线性艺术文件和同一文件的绘制版本。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:395
msgid "|convert_tlv_painted|"
msgstr "|convert_tlv_painted|"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:397
msgid "Select **Painted tlv from two images** from the Mode drop down menu."
msgstr "从模式下拉菜单中选择**两幅图像中的Painted tlv**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:403
msgid "Choose the folder where the unpainted files are located."
msgstr "选择未绘制文件所在的文件夹。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:405
msgid ""
"Specify the Unpainted File Suffix used for naming the unpainted version of the "
"files (default is _np, but you can use anything you like when preparing the "
"files for convertion)."
msgstr ""
"指定用于命名文件未涂漆版本的未涂漆文件后缀（默认值为_np，但在准备文件进行转换"
"时，您可以使用任何您喜欢的名称）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:415
msgid "**To Convert files to the painted TLV format from non AA source:**"
msgstr "**要将文件从非AA源转换为绘制的TLV格式：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:417
msgid "Select the *raster full color* file you want to convert."
msgstr "选择要转换的*光栅全彩*文件。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:419
msgid "|convert_tlv_painted_noaa|"
msgstr "|convert_tlv_painted_noaa|"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:425
msgid "Choose the output folder."
msgstr "选择输出文件夹。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:427
msgid "Activate the **Apply Autoclose** if needed."
msgstr "如果需要，激活**应用自动关闭**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:429
msgid ""
"Choose how to manage the Palette of the TLV file(s) you are going to create. By "
"default a new palette will be created. If you prefer to use an existing palette "
"press the button next the palette field and use the Browser to locate the "
"palette file (TPL) you wish to use."
msgstr ""
"选择如何管理要创建的TLV文件的调色板。默认情况下，将创建一个新的调色板。如果您更"
"喜欢使用现有的调色板，请按调色板字段旁边的按钮，并使用浏览器查找要使用的调色板文"
"件（TPL）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:437
msgid "Separate Colors"
msgstr "单独的颜色"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:439
msgid ""
"The **Separate Colors** feature, allows for separating single drawing by colors "
"of pencils, generating independent image files to make it easier to use them in "
"a subsequent compositing workflow."
msgstr ""
"**分离颜色**功能允许按铅笔的颜色分离单个绘图，生成独立的图像文件，以便在后续的合"
"成工作流程中更容易使用它们。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:441
msgid "|separate_colors|"
msgstr "|separate_colors|"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:443
msgid ""
"Unlike conventional *threshold-based* algorithms, this feature can produce more "
"natural results, since it separates pixels in a more flexible way, by using the "
"HLS color space."
msgstr ""
"与传统的基于阈值的算法不同，该功能可以产生更自然的结果，因为它通过使用HLS颜色空"
"间以更灵活的方式分离像素。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:445
msgid ""
"Currently this is a \"utility\" feature, which means that it's independent from "
"the current loaded scene or active project. It just works on selected raster "
"image files in the File Browser."
msgstr ""
"目前，这是一个“实用程序”功能，这意味着它独立于当前加载的场景或活动项目。它仅适用"
"于文件浏览器中选定的光栅图像文件。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:447
msgid ""
"The produced output images contain an alpha channel equal to the line intensity."
msgstr "生成的输出图像包含一个等于线强度的阿尔法通道。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:449
msgid ""
"You can compose the line by loading the separated images as levels, or you can "
"also connect the levels to a **MatteIn** effect with some color card if you "
"would like to alter the line color."
msgstr ""
"您可以通过将分离的图像作为级别加载来组合线条，或者如果您想更改线条颜色，也可以使"
"用一些色卡将级别连接到**MatteIn**效果。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:451
msgid "The available parameters are:"
msgstr "可用参数包括："

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:453
msgid "**Preview Frame:**, defines the frame to be shown in the preview area."
msgstr "**预览帧：**，定义要在预览区域中显示的帧。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:455
msgid ""
"**Show Mask**, shows the **Alpha Matting** parameters results in the preview "
"area."
msgstr "**显示蒙版**，在预览区域显示**阿尔法消光**参数结果。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:457
msgid ""
"**Show Alpha**, shows the generated alpha channel in the preview area. This is "
"the alpha channel that will be present in the new generated image files, "
"product of the separation work."
msgstr ""
"**显示Alpha**，在预览区域中显示生成的Alpha通道。这是分离工作的产物，将出现在新生"
"成的图像文件中的阿尔法通道。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:459
msgid ""
"**Pick Color**, lets the user pick a color from the left preview area. The "
"picked color will be assigned to the currently selected color swatch."
msgstr ""
"**选择颜色**，允许用户从左侧预览区域选择颜色。拾取的颜色将分配给当前选定的色样。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:461
msgid ""
"You can click and drag over any of the preview area images to pick an average "
"color for the defined rectangle."
msgstr "您可以单击并拖动任何预览区域图像，为定义的矩形选择平均颜色。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:463
msgid ""
"**Paper Color:**, allows to define the paper color, used to calculate "
"transparency of the separated images."
msgstr "**纸张颜色：**，允许定义纸张颜色，用于计算分离图像的透明度。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:465
msgid ""
"**Main Color:**, allows to define the color for the main ink in the drawings. "
"For better results, it's advised to pick the darkest color possible."
msgstr ""
"**主色：**，允许定义图纸中主墨的颜色。为了获得更好的效果，建议选择尽可能深的颜"
"色。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:467
msgid ""
"**Sub Color1:**, **Sub Color2:** and **Sub Color3:**, allows to define the "
"color for the other respective color inks in the drawings you whish to "
"separate. For better results, it's advised to pick the deepest (darkest, more "
"saturated) color possible."
msgstr ""
"**子颜色1:**、**子颜色2:**和**子颜色3:**，允许定义要分离的图形中其他相应颜色墨水"
"的颜色。为了获得更好的效果，建议选择尽可能深（最深、最饱和）的颜色。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:469
msgid ""
"The **Sub Color3:** parameters will only show when **Sub3** suffix is enabled, "
"in the **File Suffix:** parameters area."
msgstr "**Sub-Color3:**参数仅在**文件后缀：**参数区域中启用**Sub3**后缀时显示。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:471
msgid ""
"**Sub Adjust:**, allows to adjust the prevalence of sub-colors with respect to "
"the black ink."
msgstr "**子调整：**，允许调整子颜色相对于黑色墨水的流行度。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:473
msgid ""
"**Border Smooth**, allows to make the intersection of lines having different "
"colors smoother."
msgstr "**边框平滑**，允许使不同颜色的线条相交更平滑。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:475
msgid ""
"**Alpha Matting**, allows to better remove noisy backgrounds, while preserving "
"subtle faint parts of the pencil's stroke at the sme time."
msgstr ""
"**Alpha Matting**可以更好地去除嘈杂的背景，同时在sme时间保留铅笔笔划的微妙微弱部"
"分。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:477
msgid ""
"To be able to preview the Alpha Matting, the **Show Mask** option at the top of "
"the preview area should be activated."
msgstr "为了能够预览Alpha贴图，应激活预览区域顶部的**显示蒙版**选项。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:479
msgid ""
"**Mask Threshold**, allows to make the noisy background pixels transparent."
msgstr "**遮罩阈值**，允许使嘈杂的背景像素透明。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:481
msgid ""
"The regions to become transparent background in the output image are shown in "
"red or blue colors in the preview area."
msgstr "输出图像中要成为透明背景的区域在预览区域中以红色或蓝色显示。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:483
msgid ""
"**Mask Radius**, can create a solid *border area* around the detected colored "
"strokes, to preserve subtle faint parts of them."
msgstr ""
"**遮罩半径**，可以在检测到的彩色笔划周围创建一个实心*边界区域*，以保留其中微妙的"
"微弱部分。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:485
msgid ""
"**Start:** and **End:**, when separating image sequences it allows to set a "
"frame range for the color separation work to be done."
msgstr ""
"**开始：**和**结束：**，在分离图像序列时，它允许为要完成的颜色分离工作设置帧范"
"围。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:487
msgid ""
"**Format:**, defines the file format to use for the new generated files. "
"Available options are: **PNG** and **TIF**."
msgstr "**格式：**，定义新生成文件使用的文件格式。可用选项有：**PNG**和**TIF**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:489
msgid "**Save in:**, defines where the new generated files will be saved."
msgstr "**保存位置：**，定义新生成文件的保存位置。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:491
msgid ""
"**File Suffix:**, allows the definition of file suffixes for the **Main**, "
"**Sub1**, **Sub2** and **Sub3** color generated image files."
msgstr ""
"**文件后缀：**，允许为**Main**、**Sub1**、**Sub2**和**Sub3**颜色生成的图像文件定"
"义文件后缀。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:493
msgid ""
"If **Sub3** is enabled the left preview area will change to accomodate the new "
"separation color. Also, and additional **Sub Color3:** option will show in the "
"right parameters area."
msgstr ""
"如果启用了**Sub3**，左侧预览区域将更改以适应新的分离颜色。此外，右侧参数区域将显"
"示其他**子颜色3:**选项。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:495
msgid ""
"**Auto**, toggles the automatic preview of the separation in the left preview "
"area."
msgstr "**自动**，切换左侧预览区域中分离的自动预览。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:497
msgid ""
"**Preview**, allows to manually preview the separation in the left preview "
"area. Only active when the **Auto** option is disabled."
msgstr "**预览**，允许在左侧预览区域手动预览分隔。仅在禁用**自动**选项时激活。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:499
msgid ""
"**Separate**, executes the color separation operation on the selected files."
msgstr "**Separate**，对所选文件执行颜色分离操作。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:501
msgid "**To Separate Colors of an image into separate image files:**"
msgstr "**要将图像的颜色分离到单独的图像文件中，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:503
msgid ""
"Right-click the file you want and choose **Separate Colors...** from the menu "
"that opens. The Separate Colors window shows, where you can select several "
"options for the operation."
msgstr ""
"右键单击所需的文件，然后选择**分离颜色。..**从打开的菜单中选择。显示“分离颜色”窗"
"口，您可以在其中为操作选择多个选项。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:505
msgid ""
"Choose the appropriate preview and separation options for the desired result."
msgstr "为所需结果选择适当的预览和分隔选项。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:507
msgid "Press the **Separate** button to execute the color separation job."
msgstr "按**分离**按钮执行分色作业。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:509
msgid "Close the window by pressing the **Close** button."
msgstr "按**关闭**按钮关闭窗口。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:515
msgid "Exposing Levels"
msgstr "暴露水平"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:516
msgid ""
"Toonz level files, images for backgrounds and overlays, audio files, video "
"clips, and other OpenToonz scenes, have to be exposed in the Xsheet/Timeline "
"columns in order to be part of the scene."
msgstr ""
"Toonz级文件、背景和叠加图像、音频文件、视频剪辑和其他OpenToonz场景必须在Xsheet/"
"Timeline列中显示，才能成为场景的一部分。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:518
msgid ""
"If the asset you want to use has already been loaded but not exposed, or it was "
"removed from the scene, it can be retrieved from the Scene Cast window."
msgstr ""
"如果要使用的资源已加载但未公开，或者已从场景中删除，则可以从“场景投射”窗口中检"
"索。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:520
msgid ""
"In case you need to retrieve some specific drawings from an animation level, "
"you can display it in the Level Strip, in order to select the drawings to "
"expose."
msgstr ""
"如果需要从动画级别检索某些特定图形，可以将其显示在级别栏中，以便选择要公开的图"
"形。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:522
msgid ""
"Animation levels you define directly in the scene, for instance levels you "
"scanned, or drew directly in OpenToonz, are automatically exposed in the Xsheet/"
"Timeline."
msgstr ""
"您直接在场景中定义的动画级别，例如您在OpenToonz中扫描或直接绘制的级别，会自动显"
"示在Xsheet/Timeline中。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:528
msgid "Using the Scene Cast"
msgstr "使用场景演员阵容"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:529
msgid ""
"All the animation levels you create or load in the scene are stored in the "
"Scene Cast pane. Levels remain available in the Scene Cast even if they are not "
"used in the scene anymore. From the Scene Cast, they can be exposed, edited, "
"saved and removed."
msgstr ""
"在场景中创建或加载的所有动画级别都存储在“场景投射”窗格中。即使场景中不再使用这些"
"级别，它们在“场景投射”中仍然可用。从“场景投射”中，可以显示、编辑、保存和删除它"
"们。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:531
msgid "|scene_cast|"
msgstr "|scene_cast|"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:533
msgid "In the tree available on the left you can find the following:"
msgstr "在左侧可用的树中，您可以找到以下内容："

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:535
msgid "A clapboard icon referring to the current scene."
msgstr "指向当前场景的隔板图标。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:537
msgid ""
"The **Cast** folder containing all the animation levels you create or load."
msgstr "包含您创建或加载的所有动画级别的**Cast**文件夹。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:539
msgid ""
"The **Audio** folder containing all the audio files you load or create (see  :"
"ref:`Creating a Soundtrack <creating_a_soundtrack>`  )."
msgstr ""
"包含您加载或创建的所有音频文件的**Audio**文件夹（请参阅：ref:`创建音轨"
"<Creating_a_trach>'）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:541
msgid ""
"You can create new folders and sub-folders where animation levels can be "
"arranged. The current location path in the cast tree is displayed in the cast "
"top bar; folders can be renamed and new folders can be created. Levels can be "
"displayed with related icons, or in a list displaying additional informations "
"that can be also used to sort files."
msgstr ""
"您可以创建新的文件夹和子文件夹，在其中可以排列动画级别。转换树中的当前位置路径显"
"示在转换顶部栏中；可以重命名文件夹并创建新文件夹。级别可以与相关图标一起显示，也"
"可以显示在显示其他信息的列表中，这些信息也可以用于对文件进行排序。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:543
msgid ""
"Animation levels that are no longer available at the defined path are "
"identified by a red color."
msgstr "在定义的路径上不再可用的动画级别由红色标识。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:545
msgid "**To display all the cast elements of a specific folder:**"
msgstr "**要显示特定文件夹的所有铸造元素，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:547
msgid "Click the folder icon in the cast tree on the left of the pane."
msgstr "单击窗格左侧的转换树中的文件夹图标。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:549
msgid "**To display all the cast elements:**"
msgstr "**要显示所有铸造元素，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:551
msgid ""
"Click the clapboard icon at the top of the cast tree on the left of the pane."
msgstr "单击窗格左侧投射树顶部的隔板图标。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:553
msgid "**To choose the cast display mode:**"
msgstr "**要选择投射显示模式，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:557
msgid ""
"Click the **Icon** button (|thumbnails|) in the bottom bar of the cast to "
"display levels with the related icons."
msgstr "单击演员阵容底部栏中的**图标**按钮（|缩略图|），显示带有相关图标的关卡。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:559
msgid ""
"Click the **List** button (|list|) in the bottom bar of the cast to display "
"levels in a list; click the labels at the top of the  columns to sort files "
"accordingly."
msgstr ""
"点击演员阵容底部栏中的**列表**按钮（|List|），以列表形式显示级别；单击列顶部的标"
"签以相应地对文件进行排序。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:561
msgid "**To resize the Scene Cast sections:**"
msgstr "**要调整“场景投射”部分的大小，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:569
msgid ""
"Click and drag the separator collapsed to the window border towards the window "
"center to display again the hidden section."
msgstr "单击并将折叠的分隔符向窗口中心拖动到窗口边界，以再次显示隐藏部分。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:577
msgid "Click the **New** button (|new_folder|) in the bottom bar of the cast."
msgstr "单击铸件底部栏中的**新建**按钮（|New_folder|）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:579
msgid "**To move one folder up in the cast tree:**"
msgstr "**要在转换树中向上移动一个文件夹，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:581
msgid "Click the folder up button (|folder_up|) in the bottom bar of the cast."
msgstr "单击演员阵容底部栏中的文件夹向上按钮（|folder_up|）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:583
msgid "**To perform a selection:**"
msgstr "**要执行选择，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:587
msgid "Click to select a level."
msgstr "单击以选择级别。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:589
msgid ""
"Ctrl-click (PC) or Cmd-click (Mac) to add a level to or remove it from the "
"selection."
msgstr "Ctrl键单击（PC）或Cmd键单击（Mac）可将级别添加到选择中或从中删除。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:593
msgid "**To move levels to a folder:**"
msgstr "**要将级别移动到文件夹，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:595
msgid "Select them and drag them to the folder in the cast tree."
msgstr "选择它们并将其拖动到转换树中的文件夹中。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:597 ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:658
msgid "**To expose the selection:**"
msgstr "**要显示所选内容，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:601
msgid "Choose Level  →  **Expose in Xsheet**."
msgstr "选择级别→  **在Xsheet**中显示。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:603
msgid ""
"Right-click the selection in the Scene Cast and choose **Expose in Xsheet** "
"from the menu that opens. In case of a multiple level selection, each level "
"will be placed in a different column/layer, starting from the first empty one."
msgstr ""
"在“场景投射”中的选择上单击鼠标右键，然后从打开的菜单中选择**在Xsheet中曝光**。在"
"多级选择的情况下，每一级都将从第一个空的列/层开始放置在不同的列/图层中。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:605
msgid ""
"Drag and drop the selection to the Xsheet/Timeline cell where you want to start "
"exposing it. In case of a multiple level selection, each level will be placed "
"in a different column/layer."
msgstr ""
"将所选内容拖放到要开始显示它的Xsheet/Timeline单元格中。如果是多级选择，每一级都"
"将放置在不同的列/层中。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:607
msgid "**To display an animation level in the Level Strip:**"
msgstr "**要在“级别条”中显示动画级别，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:611 ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:644
msgid ""
"Select it in the Scene Cast and choose Level  →  **Display in Level Strip**."
msgstr "在“场景投射”中选择它，然后选择“级别”→  **显示在水平条**中。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:613
msgid ""
"Right-click it in the Scene Cast and choose **Display in Level Strip** from the "
"menu that opens."
msgstr "在“场景投射”中右键单击它，然后从打开的菜单中选择**在水平条中显示**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:615
msgid "**To remove the selected elements:**"
msgstr "**要删除所选元素，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:617
msgid ""
"Right-click the selection in the Scene Cast and choose **Remove Level** from "
"the menu that opens."
msgstr "在“场景投射”中的选择上单击鼠标右键，然后从打开的菜单中选择**删除级别**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:619
msgid "Levels can be removed only if they are not used in the scene."
msgstr "只有在场景中不使用级别时，才能将其删除。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:621
msgid "**To remove all the unused elements:**"
msgstr "**要删除所有未使用的元素，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:625
msgid "Choose Level  →  **Remove All Unused Levels**."
msgstr "选择级别→  **删除所有未使用的级别**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:627
msgid ""
"Right-click in the Scene Cast and choose **Remove All Unused Levels** from the "
"menu that opens."
msgstr ""
"在“场景投射”中单击鼠标右键，然后从打开的菜单中选择**删除所有未使用的级别**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:633
msgid "Using the Level Strip"
msgstr "使用水平条"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:634
msgid ""
"When an animation level is displayed in the Level Strip, you can select the "
"specific drawings you want to expose in the Xsheet/Timeline. This feature may "
"prove useful especially when you need to retrieve some drawings that belong to "
"the level, but that are not available in the Xsheet/Timeline cells."
msgstr ""
"当动画级别显示在级别栏中时，您可以选择要在X表/时间线中显示的特定图形。当您需要检"
"索属于该级别但在Xsheet/Timeline单元格中不可用的某些图形时，此功能可能会非常有"
"用。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:636
msgid "|level_strip|"
msgstr "|level_strip|"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:638
msgid "**To display an animation level in the level strip:**"
msgstr "**要在级别条中显示动画级别，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:642
msgid "Select any level drawing exposed in the Xsheet/Timeline."
msgstr "选择Xsheet/Timeline中显示的任何级别图形。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:646
msgid ""
"Right-click it the Scene Cast and choose **Display in Level Strip** from the "
"menu that opens."
msgstr "在“场景投射”上单击鼠标右键，然后从打开的菜单中选择**在水平条中显示**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:648
msgid "**To select drawings in the Level Strip:**"
msgstr "**要在标高栏中选择图形，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:652
msgid "Click to select a drawing."
msgstr "单击以选择图形。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:654
msgid ""
"Ctrl-click (PC) or Cmd-click (Mac) to add a drawing to or remove it from the "
"selection."
msgstr "Ctrl键单击（PC）或Cmd键单击（Mac）可将图形添加到选择中或从选择中删除。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:662
msgid ""
"Copy and paste the selection in the Xsheet/Timeline, into the cell you want."
msgstr "将Xsheet/Timeline中的所选内容复制并粘贴到所需的单元格中。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:664
msgid ""
"Right-click in the Level Strip selection and choose **Expose in Xsheet** from "
"the menu that opens. Drawings will be exposed at the beginning of the first "
"empty column."
msgstr ""
"在“水平条”选择中单击鼠标右键，然后从打开的菜单中选择**在Xsheet**中显示。图纸将在"
"第一个空栏的开头显示。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:668
msgid ""
"Drag and drop the selection to the Xsheet/Timeline cell where you want to start "
"exposing it and keep the **Shift** key pressed, to insert them if other content "
"is already exposed in the destination cells."
msgstr ""
"将所选内容拖放到要开始显示它的Xsheet/Timeline单元格中，并按住**Shift**键，如果目"
"标单元格中已经显示了其他内容，则插入它们。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:670
msgid ""
"Drag and drop the selection to the Xsheet/Timeline cell where you want to start "
"exposing it and keep the **Alt** key pressed, to overwrite any other content "
"previously exposed in the destination cells."
msgstr ""
"将所选内容拖放到要开始显示它的Xsheet/Timeline单元格中，并按住**Alt**键，以覆盖之"
"前在目标单元格中显示的任何其他内容。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:672
msgid ""
"When it is not possible to expose the selection, a red outline is displayed "
"instead of the selection."
msgstr "当无法显示所选内容时，将显示红色轮廓而不是所选内容。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:678
msgid "Replacing Levels"
msgstr "替换级别"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:679
msgid ""
"An animation level exposed in the Xsheet/Timeline can be easily replaced by "
"another animation level, preserving any editing performed in the sequence of "
"drawings exposed in the column/layer cells. In this way it is possible to reuse "
"the same edited sequence for different levels. For example you can reuse the "
"edited sequence of a character level for the related shadow level by copying "
"and pasting the character sequence, then replacing the character level with the "
"shadow one."
msgstr ""
"在Xsheet/Timeline中显示的动画级别可以很容易地被另一个动画级别替换，从而保留在列/"
"层单元格中显示的图形序列中执行的任何编辑。通过这种方式，可以为不同级别重用相同的"
"编辑序列。例如，您可以通过复制和粘贴角色序列，然后用阴影级别替换角色级别，将角色"
"级别的编辑序列重新用于相关的阴影级别。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:681
msgid ""
"It is possible to replace the level as a whole, or limited only to selected "
"cells. In both cases only the content of the selected cells will be replaced: "
"if any drawing of the replaced level is exposed somewhere else in the Xsheet/"
"Timeline, it will not be affected by the replacing operation."
msgstr ""
"可以整体替换级别，也可以仅限于选定的单元格。在这两种情况下，只会替换所选单元格的"
"内容：如果替换级别的任何图形在Xsheet/Timeline的其他位置显示，则不会受到替换操作"
"的影响。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:683
msgid ""
"In case the new level does not contain some of the frames you are going to "
"replace, the level name and number in the cell turn red to warn you that there "
"is no drawing available for that cell."
msgstr ""
"如果新标高不包含要替换的某些框架，则单元格中的标高名称和编号将变为红色，以警告您"
"该单元格没有可用的图形。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:685
msgid ""
"The original level is preserved in the Scene Cast from where it can be "
"retrieved, or removed (see  :ref:`Using the Scene Cast "
"<using_the_scene_cast>`  )."
msgstr ""
"原始级别保留在“场景投射”中，可以从中检索或删除（请参见：ref:“使用场景投射"
"<Using_The_Scene_Cast>”）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:687
msgid "**To replace a level in the Xsheet/Timeline:**"
msgstr "**要替换Xsheet/Timeline中的级别：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:689
msgid "Select the cells where the level you want to replace is exposed."
msgstr "选择要替换的级别暴露的单元格。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:693
msgid "Choose Level  →  **Replace Level...**."
msgstr "选择层级→  **更换层级。..**."

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:695
msgid ""
"Right-click the selection and choose one of the options in the **Replace "
"Level** submenu, from the menu that opens."
msgstr "右键单击所选内容，然后从打开的菜单中选择**替换级别**子菜单中的一个选项。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:697
msgid ""
"In the browser select the new level, and click the **OK** button (see  :ref:"
"`Using the File Browser <using_the_file_browser>`  )."
msgstr ""
"在浏览器中选择新级别，然后单击**确定**按钮（请参阅：ref:“使用文件浏览器"
"<Using_the_File_browser>”）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:703
msgid "Editing Level Settings"
msgstr "编辑层级设置"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:705
msgid "|level_settings|"
msgstr "|级别设置|"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:707
msgid ""
"Once a level is exposed, its properties (path, DPI, subsampling, etc.), can be "
"controlled in the Level Settings dialog. Settings are the following:"
msgstr ""
"一旦暴露了级别，就可以在“级别设置”对话框中控制其属性（路径、DPI、子采样等）。设"
"置如下："

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:709
msgid ""
"**Name** is the name used to identify the level, by default it is the same name "
"of the file."
msgstr "**Name**是用于标识级别的名称，默认情况下与文件同名。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:711
msgid ""
"**Path** displays the location of the file, using default folder aliases if "
"needed. By typing in this field, or using the browser button, you can update "
"the path to a different location, or to different file."
msgstr ""
"**Path**显示文件的位置，必要时使用默认文件夹别名。通过在此字段中键入或使用浏览器"
"按钮，您可以更新到其他位置或不同文件的路径。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:713
msgid ""
"If in the browser you choose any project default folder, in the path field the "
"full path will be replace by the related default folder alias (see  :ref:"
"`Project Default Folders <project_default_folders>`  )."
msgstr ""
"如果在浏览器中选择任何项目默认文件夹，则在路径字段中，完整路径将被相关的默认文件"
"夹别名替换（请参阅：ref:“项目默认文件夹<project_default_Folders>”）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:715
msgid ""
"**Scan Path** displays the location of the scanned images that were cleaned up "
"to obtain the actual level (see  :ref:`Cleaning-up Scanned Drawings <cleaning-"
"up_scanned_drawings>`  ). This is available only for Toonz raster levels."
msgstr ""
"**扫描路径**显示了为获得实际水平而清理的扫描图像的位置（请参阅：ref:“清理扫描图"
"纸<cleanin-gup_scanned_traws>”）。这仅适用于Toanz光栅级别。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:717
msgid ""
"**DPI** lets you change the level DPI, thus changing its size. To return to the "
"original image DPI set the option menu above to Image DPI."
msgstr ""
"**DPI**允许您更改DPI级别，从而更改其大小。要返回原始图像DPI，请将上面的选项菜单"
"设置为图像DPI。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:719
msgid ""
"**Forced Squared Pixel** forces a level that has a different horizontal and "
"vertical DPI, and therefore is displayed stretched, to have the pixel shape "
"squared, and thus to be displayed properly."
msgstr ""
"**强制方形像素**强制具有不同水平和垂直DPI的级别进行拉伸显示，使像素形状变为方"
"形，从而正确显示。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:721
msgid ""
"**Width** and **Height** let you set a different size for the level, thus "
"changing its DPI. The level maintains its A/R."
msgstr ""
"**宽度**和高度**允许您为级别设置不同的大小，从而更改其DPI。液位保持其A/R。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:723
msgid ""
"**Use Camera DPI** button applies to the level automatically the camera DPI. It "
"is useful when the level has the same size of the camera but different DPI, and "
"you want it to match perfectly the camera."
msgstr ""
"**使用相机DPI**按钮自动应用于相机DPI级别。当级别与相机大小相同但DPI不同，并且您"
"希望它与相机完美匹配时，这很有用。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:725
msgid ""
"Information about **Camera DPI**, **Image DPI** and image **Resolution** are "
"displayed for reference purposes."
msgstr "有关**相机DPI**、**图像DPI**和图像**分辨率**的信息仅供参考。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:727
msgid ""
"**Premultiply** premultiplies the alpha channel of the level. Images which have "
"a meaningful alpha channel come in two types: premultiplied or not. A non-"
"premultiplied image can be recognized when it is loaded in OpenToonz because "
"its edge, where there is a complete transparence on one side and opacity on the "
"other, is not smooth, but displays a solid halo. With the premultiply operation "
"it is possible to transform the image alpha-channel so that it is correctly "
"displayed in OpenToonz camera stand, preview and rendering."
msgstr ""
"**预乘**预乘水平的阿尔法通道。具有有意义阿尔法通道的图像有两种类型：预乘或非预"
"乘。当在OpenToonz中加载非预乘图像时，可以识别出它，因为它的边缘（一侧完全透明，"
"另一侧不透明）并不平滑，但显示了一个实心光晕。通过预乘操作，可以转换图像阿尔法通"
"道，使其在OpenToonz相机支架、预览和渲染中正确显示。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:729
msgid ""
"**White As Transparent** sets the pure white color (i.e. with red, green and "
"blue values to 255) as transparent and automatically adds some antialiasing to "
"the level images. This option is meant for animation levels generated from "
"third-party software (such as Retas) that do not have a transparent background "
"but a solid white one, and whose lines do not have antialiasing."
msgstr ""
"**白色透明**将纯白色（即红色、绿色和蓝色值为255）设置为透明，并自动为级别图像添"
"加一些抗锯齿效果。此选项适用于由第三方软件（如Retas）生成的动画级别，这些软件没"
"有透明背景，而是纯白色背景，其线条没有抗锯齿。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:731
msgid ""
"**Add Antialiasing** gives the user the possibility to add antialiasing to the "
"level. The antialiasing value has to be specified in the **Antialias Softness** "
"field, which can range from 0 to 100. This option is available on Toonz Raster "
"and Raster levels."
msgstr ""
"**添加抗锯齿**使用户可以在级别中添加抗锯齿。必须在**Antialias Softness**字段中指"
"定抗锯齿值，该字段的范围可以从0到100。此选项在Toanz光栅和光栅级别上可用。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:733
msgid ""
"**Subsampling** sets the simplifying factor to be applied to animation levels, "
"clips and images when displayed in the work area in order to have a faster "
"visualization and playback; for example if it is 2, one pixel every two pixels "
"is displayed. The default values are defined in Xsheet  →  Scene Settings "
"dialog, where values for raster (Image) and toonz raster (TLV) level "
"subsampling can be defined."
msgstr ""
"**子采样**设置简化因子，以便在工作区显示时应用于动画级别、剪辑和图像，从而实现更"
"快的可视化和回放；例如，如果它是2，则每两个像素显示一个像素。默认值在Xsheet中定"
"义→  “场景设置”对话框，可以在其中定义光栅（图像）和toonz光栅（TLV）级子采样的"
"值。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:735
msgid ""
"The subsampling factor can also be applied to all the animation levels exposed "
"in selected columns by right-clicking the header of any selected column and "
"choosing one of the **Subsampling** commands from the menu that opens."
msgstr ""
"通过右键单击任何选定列的标题并从打开的菜单中选择**子采样**命令之一，子采样因子也"
"可以应用于选定列中显示的所有动画级别。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:737
msgid "**To open the Level Settings dialog:**"
msgstr "**要打开“标高设置”对话框，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:741
msgid ""
"Select a level in the Xsheet/Timeline and choose Level  →  **Level Settings..."
"**."
msgstr "在X表格/时间线中选择一个级别，然后选择级别→  **级别设置。..**."

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:743
msgid ""
"Right-click a level in the Xsheet/Timeline and choose **Level Settings...** "
"from the menu that opens."
msgstr ""
"右键单击Xsheet/Timeline中的级别，然后选择**级别设置。..**从打开的菜单中选择。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:745
msgid ""
"Right-click a level in the Scene Cast and choose **Level Settings...** from the "
"menu that opens."
msgstr ""
"在“场景投射”中的某个标高上单击鼠标右键，然后选择“**标高设置”。..**从打开的菜单中"
"选择。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:751
msgid "Xsheet Toolbar"
msgstr "Xsheet工具栏"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:753
msgid "|xsheet_toolbar|"
msgstr "|xsheet_toolbar|"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:755
msgid ""
"The Xsheet Toolbar, at the top of the Xsheet and Timeline panes, is a place "
"where the user can display favorite OpenToonz tools and commands to have them "
"readily available."
msgstr ""
"Xsheet工具栏位于Xsheet和Timeline窗格的顶部，用户可以在其中显示最喜欢的OpenToonz"
"工具和命令，以便随时使用。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:757
msgid "The Xsheet Toolbar pane can be toggled depending on user preferences."
msgstr "Xsheet工具栏窗格可以根据用户偏好进行切换。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:759
msgid ""
"If the Xsheet Toolbar is too short to display all the command buttons, a double-"
"arrow symbol will appear at the right end of it, allowing to display a drop "
"down menu with the rest of them."
msgstr ""
"如果Xsheet工具栏太短，无法显示所有命令按钮，则其右端将出现一个双箭头符号，允许显"
"示包含其余按钮的下拉菜单。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:761
msgid "**To toggle the Xsheet Toolbar:**"
msgstr "**要切换Xsheet工具栏，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:765
msgid ""
"Right click on any *column/layer header* and choose **Toggle Xsheet Toolbar** "
"from the menu that opens."
msgstr "右键单击任何*列/图层标题*，然后从打开的菜单中选择**切换Xsheet工具栏**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:767
msgid ""
"Activate the File  →  Preferences...  →  Xsheet  →  **Show Toolbar in the "
"Xsheet** option."
msgstr "激活文件→  偏好。..  →  摄影表→  **在Xsheet**选项中显示工具栏。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:769
msgid ""
"When the Xsheet Toolbar is shown, it's also possible to activate the **Expand "
"Function Editor Header to Match Xsheet Toolbar Height** option to correctly "
"match the *frame* rows in both editors, when put side by side."
msgstr ""
"当显示Xsheet工具栏时，还可以激活**展开函数编辑器标题以匹配Xsheet工具条高度**选"
"项，以便在并排放置时正确匹配两个编辑器中的*框架*行。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:771
msgid "**To customize the Xsheet Toolbar buttons:**"
msgstr "**要自定义Xsheet工具栏按钮，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:773
msgid ""
"Right click on it and select **Customize Xsheet Toolbar** from the menu that "
"opens. The Customize Xsheet Toolbar window will open."
msgstr ""
"右键单击它，然后从打开的菜单中选择**自定义Xsheet工具栏**。“自定义Xsheet工具栏”窗"
"口将打开。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:775
msgid "|xsheet_toolbar_window|"
msgstr "|xsheet_toolbar_window|"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:777
msgid ""
"To *add* a command: Search for a command in the **Toolbar Items** list (right) "
"and drag it to the **Xsheet Toolbar** list (left)."
msgstr ""
"要*添加*命令：在**工具栏项目**列表（右）中搜索命令，并将其拖动到**X表格工具栏**"
"列表（左）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:779
msgid ""
"To *add* a separator: At the end of the **Toolbar Items** list (right), drag "
"the **----Separator----** item to the **Xsheet Toolbar** list (left)."
msgstr ""
"添加分隔符：在**工具栏项目**列表（右）的末尾，将**----分隔符----**项目拖动到"
"**Xsheet工具栏**列表（左）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:781
msgid ""
"To *delete* a command: Locate the command in the **Xsheet Toolbar** list "
"(left), right click on it and select **Remove** from the menu that opens."
msgstr ""
"要*删除*命令：在**X表格工具栏**列表（左）中找到该命令，右键单击它，然后从打开的"
"菜单中选择**删除**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:783
msgid "Click **OK** to accept the changes or **Cancel** to discard them."
msgstr ""
"要*删除*命令：在**X表格工具栏**列表（左）中找到该命令，右键单击它，然后从打开的"
"菜单中选择**删除**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:789
msgid "Working with Columns/Layers"
msgstr "使用列/层"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:790
msgid ""
"When levels are exposed in the Xsheet they are placed in columns (layers, in "
"the case of the Timeline). The column/layer stacking order sets which drawings "
"and images are placed on top, or behind, other images. Its direction is from "
"left to right in the Xsheet, and from bottom to top in the Timeline, so what is "
"on the left/bottom is behind what is on the right/top. You can use the keyboard "
"arrow keys to move between the columns/layers and time."
msgstr ""
"当级别在Xsheet中显示时，它们会被放置在列中（在时间线的情况下为层）。列/层堆叠顺"
"序设置了哪些图形和图像放置在其他图像的顶部或后面。它的方向在Xsheet中是从左到右，"
"在Timeline中是从下到上，因此左侧/底部的内容在右侧/顶部的内容后面。您可以使用键盘"
"箭头键在列/层和时间之间移动。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:792
msgid "|xsheet|"
msgstr "|xsheet|"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:794
msgid "|timeline|"
msgstr "|时间线|"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:796
msgid ""
"The Xsheet is divided into sections divided by horizontal markers (vertical, in "
"case of the Timeline), whose interval can be customized; at each marker the "
"name of the levels exposed can be displayed, when the option **Display Level "
"Name on Each Marker** is active in the Preferences...  →  Interface dialog "
"section."
msgstr ""
"Xsheet被水平标记（如果是时间线，则为垂直标记）划分为多个部分，其间隔可以自定义；"
"当“首选项”中的“在每个标记上显示级别名称”选项处于活动状态时，可以在每个标记处显示"
"暴露的级别名称。..  →  界面对话框部分。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:798
msgid ""
"Column/layer cells may have different colors according to the type of level "
"they contain. Toonz Vector levels are displayed in *dark yellow*; Toonz Raster "
"levels in *green*; Raster levels in *light blue*; Sub-Xsheets in *violet* "
"(see  :ref:`Using Sub-Xsheets <using_sub-xsheets>`  ); Effect levels generated "
"by OpenToonz in *brown* (see  :ref:`Using the FX Schematic "
"<using_the_fx_schematic>`  ); Audio levels in *pale green* (see  :ref:`Creating "
"a Soundtrack <creating_a_soundtrack>`  ); and Note levels in *grey*."
msgstr ""
"列/层单元格可能根据其包含的级别类型具有不同的颜色。Toonz矢量级别以*深黄色*显示；"
"*绿色*的图恩斯光栅水平；*浅蓝色*光栅级别；*紫色*的子X表（参见：“使用子X表<使用"
"_Sub-Xsheets>”）；OpenToonz在*brown*中生成的效果级别（参见：“使用FX原理图"
"<Using_the_FX_schema>”）；*淡绿色*的音频级别（请参阅：ref:`创建音轨"
"<Creating_a_track>`）；并用*灰色*标注级别。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:800
msgid ""
"Each column/layer header contains information about its content. These are:"
msgstr "每个列/层标题都包含有关其内容的信息。这些是："

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:802
msgid ""
"**Name**, by default is the name of the first exposed level. The area color "
"indicates the type of level exposed in the column/layer."
msgstr ""
"**Name**, by default is the name of the first exposed level. The area color "
"indicates the type of level exposed in the column/layer."

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:804
msgid ""
"**Render toggle** (|preview|) allowing you to include or not the column/layer "
"contents in the rendering."
msgstr "**渲染切换**（|预览|）允许您在渲染中包含或不包含列/层内容。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:806
msgid ""
"**Camera stand toggle** (|camera_stand|) allowing you to hide or display the "
"column/layer content in the viewer."
msgstr "**相机支架切换**（|Camera_stand|）允许您在查看器中隐藏或显示列/层内容。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:808
msgid ""
"The render and camera stand toggles work linked to similar toggles available in "
"the Schematic nodes of the column/layer (see  :ref:`Using the Stage Schematic "
"<using_the_stage_schematic>`  and  :ref:`Using the FX Schematic "
"<using_the_fx_schematic>`  )."
msgstr ""
"渲染和摄影机支架的切换与列/层的“原理图”节点中可用的类似切换相关联（请参见："
"ref:“使用舞台原理图<Using_The_Stage_Schematic>”和：ref:`使用FX原理图<Using "
"_The_FX_Schematic>`）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:810 ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1342
msgid ""
"**Lock toggle** (|lock|) allowing you to prevent any editing in the column/"
"layer."
msgstr "**锁定切换**（|Lock|）允许您阻止对列/层进行任何编辑。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:812
msgid ""
"**Additional settings** button (|additional_settings|) allowing you to set an "
"**Opacity** value or a **Color Filter** to the column/layer content, when "
"displayed in the viewer. When a column/layer has a partial opacity, its "
"**Camera stand toggle** changes to a faded icon to indicate it."
msgstr ""
"**附加设置**按钮（|Additional_settings|）允许您在查看器中显示时为列/层内容设置**"
"不透明度**值或**滤色器**。当列/层具有部分不透明度时，其**相机支架开关**会变为褪"
"色的图标以示指示。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:814
msgid ""
"Optionally you can make these additional properties also take effect at render "
"time by activating the **Enable Column Color Filter and Transparency for "
"Rendering** option in the Xsheet  →  Scene Settings... dialog."
msgstr ""
"您也可以通过激活Xsheet中的**启用列颜色过滤器和渲染透明度**选项，使这些附加属性也"
"在渲染时生效→  场景设置。..对话框。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:816
msgid ""
"**Preview icon** of the first drawing or image exposed in the column/layer."
msgstr "**在列/层中显示的第一个图形或图像的预览图标**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:818
msgid ""
"The icons on the Xsheet column headers can either be displayed at once when the "
"scene is opened, or on demand by clicking on the column header, according to "
"the **Column Icon** option available in Preferences...  →  Xsheet dialog "
"section."
msgstr ""
"Xsheet列标题上的图标可以在场景打开时立即显示，也可以根据首选项中可用的**列图标**"
"选项，通过单击列标题按需显示。..  →  Xsheet对话框部分。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:820
msgid ""
"**Parent** information, is an area where the object (by default the Table) and "
"center (by default center B) to which each column/layer is parented is "
"displayed (see  :ref:`Linking Objects <linking_objects>`  ). Currently this is "
"not shown in the Timeline header."
msgstr ""
"**父**信息是一个区域，显示每个列/层所属的对象（默认为表）和中心（默认为中心B）"
"（请参阅：ref:“链接对象<Linking_Objects>”）。目前，这在时间轴标题中没有显示。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:822
msgid ""
"In the Xsheet, the column on the far left displays the frame number, with the "
"cursor indicating the current frame. The cursor can be used to set the current "
"frame and allows you to activate the onion skin mode to better check the "
"animation (see  :ref:`Using Onion Skin <using_onion_skin>`  ). In the Timeline, "
"the same controls are placed in the time ruler at the top of the Timeline, "
"having an equivalent functionality."
msgstr ""
"在Xsheet中，最左侧的列显示帧编号，光标指示当前帧。光标可用于设置当前帧，并允许您"
"激活洋葱皮模式以更好地检查动画（请参阅：ref:`使用洋葱皮<Using_onion_skin>`）。在"
"时间线中，相同的控件放置在时间线顶部的时间标尺中，具有等效的功能。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:824
msgid ""
"When the animation is played back, the Xsheet/Timeline scrolls according to the "
"current frame cursor position, in order to display the current frame. To "
"disable the scrolling deactivate the **Xsheet Autopan during Playback** option "
"available in the Preferences...  →  Xsheet dialog section."
msgstr ""
"播放动画时，Xsheet/Timeline会根据当前帧光标位置滚动，以显示当前帧。要禁用滚动，"
"请停用“首选项”中可用的**“播放期间Xsheet自动扫描”**选项。..  →  Xsheet对话框部"
"分。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:826
msgid ""
"Above the frame number column, there are buttons for creating and navigating "
"Memos that can be posted in the Xsheet/Timeline (see  :ref:`Using Memos "
"<using_memos>`  )."
msgstr ""
"在帧编号列上方，有用于创建和导航可以在Xsheet/Timeline中发布的备忘录的按钮（请参"
"阅：ref:`使用备忘录<Using_Memos>`）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:828
msgid ""
"The Xsheet/Timeline can be scrolled to examine its content, while the header "
"area and the frame column are always visible; in this way it's easier to "
"understand how the scene is built."
msgstr ""
"可以滚动Xsheet/Timeline查看其内容，而标题区域和框架列始终可见；这样更容易理解场"
"景是如何构建的。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:830
msgid ""
"Columns/layers you want to hide in the Xsheet/Timeline can be folded in order "
"to save space in the interface. Once folded they can be unfold at any moment "
"and be visible in their original position by clicking on the column/layer "
"header area."
msgstr ""
"您想在Xsheet/Timeline中隐藏的列/层可以折叠，以节省界面中的空间。折叠后，它们可以"
"随时展开，并通过单击列/图层标题区域在原始位置可见。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:832
msgid "**To scroll the Xsheet/Timeline:**"
msgstr "**要滚动X表格/时间线：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:836
msgid "Middle-click and drag to scroll in any direction."
msgstr "单击鼠标中键并拖动可向任何方向滚动。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:838
msgid "Use the mouse wheel to scroll up or down."
msgstr "使用鼠标滚轮向上或向下滚动。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:840
msgid ""
"Use the scrolling bars to scroll only within the exposed section of the Xsheet/"
"Timeline."
msgstr "使用滚动条仅在Xsheet/Timeline的暴露部分内滚动。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:842
msgid ""
"Use the Up Arrow and Down Arrow keys to move one frame backwards or forward in "
"the Xsheet."
msgstr "使用向上箭头和向下箭头键在Xsheet中前后移动一帧。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:844
msgid ""
"Use the Left Arrow and Right Arrow keys to move one frame backwards or forward "
"in the Timeline."
msgstr "使用左箭头和右箭头键在时间线中前后移动一帧。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:846
msgid ""
"Use Shift+Up Arrow and Shift+Down Arrow keys to move to the previous or next "
"drawing, either in the Xsheet or Timeline. Use this option if you want to skip "
"the hold frames."
msgstr ""
"使用Shift+向上箭头和Shift+向下箭头键移动到Xsheet或Timeline中的上一个或下一个图"
"形。如果要跳过保持帧，请使用此选项。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:848
msgid ""
"Use the Page Up and Page Down keys to scroll the visible frames up or down in "
"the Xsheet."
msgstr "使用Page Up和Page Down键在Xsheet中向上或向下滚动可见的框架。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:850
msgid ""
"Use the Home and End keys to scroll up to the beginning or the end of the "
"Xsheet content."
msgstr "使用Home和End键向上滚动到Xsheet内容的开头或结尾。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:852
msgid "**To set the marker interval:**"
msgstr "**要设置标记间隔，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:854
msgid "Choose Xsheet  →  Scene Settings..."
msgstr "选择Xsheet→  场景设置。.."

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:856
msgid ""
"In the dialog that opens use the **Marker Interval** to set the frame interval "
"between two markers, and the **Start Frame** to set at which frame the first "
"marker has to be displayed."
msgstr ""
"在打开的对话框中，使用**标记间隔**设置两个标记之间的帧间隔，使用**开始帧**设置必"
"须显示第一个标记的帧。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:858
msgid "**To name a column:**"
msgstr "**要命名列，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:860
msgid "Double-click the column/layer name in the header and type a new name."
msgstr "双击标题中的列/层名称，然后键入新名称。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:862
msgid "**To select columns/layers:**"
msgstr "**要选择列/层，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:866
msgid "Click the column/layer header to select a column."
msgstr "单击列/图层标题以选择列。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:868
msgid "Click and drag in the column/layer icon to select contiguous columns."
msgstr "单击并拖动列/层图标以选择连续的列。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:870
msgid ""
"Ctrl-click (PC) or Cmd-click (Mac) to add a column/layer to or remove it from "
"the selection."
msgstr "Ctrl单击（PC）或Cmd单击（Mac）可将列/层添加到所选内容中或从中删除。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:874
msgid "**To move a column/layer selection:**"
msgstr "**要移动列/图层选择，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:876
msgid ""
"Click any area displaying the name of columns in the header, and drag it to the "
"new position."
msgstr "单击标题中显示列名称的任何区域，并将其拖动到新位置。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:878
msgid "**To edit a column/layer selection:**"
msgstr "**要编辑列/图层选择，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:880
msgid "Select the columns/layers you want to edit."
msgstr "选择要编辑的列/层。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:884 ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:975
#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1411
msgid ""
"Use the **Copy** command to keep in memory the selection for further operations."
msgstr "使用**复制**命令将所选内容保留在内存中，以便进行进一步操作。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:886
msgid ""
"Use the **Cut** command: to eliminate the selection from the scene and keep it "
"in memory for further operations. The column/layer elimination causes the "
"following columns to shift left (or the layers above to shift down)."
msgstr ""
"使用**剪切**命令：从场景中删除选择并将其保留在内存中以供进一步操作。删除列/层会"
"导致以下列向左移动（或上方的层向下移动）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:888
msgid ""
"Use the **Paste** command to paste the selection kept in memory starting from "
"the selected column/layer. The command causes following columns to shift right "
"(or layers above to shift up)."
msgstr ""
"使用**粘贴**命令从所选列/层开始粘贴内存中保存的选择。该命令使以下列向右移动（或"
"使上面的层向上移动）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:890
msgid "Use the **Delete** command to delete the selection."
msgstr "使用**删除**命令删除所选内容。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:892
msgid ""
"Use the **Insert** command to insert empty columns before the selection; "
"inserted columns/layers will be as many as the selected ones."
msgstr "使用**插入**命令在选择之前插入空列；插入的列/层将与所选列/层一样多。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:894
msgid ""
"All of these commands are also available in the menu that opens when right-"
"clicking the column/layer header."
msgstr "所有这些命令也可以在右键单击列/层标题时打开的菜单中使用。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:896
msgid "**To include or exclude a column/layer contents from the rendering:**"
msgstr "**要在渲染中包含或排除列/层内容，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:898
msgid ""
"Click the render toggle (|preview|) on the column/layer header. If you right-"
"click the button you can select commands from a menu that opens, that let you "
"affect several columns/layers at the same time."
msgstr ""
"单击列/层标题上的渲染切换（|preview|）。如果右键单击该按钮，则可以从打开的菜单中"
"选择命令，该菜单允许您同时影响多个列/层。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:900
msgid "**To show or hide a column/layer contents in the viewer:**"
msgstr "**要在查看器中显示或隐藏列/层内容，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:904
msgid ""
"Click the camera stand toggle (|camera_stand|) on the column/layer header. The "
"icon is faded out in case a partial opacity is set (see below). If you right-"
"click the button you can select commands from a menu that opens that let you "
"affect several columns/layers at the same time."
msgstr ""
"单击列/图层标题上的相机支架切换（|camera_stand|）。如果设置了部分不透明度，图标"
"将淡出（见下文）。如果右键单击该按钮，则可以从打开的菜单中选择命令，该菜单允许您"
"同时影响多个列/层。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:906
msgid ""
"Right-click the column/layer content in the viewer and choose the **Hide** or "
"**Show** command related to the column/layer you want to hide or show."
msgstr ""
"在查看器中右键单击列/层内容，然后选择与要隐藏或显示的列/层相关的**隐藏**或**显示"
"**命令。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:908 ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1374
msgid "**To lock or unlock a column/layer contents:**"
msgstr "**要锁定或解锁列/图层内容，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:910
msgid ""
"Click the lock toggle (|lock|) on the column/layer header. If you right-click "
"the button you can select commands from a menu that opens that let you lock or "
"unlock several columns/layers at the same time."
msgstr ""
"单击列/图层标题上的锁定切换（|lock|）。如果右键单击该按钮，则可以从打开的菜单中"
"选择命令，该菜单允许您同时锁定或解锁多个列/层。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:912
msgid "**To set Opacity for a column/layer content:**"
msgstr "**要为列/层内容设置“不透明度”，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:914
msgid ""
"Click the triangle icon (|additional_settings|) on the column/layer header, and "
"do one of the following:"
msgstr ""
"单击列/图层标题上的三角形图标（|additional_settings|），然后执行以下操作之一："

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:916
msgid "Use the **Opacity** slider to set the column/layer opacity."
msgstr "使用**不透明度**滑块设置列/层不透明度。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:918
msgid ""
"Input the desired **Opacity** value in the numeric field, to set the column/"
"layer opacity."
msgstr "在数字字段中输入所需的**不透明度**值，以设置列/层不透明度。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:920
msgid "**To set a Color Filter for a column/layer content:**"
msgstr "**要为列/图层内容设置颜色过滤器，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:922
msgid ""
"Click the triangle icon (|additional_settings|) on the column/layer header, and "
"set the **Filter** parameter to one of its predefined colors."
msgstr ""
"单击列/层标题上的三角形图标（|additional_settings|），并将**Filter**参数设置为其"
"预定义的颜色之一。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:924
msgid ""
"You can make Opacity and Color Filter take effect at render time by activating "
"the **Enable Column Color Filter and Transparency for Rendering** option in the "
"Xsheet  →  Scene Settings... dialog."
msgstr ""
"通过激活Xsheet中的**启用列颜色过滤器和渲染透明度**选项，可以使“不透明度”和“颜色"
"过滤器”在渲染时生效→  场景设置。..对话框。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:926
msgid "**To fold columns/layers:**"
msgstr "**要折叠列/层，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:928
msgid "Select the columns/layers you want to fold."
msgstr "选择要折叠的列/层。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:930
msgid ""
"Right-click the selection and choose **Fold Column** from the menu that opens."
msgstr "右键单击所选内容，然后从打开的菜单中选择**折叠列**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:932
msgid "**To unfold columns/layers:**"
msgstr "**要展开列/层，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:934
msgid "Click the fold visible between the column/layer headers."
msgstr "单击列/图层标题之间可见的折叠。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:940
msgid "Working with Cells"
msgstr "使用细胞"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:941
msgid ""
"When a level is exposed in a column, each cell contains a reference to a "
"particular image. You may empty some cells, repeat some of them or change their "
"order without affecting the real drawings sequence, because you are operating "
"on references. This means that when a scene contains several cells referring to "
"a drawing of an animation level, they all refer to the same drawing. This "
"implies that when you modify a drawing of an animation level, all the cells in "
"the Xsheet/Timeline referring to that drawing will consequently change their "
"content."
msgstr ""
"当一个级别在列中曝光时，每个单元格都包含对特定图像的引用。您可以清空一些单元格，"
"重复其中一些单元格或更改其顺序，而不会影响实际的图形顺序，因为您正在对参照进行操"
"作。这意味着，当一个场景包含多个引用动画级别图形的单元格时，它们都引用同一个图"
"形。这意味着，当您修改动画级别的图形时，Xsheet/Timeline中引用该图形的所有单元格"
"都会相应地更改其内容。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:943
msgid ""
"When the scene contains a reference to a drawing that is eliminated from the "
"level, the drawing name and number in the cell turn red, to warn you that there "
"is no drawing available for that cell anymore."
msgstr ""
"当场景包含对从级别中删除的图形的引用时，单元格中的图形名称和编号将变为红色，以警"
"告您该单元格不再有可用的图形。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:945
msgid ""
"When you select a cell, you can work on the drawing it contains by using tools "
"in the viewer."
msgstr "选择单元格时，可以使用查看器中的工具处理它包含的图形。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:947
msgid ""
"When one or more cells are selected you can perform standard cut, copy, paste, "
"delete and insert operations in the Xsheet/Timeline. In this case you are not "
"modifying the animation level frames but simply changing the way it is exposed "
"in the Xsheet/Timeline."
msgstr ""
"选择一个或多个单元格后，您可以在Xsheet/Timeline中执行标准的剪切、复制、粘贴、删"
"除和插入操作。在这种情况下，您不会修改动画级别帧，而只是更改它在Xsheet/Timeline"
"中的显示方式。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:949
msgid ""
"Selected cells can also be dragged to a new position in the Xsheet/Timeline, in "
"duplicating, inserting or overwriting mode as well. When they are dragged to an "
"empty column, it is possible to move along the data of the column/layer, i.e. "
"the movement and special FX, where they were originally exposed."
msgstr ""
"在复制、插入或覆盖模式下，所选单元格也可以拖动到Xsheet/Timeline中的新位置。当它"
"们被拖动到空列时，可以沿着列/层的数据移动，即移动和特殊FX，它们最初暴露的地方。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:951
msgid "**To modify a drawing exposed in a cell:**"
msgstr "**要修改单元格中显示的图形，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:953
msgid "Select the cell in the Xsheet/Timeline where the drawing is exposed."
msgstr "在Xsheet/Timeline中选择要显示图形的单元格。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:955
msgid "Use the tools to edit it in the Viewer."
msgstr "使用工具在查看器中编辑它。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:957
msgid "**To select several cells:**"
msgstr "**要选择多个单元格，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:961
msgid "Click and drag to select a series of cells."
msgstr "单击并拖动以选择一系列单元格。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:963
msgid "Shift-click a cell to extend the selection up to that cell."
msgstr "按住Shift键并单击单元格，将选择范围扩展到该单元格。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:965
msgid ""
"Press Ctrl and drag to include keys in the selection. A red frame will be shown "
"around the selection."
msgstr "按Ctrl键并拖动以将关键帧包含在选择中。选择周围将显示一个红色框。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:967
msgid ""
"Click the vertical strip available on the left of the cells in the Xsheet, to "
"select the continuous sequence of drawings belonging to the same animation "
"level."
msgstr "单击Xsheet中单元格左侧可用的垂直条，选择属于同一动画级别的连续图形序列。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:969
msgid ""
"Click the horizontal strip available on thetop of the cells in the Timeline, to "
"select the continuous sequence of drawings belonging to the same animation "
"level."
msgstr ""
"单击“时间线”中单元格顶部可用的水平条，选择属于同一动画级别的连续图形序列。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:971
msgid "**To edit cells with the Edit menu commands:**"
msgstr "**要使用“编辑”菜单命令编辑单元格，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:973 ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:989
#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1409
msgid "You can do the following:"
msgstr "您可以执行以下操作："

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:977
msgid ""
"Use the **Cut** command to eliminate the selection from the Xsheet/Timeline and "
"keep it in memory for further operations. The cell elimination causes the "
"following cells in the Xsheet to shift up, or in the Timeline, to shift to the "
"left."
msgstr ""
"使用**剪切**命令从Xsheet/Timeline中删除选择，并将其保留在内存中以供进一步操作。"
"单元格消除会导致Xsheet中的以下单元格向上移动，或导致Timeline中的下列单元格向左移"
"动。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:979
msgid ""
"Use the **Paste** command to paste the selection kept in memory into the Xsheet/"
"Timeline, starting from the selected insertion cell. The command causes the "
"following cells in the Xsheet to shift down, or in the Timeline, to shift to "
"the right."
msgstr ""
"使用**粘贴**命令将内存中保存的选择从所选插入单元格开始粘贴到Xsheet/Timeline中。"
"该命令使Xsheet中的以下单元格向下移动，或使Timeline中的以下单元向右移动。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:981 ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1417
msgid "Use the **Delete** command to empty the selected cells from any reference."
msgstr "使用**删除**命令从任何引用中清空所选单元格。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:983 ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1419
msgid ""
"Use the **Insert** command to insert blank cells before the selection; inserted "
"cells will be as many as the selected ones."
msgstr ""
"使用**插入**命令在选择之前插入空白单元格；插入的单元格将与所选单元格一样多。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:985 ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1421
msgid ""
"All the Edit menu commands are also available in the menu that opens when right-"
"clicking the Xsheet/Timeline cells."
msgstr "右键单击Xsheet/Timeline单元格时打开的菜单中也提供了所有编辑菜单命令。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:987
msgid "**To edit cells with the Cells menu commands:**"
msgstr "**要使用“单元格”菜单命令编辑单元格，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:991
msgid "Use the **Reverse** command to invert the order of the selected cells."
msgstr "使用**反转**命令反转选定单元格的顺序。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:993
msgid ""
"Use the **Swing** command to append the selected cells, at the end of the "
"selection, in a reversed order. The last cell of the selection will not be "
"repeated."
msgstr ""
"使用**Swing**命令在选择末尾以相反的顺序附加所选单元格。选择的最后一个单元格将不"
"会重复。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:995
msgid ""
"Use the **Random** command to rearrange the selected cells in a random order. "
"The order changes every time you use the command."
msgstr ""
"使用**随机**命令以随机顺序重新排列所选单元格。每次使用该命令时，顺序都会更改。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:997
msgid ""
"Use the **Autoexpose** command to repeat the selected cells, as if filling the "
"numbering gap between two subsequent drawings. For example if the command is "
"applied to two cells where drawing 2 and 5 are exposed, the result will be four "
"cells with drawings 2, 2, 2 and 5. The command works only if the selection is "
"increasingly numbered."
msgstr ""
"使用**自动曝光**命令重复所选单元格，就像填充两个后续图形之间的编号间隙一样。例"
"如，如果将命令应用于显示图形2和5的两个单元格，则结果将是显示图形2、2、2和5。只有"
"当选择的编号越来越多时，该命令才有效。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:999
msgid ""
"If the Autoexpose command is used on an level numbered 1, 3, 5, 7, etc., the "
"level will be automatically exposed step 2."
msgstr ""
"如果在编号为1、3、5、7等的级别上使用自动曝光命令，则该级别将在步骤2自动曝光。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1001
msgid ""
"Use the **Repeat** command to open a dialog that allows you to repeat "
"cyclically the selected cells by specifying a number of times, or the frame "
"number up to which the selection has to be repeated."
msgstr ""
"使用**Repeat**命令打开一个对话框，允许您通过指定重复选择的次数或帧号来循环重复所"
"选单元格。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1003
msgid ""
"Use the **Reset Step** command to remove any animation step in the selected "
"cells, preserving the order of the exposed drawings."
msgstr "使用**重置步骤**命令删除选定单元格中的任何动画步骤，保留显示图形的顺序。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1005
msgid ""
"Use the **Increase Step** command to increase the animation step of the "
"selected cells by one unit."
msgstr "使用**增加步长**命令将选定单元格的动画步长增加一个单位。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1007
msgid ""
"Use the **Decrease Step** command to decrease the animation step of the "
"selected cells by one unit; if a drawing is exposed in one cell only, it will "
"be preserved."
msgstr ""
"使用**减少步长**命令将所选单元格的动画步长减少一个单位；如果图形仅在一个单元格中"
"显示，它将被保留。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1009
msgid ""
"Use the **Step 2**, **Step 3** or **Step 4** command to repeat the selected "
"cells in order to have a step 2, step 3, or step 4 animation."
msgstr ""
"使用**步骤2**、**步骤3**或**步骤4**命令重复所选单元格，以获得步骤2、步骤3或步骤4"
"动画。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1011
msgid ""
"Use the **Each 2**, **Each 3** or **Each 4** command to preserve only one cell "
"each 2, each 3, or each 4 of the selection, and delete the others."
msgstr ""
"使用**每2个**、**每3个**或**每4个**命令仅保留所选内容中的每2个、每3个或每4个单元"
"格，并删除其他单元格。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1013
msgid ""
"Use the **Roll Up** command to shift the content of selected cells up, with the "
"top cell content replacing the bottom cell one."
msgstr ""
"使用**向上滚动**命令向上移动所选单元格的内容，用顶部单元格内容替换底部单元格内"
"容。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1015
msgid ""
"Use the **Roll Down** to shift the content of selected cells down, with the "
"bottom cell content replacing the top cell one."
msgstr ""
"使用**向下滚动**将所选单元格的内容向下移动，底部单元格内容将替换顶部单元格内容。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1017
msgid ""
"All the Cells menu commands are also available in the menu that opens when "
"right-clicking the Xsheet/Timeline cells."
msgstr "右键单击Xsheet/Timeline单元格时打开的菜单中也提供了所有“单元格”菜单命令。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1019
msgid "**To drag a cell selection in the Xsheet:**"
msgstr "**要拖动Xsheet中的单元格选择，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1023
msgid ""
"**Click** the vertical strip available on the left of the cells, and drag to "
"move them to a new position."
msgstr "**单击**单元格左侧可用的垂直条，然后拖动将其移动到新位置。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1025
msgid ""
"**Ctrl-click** (PC) or **Cmd-click** (Mac) the vertical strip available on the "
"left of the cells, and drag them to the new position, duplicating them."
msgstr ""
"**Ctrl单击**（PC）或**Cmd单击**（Mac）单元格左侧可用的垂直条，并将其拖动到新位"
"置，复制它们。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1027
msgid ""
"**Shift-click** the vertical strip available on the left of the cells, and drag "
"them to the new position, inserting them if other content is exposed in the "
"destination cells."
msgstr ""
"**按住Shift键并单击**单元格左侧可用的垂直条，然后将它们拖动到新位置，如果目标单"
"元格中显示了其他内容，则插入它们。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1029
msgid ""
"**Alt-click** the vertical strip available on the left of the cells, and drag "
"them to the new position, overwriting any other content previously exposed in "
"the destination cells."
msgstr ""
"**Alt键单击**单元格左侧可用的垂直条，并将其拖动到新位置，覆盖目标单元格中以前显"
"示的任何其他内容。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1031 ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1045
msgid ""
"When it's not possible to paste the selection, a red outline is displayed "
"instead of the selection."
msgstr "当无法粘贴所选内容时，将显示红色轮廓而不是所选内容。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1033
msgid "**To drag a cell selection in the Timeline:**"
msgstr "**要拖动时间线中的单元格选择，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1037
msgid ""
"**Click** the horizontal strip available on the top of the cells, and drag to "
"move them to a new position."
msgstr "**单击**单元格顶部可用的水平条，然后拖动将其移动到新位置。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1039
msgid ""
"**Ctrl-click** (PC) or **Cmd-click** (Mac) the horizontal strip available on "
"the top of the cells, and drag them to the new position, duplicating them."
msgstr ""
"**Ctrl单击**（PC）或**Cmd单击**（Mac）单元格顶部可用的水平条，并将其拖动到新位"
"置，复制它们。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1041
msgid ""
"**Shift-click** the horizontal strip available on the top of the cells, and "
"drag them to the new position, inserting them if other content is exposed in "
"the destination cells."
msgstr ""
"**按住Shift键并单击**单元格顶部可用的水平条，然后将它们拖动到新位置，如果目标单"
"元格中显示了其他内容，则插入它们。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1043
msgid ""
"**Alt-click** the horizontal strip available on the top of the cells, and drag "
"them to the new position, overwriting any other content previously exposed in "
"the destination cells."
msgstr ""
"**Alt键单击**单元格顶部可用的水平条，并将其拖动到新位置，覆盖之前在目标单元格中"
"显示的任何其他内容。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1047
msgid "**To drag a cell selection moving along the column/layer data:**"
msgstr "**要拖动沿列/层数据移动的单元格选择，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1049
msgid "Choose File  →  Preferences...  →  Xsheet."
msgstr "选择文件→  偏好。..  →  Xsheet。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1051
msgid "Set the Cell-dragging Behaviour option to **Cells and Column Data**."
msgstr "将“单元格拖动行为”选项设置为**单元格和列数据**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1053
msgid ""
"Column/layer data is moved along only when dragging the selected cells to an "
"empty column/layer."
msgstr "仅当将所选单元格拖动到空列/层时，列/层数据才会移动。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1055
msgid ""
"Column/layer data is moved along except for the linked columns/layers, because "
"linked columns/layers can only have one parent column/layer."
msgstr ""
"除了链接的列/层之外，列/层数据都会移动，因为链接的列或层只能有一个父列或层。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1061
msgid "Using the Smart Fill Handle"
msgstr "使用智能填充手柄"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1062
msgid ""
"The Fill Handle allows you to edit cells directly from within the Xsheet/"
"Timeline."
msgstr "填充句柄允许您直接从Xsheet/Timeline中编辑单元格。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1064
msgid ""
"It's the small tab appearing at the bottom of the cell selection in the Xsheet, "
"or at the right of the cell selection in the Timeline. By dragging this handle "
"you can repeat a cell or a group of cells, you can add cells, or you can delete "
"the last cells of a sequence. The behavior of the handle is smart: this means "
"that the way cells are repeated, added, or deleted depends on the selection "
"content."
msgstr ""
"它是出现在Xsheet中单元格选择底部或时间线中单元格选择右侧的小选项卡。通过拖动此控"
"制柄，您可以重复一个单元格或一组单元格，可以添加单元格，也可以删除序列中的最后一"
"个单元格。句柄的行为很聪明：这意味着单元格的重复、添加或删除方式取决于选择内容。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1066
msgid ""
"Editing cells with the Fill Handle makes the cells placed below the selection "
"to shift up/down in the Xsheet (or the cells placed to the right of the "
"selection to shift left/right in the Timeline)."
msgstr ""
"使用填充手柄编辑单元格会使位于所选内容下方的单元格在Xsheet中向上/向下移动（或使"
"位于所选项右侧的单元格在Timeline中向左/向右移动）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1068
msgid "**To edit cell content with the Fill Handle in the Xsheet:**"
msgstr "**要使用Xsheet中的填充句柄编辑单元格内容，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1072
msgid ""
"If you want to repeat a cell content for some frames, select the cell and drag "
"the fill handle down."
msgstr "如果要为某些帧重复单元格内容，请选择单元格并向下拖动填充控制柄。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1074
msgid ""
"If you want to lengthen a progressive sequence, select the cells where the "
"sequence is exposed, and drag the fill handle down: sequence will be lengthen "
"according to the progressive numbering. For example if the sequence is 1, 3, 5, "
"the added images will be 7, 9, 11, etc. This works for any step the sequence "
"may have."
msgstr ""
"如果要延长渐进序列，请选择显示序列的单元格，然后向下拖动填充手柄：序列将根据渐进"
"编号进行延长。例如，如果序列为1、3、5，则添加的图像将为7、9、11等。这适用于序列"
"可能包含的任何步骤。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1076
msgid ""
"If you want a random sequence to be repeated, select the sequence and drag the "
"fill handle down: the sequence will be lengthened according to the sequence "
"numbering. For example if the sequence is 3, 6, 4, 1, the added images will be "
"3, 6, 4, 1, 3, 6, etc."
msgstr ""
"如果要重复随机序列，请选择该序列并向下拖动填充手柄：该序列将根据序列编号进行加"
"长。例如，如果序列为3、6、4、1，则添加的图像将为3、六、四、一、三、六等。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1078
msgid ""
"If you want a progressive sequence to be repeated, first copy the sequence "
"first drawing at the end of the sequence, then select all and drag down the "
"fill handle. For example if the sequence is 1, 2, 3, 4, copy the drawing 1 at "
"the end of the sequence (the result will be 1, 2, 3, 4, 1), and the added "
"drawings will be 2, 3, 4, 1, 2, etc."
msgstr ""
"如果要重复渐进序列，请先复制序列末尾的序列第一个图形，然后选择全部并向下拖动填充"
"控制柄。例如，如果序列为1、2、3、4，则复制序列末尾的图形1（结果将为1、二、三、"
"四、一），添加的图形将为2、三、4、一、二等。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1080
msgid ""
"If you want to delete some cells, select a region so that the cells you want to "
"delete are in the last columns, and drag the fill handle up."
msgstr ""
"如果要删除某些单元格，请选择一个区域，使要删除的单元格位于最后一列，然后拖动填充"
"手柄u"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1082
msgid "**To edit cell content with the Fill Handle in the Timeline:**"
msgstr "**要使用时间线中的填充句柄编辑单元格内容，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1086
msgid ""
"If you want to repeat a cell content for some frames, select the cell and drag "
"the fill handle to the right."
msgstr "如果要为某些帧重复单元格内容，请选择单元格并将填充控制柄向右拖动。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1088
msgid ""
"If you want to lengthen a progressive sequence, select the cells where the "
"sequence is exposed, and drag the fill handle to the right: sequence will be "
"lengthen according to the progressive numbering. For example if the sequence is "
"1, 3, 5, the added images will be 7, 9, 11, etc. This works for any step the "
"sequence may have."
msgstr ""
"如果要延长渐进序列，请选择暴露序列的单元格，并将填充手柄向右拖动：序列将根据渐进"
"编号进行延长。例如，如果序列为1、3、5，则添加的图像将为7、9、11等。这适用于序列"
"可能包含的任何步骤。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1090
msgid ""
"If you want a random sequence to be repeated, select the sequence and drag the "
"fill handle to the right: the sequence will be lengthened according to the "
"sequence numbering. For example if the sequence is 3, 6, 4, 1, the added images "
"will be 3, 6, 4, 1, 3, 6, etc."
msgstr ""
"如果要重复随机序列，请选择该序列并将填充手柄向右拖动：序列将根据序列编号延长。例"
"如，如果序列为3、6、4、1，则添加的图像将为3、六、四、一、三、六等。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1092
msgid ""
"If you want a progressive sequence to be repeated, first copy the sequence "
"first drawing at the end of the sequence, then select all and drag the fill "
"handle to the right. For example if the sequence is 1, 2, 3, 4, copy the "
"drawing 1 at the end of the sequence (the result will be 1, 2, 3, 4, 1), and "
"the added drawings will be 2, 3, 4, 1, 2, etc."
msgstr ""
"如果要重复渐进序列，请首先复制序列末尾的序列第一个图形，然后选择全部并将填充控制"
"柄向右拖动。例如，如果序列为1、2、3、4，则复制序列末尾的图形1（结果将为1、二、"
"三、四、一），添加的图形将为2、三、4、一、二等。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1094
msgid ""
"If you want to delete some cells, select a region so that the cells you want to "
"delete are in the last rows, and drag the fill handle to the left."
msgstr ""
"如果要删除某些单元格，请选择一个区域，使要删除的单元格位于最后一行，然后将填充手"
"柄向左拖动。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1100
msgid "Stretching the Timing"
msgstr "延长时间"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1101
msgid ""
"If you need to change the timing of a selection of cells, a selected frame "
"range, or the whole Xsheet/Timeline, you can use the Time Stretch dialog."
msgstr ""
"如果需要更改选定单元格、选定帧范围或整个Xsheet/Timeline的计时，可以使用“时间拉"
"伸”对话框。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1103
msgid "|time_stretch|"
msgstr "|时间拉伸|"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1105
msgid "Options are the following:"
msgstr "选项如下："

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1107
msgid ""
"**Stretch** defines if the new timing has to be applied to the **Selected "
"Cells**, the **Selected Frame Range**, or to the **Whole Xsheet**."
msgstr ""
"**拉伸**定义是否必须将新计时应用于**选定单元格**、**选定帧范围**或**整个"
"Xsheet**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1109
msgid "**Old Range** displays the frame duration of the selection."
msgstr "**旧范围**显示选择的帧持续时间。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1111
msgid "**New Range** defines the new frame duration of the selection."
msgstr "**新范围**定义了选择的新帧持续时间。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1113
msgid "**To stretch the Xsheet/Timeline timing:**"
msgstr "**要延长Xsheet/Timeline计时：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1115
msgid "Select the cells, or define the frame range you want to stretch."
msgstr "选择单元格，或定义要拉伸的帧范围。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1119
msgid "Choose Cells  →  **Time Stretch...**."
msgstr "选择单元格→  **时间拉伸。..**."

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1121
msgid ""
"Right-click the selection and choose **Time Stretch...** from the menu that "
"opens."
msgstr "右键单击所选内容，然后选择**“时间拉伸”。..**从打开的菜单中选择。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1123
msgid "Define the time stretching options, then click the Stretch button."
msgstr "定义时间拉伸选项，然后单击“拉伸”按钮。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1129
msgid "Working Globally with Frames"
msgstr "在全局范围内使用帧"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1130
msgid ""
"It is possible to insert or delete frames affecting the Xsheet/Timeline as a "
"whole, or a selection of Xsheet columns or Timeline layers."
msgstr "可以插入或删除影响整个Xsheet/Timeline的帧，或选择Xsheet列或Timeline层。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1132
msgid ""
"Inserting or deleting frames can be useful if you want to change the timing of "
"the animation, for instance if you want to slow down or speed up an animation."
msgstr "如果要更改动画的计时，例如要减慢或加快动画，插入或删除帧可能很有用。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1134
msgid ""
"When a frame is inserted, the current frame cells are duplicated, and all the "
"following cells are shifted down (right in the Timeline). If animation keys are "
"defined for object transformations and FX parameters, they will be shifted down "
"(or right in the Timeline) as well, to keep the animation consistency (see  :"
"ref:`Animating Objects <animating_objects>`  and  :ref:`Editing FX Settings "
"<editing_fx_settings>`  )."
msgstr ""
"插入帧时，当前帧单元格将被复制，并且以下所有单元格都将向下移动（在时间线中向右移"
"动）。如果为对象变换和FX参数定义了动画关键帧，它们也将向下（或在时间线中向右）移"
"动，以保持动画的一致性（请参见：ref:“Animating Objects<animation_Objects>”和："
"ref:` Editing FX Settings<Editing_FX_Settings>”）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1136
msgid ""
"When a frame is removed, the current frame cells are deleted, and the following "
"cells are shifted up (or left in the Timeline). If animation keys for object "
"transformations and FX parameters are defined in the removed frame, they will "
"be deleted and following keys will be shifted up (or left in the Timeline) "
"(see  :ref:`Animating Objects <animating_objects>`  and  :ref:`Editing FX "
"Settings <editing_fx_settings>`  )."
msgstr ""
"删除帧后，当前帧单元格将被删除，以下单元格将向上移动（或在时间线中向左移动）。如"
"果在删除的帧中定义了对象变换和FX参数的动画关键帧，则它们将被删除，以下关键帧将向"
"上移动（或在时间线中向左移动）（请参见：ref:“Animating "
"Objects<animation_Objects>”和：ref:` Editing FX "
"Settings<Editing_FX_Settings>”）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1138
msgid "**To insert a frame:**"
msgstr "**要插入一帧，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1140
msgid "Select the frame before which you want to insert a new frame."
msgstr "选择要在其之前插入新帧的帧。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1142
msgid "Choose Xsheet  →  **Insert Frame**."
msgstr "选择Xsheet→  **插入框架**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1144
msgid "**To remove a frame:**"
msgstr "**要删除框架，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1146
msgid "Select the frame you want to delete."
msgstr "选择要删除的帧。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1148
msgid "Choose Xsheet  →  **Remove Frame**."
msgstr "选择Xsheet→  **拆下框架**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1154
msgid "Using Sub-Xsheets"
msgstr "使用子X表"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1155
msgid ""
"A Sub-Xsheet is a scene exposed in a single Xsheet column or Timeline layer. It "
"can contain as many columns/layers as you want, and other Sub-Xsheets as well."
msgstr ""
"子Xsheet是在单个Xsheet列或时间线层中显示的场景。它可以包含任意数量的列/层，以及"
"其他子X表。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1157
msgid ""
"When it's opened, the Sub-Xsheet contents are displayed in the Xsheet/Timeline "
"pane. When it is closed, it's displayed in the Xsheet/Timeline as a violet "
"column/layer, with its icon displaying a render of its content. The column/"
"layer cells display the name of the Sub-Xsheet, and the cell number is a "
"reference to the frame of the Sub-Xsheet content, i.e. cell 4 is a reference to "
"frame 4 of the Sub-Xsheet."
msgstr ""
"打开后，子Xsheet内容将显示在Xsheet/Timeline窗格中。当它关闭时，它在Xsheet/"
"Timeline中显示为紫色列/层，其图标显示其内容的渲染。列/层单元格显示子Xsheet的名"
"称，单元格编号是对子Xsheet内容的帧的引用，即单元格4是对子Xseet的帧4的引用。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1159
msgid ""
"The closed Sub-Xsheet level length depends on how many frames its content lasts "
"at the time you create it, and it is not affected when you edit the Sub-Xsheet "
"content."
msgstr ""
"关闭的子X表格级别长度取决于创建时其内容持续的帧数，编辑子X表格内容时不受影响。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1161
msgid ""
"Sub-Xsheet levels can be animated like any other animation level, and FX can be "
"assigned to it, affecting all the Sub-Xsheet content as a whole."
msgstr ""
"子Xsheet级别可以像任何其他动画级别一样设置动画，并且可以为其分配FX，从而整体上影"
"响所有子Xsheet内容。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1163
msgid ""
"Sub-Xsheet level cells can be edited, for example to create a cycle, or cut, "
"copied and pasted like any other exposed level (see  :ref:`Working with Xsheet "
"Cells <working_with_xsheet_cells>`  ). Like any other level, if some editing is "
"performed in its frames, all the cells in the main Xsheet/Timeline referring to "
"that Sub-Xsheet frame will consequently change their content. In case you want "
"to create a copy of a Sub-Xsheet that refers to the same animation level "
"database, but whose content can be edited independently, you can choose to "
"**Clone** it."
msgstr ""
"可以编辑子Xsheet级别单元格，例如创建循环，或像任何其他公开级别一样剪切、复制和粘"
"贴（请参阅：ref:“使用Xsheet单元格<Working_with_Xsheet_cells>”）。与任何其他级别"
"一样，如果在其框架中执行某些编辑，则主Xsheet/Timeline中引用该子Xsheet框架的所有"
"单元格都将相应地更改其内容。如果您想创建引用同一动画级别数据库但其内容可以独立编"
"辑的Sub Xsheet的副本，您可以选择**克隆**它。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1165
msgid ""
"If you want to reset the editing of a Sub-Xsheet level, you can **Resequence** "
"it, by resetting it to the original length and order of its contents."
msgstr ""
"如果要重置子X表格级别的编辑，可以通过将其重置为内容的原始长度和顺序来**重新排序"
"**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1167
msgid ""
"You can load a scene previously created with OpenToonz as a level of the "
"current scene. You can also collapse selected columns/layers to form a new Sub-"
"Xsheet to better manage the scene, for example you can collapse into a Sub-"
"Xsheet all the columns/layers used to define a character, or explode a Sub-"
"Xsheet to automatically bring all of its contents into the Xsheet/Timeline "
"where it is exposed."
msgstr ""
"您可以将之前使用OpenToonz创建的场景加载为当前场景的一个级别。您还可以折叠选定的"
"列/层以形成新的子X表，从而更好地管理场景，例如，您可以将用于定义角色的所有列/层"
"折叠到子X表中，或者分解子X表以自动将其所有内容带到其暴露的X表/时间线中。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1169
msgid ""
"As Sub-Xsheets can be loaded and saved, they can also be used for importing or "
"exporting sections of an Xsheet/Timeline from one scene to another. For "
"example, if you create a scene where several levels compose a character (head, "
"body, shadow, etc.), you can save it and import it later in a different scene "
"as a Sub-Xsheet."
msgstr ""
"由于子Xsheets可以加载和保存，因此它们也可以用于将Xsheet/Timeline的部分从一个场景"
"导入或导出到另一个场景。例如，如果创建了一个场景，其中多个级别组成了一个角色（头"
"部、身体、阴影等），则可以将其保存，稍后将其作为子Xsheet导入到其他场景中。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1171
msgid ""
"When working inside a Sub-Xsheet, by default only its own contents are "
"displayed in the viewer. If you need to edit the Sub-Xsheet contents while "
"looking at the whole scene contents, you can activate the **Edit in Place** "
"mode."
msgstr ""
"在Sub Xsheet中工作时，默认情况下，查看器中只显示其自身的内容。如果需要在查看整个"
"场景内容的同时编辑子Xsheet内容，可以激活**原地编辑**模式。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1173
msgid ""
"Like standard Xsheets/Timelines, Sub-Xsheets can also contain audio files to be "
"used for synchronizing a soundtrack with the animation. However, audio files "
"loaded inside Sub-Xsheets are ignored when an output file supporting audio is "
"rendered, because the possibility to edit the Sub-Xsheet columns/layers frame "
"order could make the resulting soundtrack inconsistent (see  :ref:`Creating a "
"Soundtrack <creating_a_soundtrack>`  )."
msgstr ""
"与标准的Xsheets/Timelines一样，Sub Xsheets也可以包含用于将配乐与动画同步的音频文"
"件。然而，当渲染支持音频的输出文件时，加载在Sub Xsheets中的音频文件会被忽略，因"
"为编辑Sub Xsheet列/层帧顺序的可能性可能会使生成的音轨不一致（请参阅：ref:`创建音"
"轨<Creating_a_track>'）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1179
msgid "Creating Sub-Xsheets"
msgstr "创建子X表"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1180
msgid ""
"Sub-Xsheets are managed by the Xsheet menu commands, and by buttons in the "
"Xsheet Toolbar."
msgstr "子Xsheets由Xsheet菜单命令和Xsheet工具栏中的按钮管理。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1182
msgid ""
"You can create a Sub-Xsheet by collapsing one or several columns/layers where "
"levels are exposed, choosing to include when needed the pegbars to which the "
"columns are linked; or you can cut or copy columns/layers and drawings outside "
"of the Sub-Xsheet, then paste them inside of it."
msgstr ""
"您可以通过折叠一个或多个暴露标高的列/层来创建Sub Xsheet，并在需要时选择包含列链"
"接到的钉杆；或者，您可以在Sub Xsheet外部剪切或复制列/图层和图形，然后将它们粘贴"
"到其中。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1184
msgid ""
"The main Xsheet/Timeline will share with its Sub-Xsheets the animation level "
"database, so if the same level is exposed in the main Xsheet/Timeline and in "
"one of its Sub-Xsheets, the level and its properties will be shared."
msgstr ""
"主Xsheet/Timeline将与其子Xsheets共享动画级别数据库，因此，如果同一级别在主"
"Xsheet/Timeline及其子Xsheet中显示，则级别及其属性将被共享。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1186
msgid ""
"When copying Sub-Xsheet columns/layers and cells, their copies refer always to "
"the same Sub-Xsheet contents: if changes are made in the Sub-Xsheet, all the "
"cells in the main Xsheet/Timeline referring to that Sub-Xsheet will "
"consequently change their content. If you want to create a copy of a Sub-Xsheet "
"whose contents can be changed independently as concerning internal level "
"exposure, object animation and applied FX, it is possible to **Clone** it."
msgstr ""
"复制子Xsheet列/层和单元格时，它们的副本始终引用相同的子Xsheets内容：如果对子"
"Xsheet进行更改，则主Xsheet/Timeline中引用该子Xsheete的所有单元格都会相应地更改其"
"内容。如果您想创建一个子X表的副本，其内容可以独立更改，如内部级别曝光、对象动画"
"和应用的FX，则可以**克隆**它。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1188
msgid "**To create a Sub-Xsheet by collapsing one or several columns:**"
msgstr "**要通过折叠一列或多列来创建子X表格，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1190
msgid ""
"Select the columns you want to be part of the Sub-Xsheet in the Xsheet/Timeline "
"or in the Schematic."
msgstr "在Xsheet/Timeline或原理图中选择要成为子Xsheet一部分的列。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1194
msgid "Choose Xsheet  →  **Collapse**."
msgstr "选择Xsheet→  **折叠**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1196
msgid "Click the **Collapse** button in the Xsheet Toolbar."
msgstr "单击Xsheet工具栏中的**折叠**按钮。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1198
msgid ""
"Right-click any column header and choose **Collapse** from the menu that opens."
msgstr "右键单击任何列标题，然后从打开的菜单中选择**折叠**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1200
msgid ""
"Choose whether to include relevant pegbars in the Sub-Xsheet or collapse "
"selected columns only, then click the OK button."
msgstr "选择是在子X表格中包含相关标记栏，还是仅折叠所选列，然后单击“确定”按钮。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1202
msgid "**To exit a Sub-Xsheet:**"
msgstr "**要退出子Xsheet，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1204 ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1234
msgid "Do one of the following"
msgstr "执行以下操作之一"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1206
msgid "Choose Xsheet  →  **Close Sub-Xsheet**."
msgstr "选择Xsheet→  **关闭子表格**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1208
msgid "Click the **Close Sub-Xsheet** button in the Xsheet Toolbar."
msgstr "单击Xsheet工具栏中的**关闭子Xsheet**按钮。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1210
msgid "**To open a closed Sub-Xsheet:**"
msgstr "**要打开已关闭的子X表格，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1212
msgid ""
"Select the Sub-Xsheet column in the Xsheet/Timeline, or the Sub-Xsheet node in "
"the Schematic."
msgstr "在X表/时间线中选择子X表列，或在原理图中选择子Xsheet节点。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1216
msgid "Choose Xsheet  →  **Open Sub-Xsheet**."
msgstr "选择Xsheet→  **打开子X表格**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1218
msgid "Click the **Open Sub-Xsheet** button in the Xsheet/Timeline Toolbar."
msgstr "单击X表格/时间线工具栏中的**打开子X表格**按钮。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1220
msgid ""
"Right-click the column header and choose **Open Sub-Xsheet** from the menu that "
"opens."
msgstr "右键单击列标题，然后从打开的菜单中选择**打开子Xsheet**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1222
msgid "**To clone a Sub-Xsheet:**"
msgstr "**要克隆子Xsheet，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1224
msgid ""
"Select the Xsheet column (or Timeline layer) where the Sub-Xsheet you want to "
"clone is exposed."
msgstr "选择要克隆的子Xsheet所在的Xsheet列（或Timeline层）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1228
msgid "Choose Xsheet  →  **Clone Sub-Xsheet**."
msgstr "选择Xsheet→  **克隆子X表**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1230
msgid ""
"Right-click the column header and choose **Clone Sub-Xsheet** from the menu "
"that opens."
msgstr "右键单击列标题，然后从打开的菜单中选择**克隆子Xsheet**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1232
msgid "**To toggle edit a Sub-Xsheet in its context:**"
msgstr "**要在其上下文中切换编辑子X表格，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1236
msgid "Choose Xsheet  →  **Toggle Edit in Place**."
msgstr "选择Xsheet→  **切换就地编辑**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1238
msgid "Click the **Toggle Edit in Place** button in the Xsheet/Timeline Toolbar."
msgstr "单击Xsheet/Timeline工具栏中的**切换就地编辑**按钮。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1240
msgid "**To resequence a Sub-Xsheet:**"
msgstr "**要重新排序子Xsheet，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1242
msgid "Select the column/layer containing the Sub-Xsheet."
msgstr "选择包含子X表的列/层。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1246
msgid "Choose Xsheet  →  **Resequence**."
msgstr "选择Xsheet→  **后果**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1248
msgid ""
"Right-click the column header and choose **Resequence** from the menu that "
"opens."
msgstr "右键单击列标题，然后从打开的菜单中选择**重新排序**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1254
msgid "Loading a Scene as a Sub-Xsheet"
msgstr "将场景作为子Xsheet加载"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1255
msgid ""
"Previously saved OpenToonz scenes can be loaded in a Xsheet/Timeline as Sub-"
"Xsheets."
msgstr "以前保存的OpenToonz场景可以作为子Xsheets加载到Xsheet/Timeline中。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1257
msgid ""
"Every time a scene is loaded as a Sub-Xsheet, its contents are imported into "
"the current project database according to the project default folders, in the "
"same way as it would be if every single level was imported (see  :ref:`Using "
"the File Browser <using_the_file_browser>`  )."
msgstr ""
"每次将场景加载为子Xsheet时，其内容都会根据项目默认文件夹导入到当前项目数据库中，"
"就像导入每个级别一样（请参阅：ref:`使用文件浏览器<Using_the_File_Browser>`）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1259
msgid ""
"This allows you to create a library of basic animations that can be loaded and "
"edited in other Xsheets/Timelines to create more complex animations without "
"affecting the original files or drawings. Even when the same Sub-Xsheet is "
"loaded twice, it is handled as if two different Sub-Xsheets were loaded, whose "
"contents and levels can be edited separately."
msgstr ""
"这允许您创建一个基本动画库，可以在其他Xsheets/Timelines中加载和编辑，以创建更复"
"杂的动画，而不会影响原始文件或图形。即使加载了两次相同的子Xsheet，也会将其视为加"
"载了两个不同的子Xseets，其内容和级别可以单独编辑。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1261
msgid ""
"To keep the database well-ordered you can also activate the **Create Sub-folder "
"when Importing Sub-Xsheet** option in the Preferences  →  Loading dialog, that "
"will automatically create, in the project default folder, a folder named as the "
"Sub-Xsheet you are importing where the levels from the Sub-Xsheet will be "
"copied."
msgstr ""
"为了使数据库保持有序，您还可以在“首选项”中激活“导入子Xsheet时创建子文件夹”**选项"
"→  加载对话框，该对话框将在项目默认文件夹中自动创建一个名为您要导入的子Xsheet的"
"文件夹，其中将复制子Xsheets中的级别。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1263
msgid ""
"Once a Sub-Xsheet is loaded, its levels are available in the Scene Cast in a "
"sub-folder named as the scene you loaded."
msgstr "加载子Xsheet后，其级别将在名为加载的场景的子文件夹中的“场景投射”中可用。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1265
msgid ""
"If the camera settings of the scene you are loading as a Sub-Xsheet are "
"different from those of your current scene, you will be prompted whether to "
"keep the Sub-Xsheet original camera settings, or to apply the camera settings "
"of the current scene to the Sub-Xsheet as well."
msgstr ""
"如果您作为子X表加载的场景的相机设置与当前场景的不同，系统将提示您是保留子X表的原"
"始相机设置，还是将当前场景的相机设定也应用于子X表。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1267
msgid ""
"If the scene you import contains a file whose name is the same of a file "
"already existing in the destination default folder, you will prompted whether "
"to keep the existing file, overwrite it with the new one, or rename it adding a "
"suffix you can decide. In this way you can control if files you are importing "
"were already imported previously, or manage files that share the same name."
msgstr ""
"如果导入的场景包含一个文件，其名称与目标默认文件夹中已存在的文件相同，系统将提示"
"您是保留现有文件、用新文件覆盖它，还是重命名它并添加您可以决定的后缀。通过这种方"
"式，您可以控制要导入的文件是否以前已导入，或者管理共享相同名称的文件。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1269
msgid "**To load a previously saved scene as a Sub-Xsheet:**"
msgstr "**要将以前保存的场景加载为子Xsheet，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1273
msgid "Choose Level  →  **Load Level...** and use the browser to load a TNZ file."
msgstr "选择级别→  **负载水平。..**并使用浏览器加载TNZ文件。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1275
msgid ""
"Choose File  →  **Load As Sub-Xsheet...** and use the browser to load a TNZ "
"file."
msgstr "选择文件→  **作为子X表格加载。..**并使用浏览器加载TNZ文件。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1277
msgid ""
"Use the OpenToonz standard browser to drag the scene icon to the Scene Cast "
"pane, the Xsheet/Timeline or the Viewer."
msgstr ""
"使用OpenToonz标准浏览器将场景图标拖动到“场景投射”窗格、Xsheet/Timeline或查看器"
"中。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1279
msgid ""
"In the file browser right-click the scene icon and select **Load As Sub-"
"Xsheet** in the menu that opens."
msgstr ""
"在文件浏览器中，右键单击场景图标，然后在打开的菜单中选择**作为子Xsheet**加载。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1281
msgid ""
"OpenToonz scene files can also be loaded by dragging and dropping them from the "
"Windows Explorer or macOS Finder to the Scene Cast, Xsheet/Timeline, or the "
"viewer."
msgstr ""
"OpenToonz场景文件也可以通过将它们从Windows资源管理器或macOS Finder拖放到scene "
"Cast、Xsheet/Timeline或查看器来加载。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1287
msgid "Exploding Sub-Xsheets"
msgstr "爆炸子X表"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1288
msgid ""
"Sub-Xsheets can be exploded to automatically bring their content into the "
"Xsheet/Timeline where they are exposed. When exploding a Sub-Xsheet it's "
"possible to choose to bring to the main Xsheet/Timeline, when needed, the "
"pegbars to which columns are linked."
msgstr ""
"子Xsheets可以被分解，以自动将其内容带入Xsheet/Timeline中。分解子Xsheet时，可以选"
"择在需要时将列链接到的标记带到主Xsheet/Timeline。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1290
msgid ""
"When a Sub-Xsheet is exploded, its columns/layers and the related FX nodes are "
"displayed as a group in the FX Schematic, in order to better retrieve them "
"(see  :ref:`Using the FX Schematic <using_the_fx_schematic>`  )."
msgstr ""
"分解子Xsheet时，其列/层和相关FX节点在FX原理图中显示为一个组，以便更好地检索它们"
"（请参阅：ref:“使用FX原理图<Using-the_FX_schema>”）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1292
msgid ""
"If FXs are applied to the Sub-Xsheet column/layer, they will not be applied to "
"the exploded columns, but the disconnected FX nodes will remain as reference in "
"the FX Schematic."
msgstr ""
"如果将FX应用于子Xsheet列/层，则它们不会应用于分解列，但断开连接的FX节点仍将作为"
"FX原理图中的参考。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1294
msgid "**To explode a Sub-Xsheet:**"
msgstr "**要分解子X表格，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1296
msgid ""
"Select the Sub-Xsheet column/layer in the Xsheet/Timeline or in the Schematic."
msgstr "在X表/时间线或原理图中选择子X表列/层。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1300
msgid "Choose Xsheet  →  **Explode Sub-Xsheet**."
msgstr "选择Xsheet→  **分解子X表**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1302
msgid ""
"Right-click the Sub-Xsheet *column header* and choose **Explode Sub-Xsheet** "
"from the menu that opens."
msgstr "右键单击子X表格*列标题*，然后从打开的菜单中选择**分解子X表格**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1304
msgid ""
"Choose whether to bring relevant pegbars to the main Xsheet/Timeline, or to "
"bring columns/layers only, then click the OK button."
msgstr ""
"选择是将相关标记栏带到主Xsheet/Timeline，还是仅带列/层，然后单击“确定”按钮。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1310
msgid "Saving a Sub-Xsheet as a Scene"
msgstr "将子Xsheet另存为场景"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1311
msgid ""
"The content of a Sub-Xsheet can be saved as a standard scene, i.e. a TNZ file, "
"in order to be loaded as a stand-alone scene or to be available for reuse in "
"other scenes."
msgstr ""
"Sub Xsheet的内容可以保存为标准场景，即TNZ文件，以便作为独立场景加载或在其他场景"
"中重复使用。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1313
msgid ""
"The Sub-Xsheet content will be saved according to the current project settings "
"for default folders, as if you were saving a scene file (see  :ref:`Project "
"Default Folders <project_default_folders>`  )."
msgstr ""
"子Xsheet内容将根据默认文件夹的当前项目设置进行保存，就像保存场景文件一样（请参"
"见：ref:“项目默认文件夹<project_default_folders>”）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1315
msgid "**To save a Sub-Xsheet as a scene:**"
msgstr "**要将子Xsheet另存为场景，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1317
msgid ""
"Open the Sub-Xsheet you want to save, so that its contents are displayed in the "
"Xsheet/Timeline."
msgstr "打开要保存的子Xsheet，使其内容显示在Xsheet/Timeline中。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1319
msgid ""
"Choose Xsheet  →  **Save Sub-Xsheet As...** and use the browser to save the "
"scene file (see  :ref:`Saving and Loading Scenes "
"<saving_and_loading_scenes>`  )."
msgstr ""
"选择Xsheet→  **将子Xsheet另存为…**并使用浏览器保存场景文件（请参阅：ref:“保存和"
"加载场景<saveg_and_Loading_Scenes>”）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1325
msgid "Creating a Soundtrack"
msgstr "创建音轨"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1326
msgid ""
"Audio clips can be loaded and edited in order to create a soundtrack for the "
"scene; natively supported file formats are non-compressed ``WAV`` and ``AIFF``  "
"files at 8 and 16 bit. If FFmpeg is installed and configured in Preferences...  "
"→  Import/Export dialog section, ``MP3`` audio files can be loaded too. There "
"is no limit to the number of audio clips that can be loaded in a scene."
msgstr ""
"可以加载和编辑音频片段，为场景创建配乐；本机支持的文件格式是8位和16位的非压"
"缩“WAV”和“AIFF”文件。如果在首选项中安装并配置了FFmpeg。..  →  导入/导出对话框部"
"分，也可以加载“MP3”音频文件。场景中可以加载的音频片段数量没有限制。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1328
msgid ""
"To load an audio clip you can use the Browser room; if an audio clip is "
"imported, it is saved in the *+extras* folder (see  :ref:`Using the File "
"Browser <using_the_file_browser>`  ). Loaded audio clips are also stored in the "
"Audio folder of the Scene Cast."
msgstr ""
"要加载音频片段，您可以使用浏览器室；如果导入了音频片段，它将保存在*+extras*文件"
"夹中（请参阅：ref:“使用文件浏览器<Using_the_File_Browser>”）。加载的音频片段也存"
"储在“场景投射”的“音频”文件夹中。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1330
msgid ""
"Each loaded audio clip is exposed in a different Xsheet column or Timeline "
"layer as a series of visible sound waves to make the editing job easier; the "
"number of frames it spans depends on the length of the audio file and the frame "
"rate set for the current scene. For example an audio clip 3 seconds long, "
"imported into a scene whose frame rate is 12, will occupy 36 frames; if "
"imported in a scene whose frame rate is 24 will occupy 72 frames (see  :ref:"
"`Setting the Frame Rate <setting_the_frame_rate>`  )."
msgstr ""
"每个加载的音频片段都以一系列可见声波的形式显示在不同的Xsheet列或Timeline层中，使"
"编辑工作更容易；它跨越的帧数取决于音频文件的长度和为当前场景设置的帧速率。例如，"
"导入到帧速率为12的场景中的3秒长的音频片段将占用36帧；如果导入到帧速率为24的场景"
"中，将占用72帧（请参阅：ref:“设置帧速率<Setting_the_frame_rate>”）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1332
msgid "|audio|"
msgstr "|音频|"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1334
msgid ""
"Audio columns/layers can be edited the way you edit any other column/layer. Its "
"header contains the following information about the content:"
msgstr ""
"音频列/层可以像编辑任何其他列/层一样进行编辑。其标题包含有关内容的以下信息："

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1336
msgid ""
"**Name**, by default is the number of the column/layer the audio is exposed in. "
"e.g. Col5."
msgstr "**名称**，默认情况下是音频显示的列/层的编号。例如Col5。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1338
msgid ""
"**Render toggle** (|preview|) allowing you to include or not the audio column/"
"layer content in the rendering."
msgstr "**渲染切换**（|预览|）允许您在渲染中包含或不包含音频列/层内容。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1340
msgid ""
"**Camera stand toggle** (|camera_stand|) allowing you to include or not the "
"column/layer content when scrubbing the audio with the current frame cursor "
"(see below)."
msgstr ""
"**相机支架切换**（|Camera_stand|）允许您在用当前帧光标擦除音频时包含或不包含列/"
"层内容（见下文）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1344
msgid ""
"**Additional settings** button (|additional_settings|) allowing you to set the "
"volume."
msgstr "**附加设置**按钮（|Additional_settings|）允许您设置音量。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1346
msgid "**Loudspeaker** icon that lets you play the contents back."
msgstr "**扬声器**图标，用于播放内容。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1348
msgid ""
"The **Level Settings** dialog is available for audio clips as well, allowing "
"you to check the location of the related file, or to update the loading path to "
"a different location, or to a different file (see  :ref:`Editing Level Settings "
"<editing_level_settings>`  )."
msgstr ""
"**层级设置**对话框也可用于音频剪辑，允许您检查相关文件的位置，或将加载路径更新到"
"其他位置或其他文件（请参阅：ref:`编辑级别设置<Editing_Level_Settings>`）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1350
msgid ""
"The soundtrack you define with audio clips will be created by merging all of "
"the contents of audio columns/layers according to the volume you set for each "
"of them. While it cannot be played back when using the playback controls in the "
"viewer, it can be scrubbed with the current frame cursor in the Xsheet frame "
"column, the Timeline frame ruler or in the viewer framebar, and played back "
"when a scene is previewed (see  :ref:`Editing Audio Clips "
"<editing_audio_clips>`  and  :ref:`Previewing the Animation "
"<previewing_the_animation>`  )."
msgstr ""
"您使用音频片段定义的配乐将根据您为每个音频列/层设置的音量，通过合并音频列/图层的"
"所有内容来创建。虽然在查看器中使用播放控件时无法播放，但可以用Xsheet帧列、时间线"
"帧标尺或查看器帧栏中的当前帧光标擦除它，并在预览场景时播放（请参阅：ref:“编辑音"
"频剪辑<Editing_Audio_Clips>”和：ref:`预览动画<Previewing_the_Animation>”）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1352
msgid ""
"When a scene is rendered in a file format supporting audio, (MP4, MOV, WebM or "
"AVI), the soundtrack will be included in the file (see  :ref:`Rendering the "
"Animation <rendering_the_animation>`  )."
msgstr ""
"当场景以支持音频的文件格式（MP4、MOV、WebM或AVI）渲染时，配乐将包含在文件中（请"
"参阅：ref:`渲染动画<Rendering_the_Animation>`）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1354
msgid ""
"Audio clips loaded in Sub-Xsheets will not be included in the output soundtrack "
"(see  :ref:`Using Sub-Xsheets <using_sub-xsheets>`  )."
msgstr ""
"加载到Sub Xsheets中的音频片段将不会包含在输出音轨中（请参阅：ref:“使用Sub "
"Xsheets<Using_Sub-Xsheets>”）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1356
msgid ""
"As the soundtrack cannot be played back when viewing files in the OpenToonz "
"flipbook, you can activate the **Use Default Viewer for Movie Formats** option "
"in the Preferences...  →  General dialog section, in order to view files with "
"their own default viewer, e.g. QuickTime for the MOV format, thus playing back "
"the soundtrack as well."
msgstr ""
"由于在OpenToonz翻页书中查看文件时无法播放原声，您可以在“首选项”中激活“使用默认电"
"影格式查看器”选项。..  →  常规对话框部分，以便使用自己的默认查看器查看文件，例如"
"MOV格式的QuickTime，从而也可以播放配乐。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1358
msgid "**To play the contents of an audio column/layer back:**"
msgstr "**要播放音频列/层的内容，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1360
msgid ""
"Click the loudspeaker icon available in the header of the column/layer. Click "
"it again to stop the playback."
msgstr "单击列/层标题中可用的扬声器图标。再次单击以停止播放。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1362
msgid "**To set the volume of an audio column/layer:**"
msgstr "**要设置音频列/层的音量，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1364
msgid ""
"Click the Additional settings button (|additional_settings|) and use the Volume "
"slider in there."
msgstr "单击附加设置按钮（|Additional_settings|）并使用其中的音量滑块。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1366
msgid ""
"**To include or exclude an audio when scrubbing the audio with the current "
"frame cursor**"
msgstr "**使用当前帧光标清除音频时包含或排除音频**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1368
msgid ""
"Click the Camera stand toggle (|camera_stand|) on the column/layer header. If "
"you right-click the toggle you can select commands from a menu that opens that "
"let you affect several columns/layers at the same time."
msgstr ""
"单击列/图层标题上的相机支架切换（|Camera_stand|）。如果右键单击切换，则可以从打"
"开的菜单中选择命令，该菜单允许您同时影响多个列/层。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1370
msgid ""
"**To include or exclude the audio column/layer contents from the rendering:**"
msgstr "**要在渲染中包含或排除音频列/层内容，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1372
msgid ""
"Click the Render toggle (|preview|) on the column/layer header. If you right-"
"click the toggle you can select commands from a menu that opens that let you "
"affect several columns/layers at the same time."
msgstr ""
"单击列/层标题上的“渲染”切换（|预览|）。如果右键单击切换，则可以从打开的菜单中选"
"择命令，该菜单允许您同时影响多个列/层。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1376
msgid ""
"Click the Lock toggle (|lock|) on the column/layer header. If you right-click "
"the toggle you can select commands from a menu that opens that let you lock or "
"unlock several columns/layers at the same time."
msgstr ""
"单击列/图层标题上的锁定切换（|Lock|）。如果右键单击切换，则可以从打开的菜单中选"
"择命令，该菜单允许您同时锁定或解锁多个列/层。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1382
msgid "Editing Audio Clips"
msgstr "编辑音频剪辑"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1383
msgid ""
"Once loaded, audio clips can be moved up and down in a Xsheet column, left and "
"right in a Timeline layer, or to a different column/layer, in order to be "
"played starting from a certain frame of the animation. They can be trimmed to "
"select a part of the whole clip and edited, by deleting or copying some "
"sections, using standard edit commands the same way you use them on standard "
"levels."
msgstr ""
"加载后，音频片段可以在Xsheet列中上下移动，在Timeline层中左右移动，或移动到不同的"
"列/层，以便从动画的某一帧开始播放。可以修剪它们以选择整个剪辑的一部分，并通过删"
"除或复制一些部分进行编辑，使用标准编辑命令，就像在标准级别上使用它们一样。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1385
msgid ""
"When a clip is trimmed, the trimmed part is not eliminated, but hidden, and it "
"has a colored horizontal marker at its starting or ending, according to where "
"it was trimmed: it is possible to retrieve the trimmed part by moving back the "
"markers."
msgstr ""
"修剪剪辑时，修剪的部分不会被消除，而是隐藏，并且根据修剪的位置，它的开始或结束处"
"有一个彩色水平标记：可以通过向后移动标记来检索修剪的部分。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1387
msgid ""
"When a clip is split into sections by deleting, cutting or moving operations, "
"it is automatically duplicated and trimmed to create the right result."
msgstr ""
"当通过删除、剪切或移动操作将片段拆分为多个部分时，它会自动复制和修剪以创建正确的"
"结果。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1389
msgid ""
"Audio clips can be moved and pasted only to empty columns/layers, or to other "
"audio columns/layers."
msgstr "音频剪辑只能移动和粘贴到空列/层，或其他音频列/层。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1391
msgid ""
"All the editing does not affect the file on disk, as it refers only to the way "
"the clip is used in the scene."
msgstr "所有编辑都不会影响磁盘上的文件，因为它只涉及片段在场景中的使用方式。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1393
msgid ""
"To find a particular section in an audio file, you can examine it by scrubbing "
"it with the current frame cursor, either in the Xsheet frame column, the "
"Timeline frame ruler, in the viewer framebar, or by selecting any section and "
"automatically playing it back together with the animation. This allows you to "
"easily spot and excerpt the sections you need from an audio file."
msgstr ""
"要在音频文件中查找特定部分，您可以使用当前帧光标在Xsheet帧列、Timeline帧标尺、查"
"看器帧栏中擦洗它，或者选择任何部分并自动将其与动画一起播放。这使您可以轻松地从音"
"频文件中发现和摘录所需的部分。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1395
msgid "**To select audio clips:**"
msgstr "**要选择音频片段，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1399
msgid "Click and drag to select a section of the clip."
msgstr "单击并拖动以选择片段的一部分。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1401
msgid "Shift-click a clip cell to extend the selection up to that cell."
msgstr "按住Shift键并单击剪切单元格，将选择范围扩展到该单元格。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1403
msgid ""
"In the Xsheet, click the vertical strip available on the left of the clip, to "
"select the whole clip."
msgstr "在Xsheet中，单击剪辑左侧可用的垂直条带，以选择整个剪辑。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1405
msgid ""
"In the Timeline, click the horizontal strip available on the top of the clip, "
"to select the whole clip."
msgstr "在“时间线”中，单击剪辑顶部可用的水平条，以选择整个剪辑。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1407
msgid "**To edit audio clips with the Edit menu commands:**"
msgstr "**要使用“编辑”菜单命令编辑音频片段，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1413
msgid ""
"Use the **Cut** command to eliminate the selection from the Xsheet/Timeline and "
"keep it in memory for further operations. The cell elimination causes the "
"following cells to shift up in the Xsheet or left in the Timeline."
msgstr ""
"使用**剪切**命令从Xsheet/Timeline中删除选择，并将其保留在内存中以供进一步操作。"
"删除单元格会导致以下单元格在Xsheet中向上移动或在Timeline中向左移动。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1415
msgid ""
"Use the **Paste** command to paste the selection kept in memory in the Xsheet/"
"Timeline, starting from the selected insertion cell. The command causes the "
"following cells to shift down in the Xsheet or right in the Timeline."
msgstr ""
"使用**粘贴**命令，从选定的插入单元格开始，将保存在Xsheet/Timeline内存中的选择粘"
"贴。该命令使以下单元格在Xsheet中向下移动或在Timeline中向右移动。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1423
msgid "**To move a clip selection in the Xsheet:**"
msgstr "**要在Xsheet中移动剪辑选择，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1427
msgid ""
"**Click** the vertical strip available on the left of the clip cells, and drag "
"them to move them to a new position."
msgstr "**单击剪辑单元格左侧可用的垂直条带**，然后拖动它们将其移动到新位置。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1429
msgid ""
"**Ctrl-click** (PC) or **Cmd-click** (Mac) the vertical strip available on the "
"left of the clip cells, and drag them to the new position duplicating them."
msgstr ""
"**Ctrl单击**（PC）或**Cmd单击**（Mac）剪辑单元格左侧可用的垂直条，然后将它们拖动"
"到新位置，复制它们。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1431
msgid ""
"**Shift-click** the vertical strip available on the left of the clip cells, and "
"drag them to the new position inserting them if other audio clips are loaded in "
"the destination cells."
msgstr ""
"**按住Shift键并单击**剪辑单元格左侧可用的垂直条，然后将它们拖动到新位置，如果目"
"标单元格中加载了其他音频剪辑，则插入它们。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1433
msgid ""
"**Alt-click** the vertical strip available on the left of the clip cells, and "
"drag them to the new position overwriting any other audio clips previously "
"loaded in the destination cells."
msgstr ""
"**Alt键单击**剪辑单元格左侧可用的垂直条，并将其拖动到新位置，覆盖之前加载到目标"
"单元格中的任何其他音频剪辑。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1435
msgid "**To move a clip selection in the Timeline:**"
msgstr "**要在时间线中移动剪辑选择，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1439
msgid ""
"**Click** the horizontal strip available on the top of the clip cells, and drag "
"them to move them to a new position."
msgstr "**单击**剪辑单元格顶部可用的水平条，并拖动它们将其移动到新位置。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1441
msgid ""
"**Ctrl-click** (PC) or **Cmd-click** (Mac) the horizontal strip available on "
"the top of the clip cells, and drag them to the new position duplicating them."
msgstr ""
"**Ctrl单击**（PC）或**Cmd单击**（Mac）剪辑单元格顶部可用的水平条，并将其拖动到新"
"位置，复制它们。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1443
msgid ""
"**Shift-click** the horizontal strip available on the top of the clip cells, "
"and drag them to the new position inserting them if other audio clips are "
"loaded in the destination cells."
msgstr ""
"**按住Shift键并单击**剪辑单元格顶部可用的水平条，然后将它们拖动到新位置，如果目"
"标单元格中加载了其他音频剪辑，则插入它们。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1445
msgid ""
"**Alt-click** the horizontal strip available on the top of the clip cells, and "
"drag them to the new position overwriting any other audio clips previously "
"loaded in the destination cells."
msgstr ""
"**Alt键单击**剪辑单元格顶部可用的水平条，并将其拖动到新位置，覆盖之前加载到目标"
"单元格中的任何其他音频剪辑。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1447
msgid ""
"When it is not possible to release the selection, a red outline is displayed "
"instead of the selection."
msgstr "当无法释放选择时，将显示红色轮廓而不是选择。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1449
msgid "**To trim an audio clip:**"
msgstr "**要修剪音频剪辑，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1453
msgid "Click and drag the starting of a clip to trim its starting part."
msgstr "单击并拖动片段的起始部分以修剪其起始部分。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1455
msgid "Click and drag the ending of a clip to trim its ending part."
msgstr "单击并拖动剪辑的结尾以修剪其结尾部分。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1457
msgid "Click and drag the marker of a trimmed clip to redefine the trimmed part."
msgstr "单击并拖动修剪片段的标记以重新定义修剪的零件。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1459 ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1488
msgid "**To scrub audio clips:**"
msgstr "**要清除音频片段，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1463
msgid ""
"Drag the Xsheet frame cursor up or down to scrub all the audio columns whose "
"Camera Stand toggle is active."
msgstr ""
"向上或向下拖动Xsheet框架光标，以擦除“相机支架”切换处于活动状态的所有音频列。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1465
msgid ""
"Drag the Timeline frame cursor left or right to scrub all the audio layers "
"whose Camera Stand toggle is active."
msgstr ""
"向左或向右拖动“时间线”帧光标，以擦除“相机支架”切换处于活动状态的所有音频层。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1467
msgid ""
"Drag the frame cursor in the viewer framebar to scrub all the audio columns "
"whose Camera Stand toggle is active."
msgstr ""
"拖动查看器帧栏中的帧光标，以擦除“摄影机支架”切换处于活动状态的所有音频列。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1469
msgid ""
"Windows only: In the Xsheet, click and drag on the dashed vertical strip "
"available on the right of the audio column cells, the selected section will be "
"automatically played back."
msgstr ""
"仅限Windows：在Xsheet中，单击并拖动音频列单元格右侧可用的垂直虚线条，所选部分将"
"自动播放。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1471
msgid ""
"Windows only: In the Timeline, click and drag on the dashed horizontal strip "
"available on the bottom of the audio layer cells, the selected section will be "
"automatically played back."
msgstr ""
"仅限Windows：在时间线中，单击并拖动音频层单元格底部可用的虚线水平条，所选部分将"
"自动播放。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1477
msgid "Lip Syncing"
msgstr "假唱"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1478
msgid ""
"When you need to synchronize the movement of a character’s lips with the sound "
"of the speech, you can take advantage of the possibility to examine the audio "
"files loaded in the scene."
msgstr ""
"当您需要将角色嘴唇的运动与语音同步时，您可以利用检查场景中加载的音频文件的可能"
"性。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1480
msgid ""
"Once you have created different mouth images, you can analyze the audio files "
"to find where to place specific mouth drawings. If mouth drawings belong to one "
"single animation level, you can quickly change the mouth drawing at a specific "
"frame by picking drawings from the level strip or by flipping through drawings "
"using one of the **Skeleton** tool (|skeleton|) features (see :ref:`Using the "
"Level Strip <using_the_level_strip>`  and :ref:`Animating Models "
"<animating_models>`  )."
msgstr ""
"创建不同的嘴部图像后，您可以分析音频文件以找到放置特定嘴部图形的位置。如果嘴部图"
"形属于一个单独的动画级别，则可以通过从级别条中拾取图形或使用**骨架**工具（|"
"Skeleton|）功能之一翻转图形来快速更改特定帧处的嘴部图形（请参见：ref:“使用级别条"
"<using_the_level_strip>”和：ref:`动画模型<animation_Models>”）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1482
msgid ""
"The breakdown of audio files can be done by looking at the sound wave in the "
"scene column, for example to spot where each word starts; by scrubbing the "
"loaded audio clips with the current frame cursor either in the Xsheet/Timeline "
"frame ruler or in the Viewer framebar; and by listening to specific sections of "
"the audio files."
msgstr ""
"音频文件的分解可以通过查看场景列中的声波来完成，例如找出每个单词的开头；通过在"
"Xsheet/Timeline帧标尺或查看器框架栏中用当前帧光标擦除加载的音频片段；以及通过收"
"听音频文件的特定部分。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1484
msgid ""
"When mouth images are placed in the proper place, you can check the sync by "
"scrubbing or selecting again the audio file section you are interested in, "
"because while listening to the selected audio section, the viewer will display "
"the related animation frames."
msgstr ""
"当嘴部图像放置在适当的位置时，您可以通过擦洗或再次选择您感兴趣的音频文件部分来检"
"查同步，因为在收听所选音频部分时，观众将显示相关的动画帧。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1486
msgid ""
"This technique can be used in any case you need the sound to be perfectly "
"synchronized with the action, for example a character playing an instrument, or "
"a scene based on the rhythm of a music."
msgstr ""
"这种技术可以在任何需要声音与动作完美同步的情况下使用，例如角色演奏乐器，或基于音"
"乐节奏的场景。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1492
msgid ""
"Drag the Xsheet/Timeline frame cursor forward or backwards to scrub all the "
"audio levels whose Camera Stand toggle is active."
msgstr ""
"向前或向后拖动Xsheet/Timeline帧光标，以擦除相机支架切换处于活动状态的所有音频级"
"别。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1494
msgid ""
"Drag the frame cursor in the Viewer framebar to scrub all the audio columns "
"whose Camera Stand toggle is active."
msgstr ""
"拖动查看器框架栏中的框架光标，以擦除“相机支架”切换处于活动状态的所有音频列。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1496
msgid ""
"Windows only: click and drag on the dashed strip available on the audio level "
"cells: the selected section will be automatically played back."
msgstr "仅限Windows：单击并拖动音频级别单元格上可用的虚线条：所选部分将自动播放。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1498
msgid "**To flip through the mouth drawings:**"
msgstr "**要翻转嘴部图形，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1502
msgid ""
"Select in the Xsheet or Timeline the animation level containing the mouth "
"drawings."
msgstr "在Xsheet或Timeline中选择包含嘴部图形的动画级别。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1504
msgid ""
"Right-click in the viewer over the mouth drawing you want to flip through, and "
"choose the **Select** command related to the column/layer containing the "
"drawing you clicked."
msgstr ""
"在查看器中右键单击要翻转的嘴部图形，然后选择与包含所单击图形的列/层相关的**选择"
"**命令。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1506
msgid ""
"Choose the **Skeleton** tool (|skeleton|) and set the tool mode to **Animate**."
msgstr "选择**骨架**工具（|Skeleton|），并将工具模式设置为**动画**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1508
msgid ""
"In the viewer click the label with the level name on the right of the current "
"section pivot point and flip through following and previous frames by doing one "
"of the following:"
msgstr ""
"在查看器中，单击当前剖面枢轴点右侧带有标高名称的标签，然后通过执行以下操作之一翻"
"转以下帧和上一帧："

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1510
msgid "Drag up or down."
msgstr "向上或向下拖动。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1512
msgid "Click the up or down arrowheads."
msgstr "单击向上或向下箭头。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1518
msgid "Automated Lip-Synching using Rhubarb"
msgstr "大黄自动唇部同步"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1519
msgid ""
"Automatic lip-sync can be obtained by using the Rhubarb software (which is not "
"bundled with OpenToonz, and must be separately installed and then configured in "
"Preferences window, as explained in :ref:`Using Rhubarb with OpenToonz "
"<using_rhubarb_with_opentoonz>` section). The **Auto Lip-Sync** feature can "
"analyze an audio track and automatically expose the appropriate drawing for "
"each phoneme in the audio to the corresponding cells in the Xsheet/Timeline."
msgstr ""
"使用大黄软件可以获得自动唇形同步（该软件未与OpenToonz捆绑在一起，必须单独安装，"
"然后在“首选项”窗口中配置，如：ref:“使用大黄与"
"OpenToonz<using_Rhubarb_with_OpenToonz>`部分所述）。**自动唇形同步**功能可以分析"
"音轨，并自动将音频中每个音素的相应图形显示到Xsheet/Timeline中的相应单元格中。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1522
msgid "|apply_auto_lip_sync|"
msgstr "|apply_auto_lip_sync|"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1524
msgid "**To apply auto lip-sync to a column/layer:**"
msgstr "**要将自动唇形同步应用于列/层，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1526
msgid ""
"Load the audio track onto its own column/layer, if it is not already there "
"(right-click on the cell the audio should begin and select \"Load Level\")."
msgstr ""
"将音轨加载到其自己的列/层上（如果还没有）（右键单击单元格，音频应该开始，然后选"
"择“加载级别”）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1528 ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1563
msgid ""
"Expose in the Xsheet/Timeline at least one drawing of the level containing the "
"mouth shapes set."
msgstr "在Xsheet/Timeline中显示至少一个包含嘴部形状集的级别图形。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1530
msgid ""
"Select the cell of the column/layer where you want the lip sync to start, and "
"using the right-click menu, choose the Lip Sync  →  **Apply Auto Lip Sync to "
"Column** option."
msgstr ""
"选择要开始唇形同步的列/层的单元格，然后使用右键菜单选择唇形同步→  **将自动唇部同"
"步应用于列**选项。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1532
msgid ""
"In the Auto Lip Sync Dialog, choose the desired Xsheet/Timeline audio column/"
"layer or a supported audio file from disc, by using the **Audio Source** drop-"
"down menu."
msgstr ""
"在“自动唇形同步”对话框中，使用**音频源**下拉菜单从光盘中选择所需的Xsheet/"
"Timeline音频列/层或支持的音频文件。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1534
msgid "Press play to preview the track if needed."
msgstr "如果需要，按play预览曲目。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1536
msgid ""
"You can optionally type a transcript of the spoken words in the **Audio "
"Script** field, which will help improve the accuracy of the lip syncing result."
msgstr ""
"您可以选择在**音频脚本**字段中键入口语单词的转录，这将有助于提高唇形同步结果的准"
"确性。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1538
msgid ""
"Choose which level drawings to assign to each phoneme using the arrow buttons "
"below each phoneme."
msgstr "使用每个音素下方的箭头按钮选择要分配给每个音素的级别图形。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1540
msgid ""
"Rhubarb utilizes its own phonemes that have been interpreted as Preston Blair "
"phonemes, without a unique phoneme for **WQ**."
msgstr ""
"大黄使用自己的音素，这些音素被解释为普雷斯顿·布莱尔音素，而**WQ**没有唯一的音"
"素。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1542
msgid "Click the \"Apply\" button"
msgstr "点击“应用”按钮"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1548
msgid "Importing Papagayo-NG Files"
msgstr "导入Papagayo NG文件"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1549
msgid ""
"It is possible to import into the Xsheet/Timeline DAT files exported from "
"Papagayo-NG, a lip-sync and animation timing tool."
msgstr ""
"可以将从Papagayo NG（唇形同步和动画计时工具）导出的DAT文件导入Xsheet/Timeline。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1551
msgid "|apply_lip_sync_data|"
msgstr "|apply_lip_sync_data|"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1553
msgid ""
"While Papagayo-NG takes care of the audio file analysis and phoneme "
"recognition, importing the DAT file into OpenToonz allows you to assign a frame "
"from an animation level to each phoneme and automatically expose the result in "
"an Xsheet column or Timeline layer; to be able to hear the synced sound, the "
"correspondent sound level should be manually loaded too."
msgstr ""
"虽然Papagayo NG负责音频文件分析和音素识别，但将DAT文件导入OpenToonz允许您将动画"
"级别的帧分配给每个音素，并在Xsheet列或Timeline层中自动显示结果；为了能够听到同步"
"的声音，还应手动加载相应的声级。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1555
msgid "**To export the OpenToonz lip sync file in Papagayo-NG:**"
msgstr "**要在Papagayo NG中导出OpenToonz唇形同步文件：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1557
msgid "In Papagayo-NG, from the **Export:** dropdown menu, select **MOHO**."
msgstr "在Papagayo NG中，从**导出：**下拉菜单中选择**MOHO**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1559
msgid "Press the **Export** button, to export a .DAT file."
msgstr "Press the **Export** button, to export a .DAT file."

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1561
msgid "**To import a Papagayo-NG file:**"
msgstr "**要导入Papagayo NG文件，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1565
msgid ""
"Select the cell of the column/layer where you want the lip sync to start, and "
"using the right click menu choose the **Apply Lip Sync Data to Column** option "
"or from Xsheet  →  **Apply Lip Sync Data to Column**."
msgstr ""
"选择要开始唇同步的列/层的单元格，然后使用右键菜单选择**将唇同步数据应用于列**选"
"项或从Xsheet中选择→  **将唇部同步数据应用于列**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1567
msgid ""
"A dialog opens letting you choose which level drawings to assign to each "
"phoneme."
msgstr "将打开一个对话框，让您选择将哪个级别的图形分配给每个音素。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1569
msgid ""
"Use the **Lip Sync Data File:** browser to retrieve the DAT file you exported "
"from Papagayo-NG, and click the **Choose** button."
msgstr ""
"使用**唇形同步数据文件：**浏览器检索从Papagayo NG导出的DAT文件，然后单击**选择**"
"按钮。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1571
msgid ""
"The **Insert at Frame:** parameter should already be showing the frame number "
"of the cell you previously selected. Still, you can change it to make the lip "
"sync start at another frame."
msgstr ""
"**插入帧：**参数应该已经显示了您之前选择的单元格的帧号。不过，您可以更改它，使唇"
"形同步从另一帧开始。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1573
msgid ""
"Activate the **Extend Rest Drawing to End Marker** if you want to copy the "
"*Rest Drawing* to all the remaining frames between the loaded lip sync ending, "
"and the frame where the *End Marker* of the Xsheet/Timeline is set."
msgstr ""
"如果要将*Rest Drawing*复制到加载的唇形同步结束和设置X表格/时间线的*End Marker*的"
"帧之间的所有剩余帧，请激活**Extend Rest Drawing to End Marker**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1575
msgid "Click the **Apply** button."
msgstr "单击**应用**按钮。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1581
msgid "Importing Magpie Files"
msgstr "导入喜鹊(Magpie)文件"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1582
msgid ""
"It is possible to import into the Xsheet/Timeline .TLS files (i.e. Toonz Lip "
"Sync) exported from Magpie, a lip-sync and animation timing tool."
msgstr ""
"可以导入到Xsheet/Timeline中。从喜鹊导出的TLS文件（即Toanz Lip Sync），喜鹊是一个"
"唇形同步和动画计时工具。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1584
msgid "|magpie_import|"
msgstr "|magpie_import|"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1586
msgid ""
"While Magpie takes care of the audio file analysis and phoneme recognition, "
"importing the .TLS file into OpenToonz allows you to assign a frame from an "
"animation level to each phoneme and automatically expose the result in an "
"Xsheet column or Timeline layer; an additional column/layer displaying the "
"speech text (as recognized in Magpie) is created for reference."
msgstr ""
"喜鹊负责音频文件分析和音素识别，导入。TLS文件导入OpenToonz允许您将动画级别的帧分"
"配给每个音素，并在Xsheet列或Timeline层中自动显示结果；创建显示语音文本（如喜鹊中"
"识别的）的附加列/层以供参考。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1588
msgid "**To export the OpenToonz lip sync file in Magpie:**"
msgstr "**要在喜鹊中导出OpenToonz唇形同步文件，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1590
msgid ""
"Copy the file ``export-toonz.lua``  available in ``OpenToonz stuff\\config``  "
"folder into the ``C:\\Program Files (x86)\\Third Wish Software & Animation"
"\\Magpie Pro\\Scripts\\Export``  folder."
msgstr ""
"将“OpenToonz stuff\\config”文件夹中的文件“export toonz.lua”复制到“C:\\Program "
"Files（x86）\\Sthird Wish Software&Animation\\Magpie Pro\\Scripts\\export”文件"
"夹。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1592
msgid ""
"In Magpie choose File  →  Export and choose Toonz among the 2D software list to "
"export the TLS file."
msgstr "在喜鹊中选择文件→  导出并在2D软件列表中选择Toanz以导出TLS文件。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1594
msgid "**To import a Magpie file:**"
msgstr "**要导入喜鹊文件，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1596
msgid "Choose File  →  **Import Toonz Lip Sync File...**."
msgstr "选择文件→  **导入Toonz唇形同步文件。..**."

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1598
msgid ""
"In the browser that opens retrieve the TLS file you exported from Magpie and "
"click the **Load** button."
msgstr "在打开的浏览器中检索您从喜鹊导出的TLS文件，然后单击**加载**按钮。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1600
msgid "In the dialog that opens choose the following:"
msgstr "在打开的对话框中选择以下内容："

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1602
msgid ""
"Use **Frame Range** to define which section of the Magpie file you want to use "
"to create the lip sync column in the Xsheet/Timeline."
msgstr ""
"使用**帧范围**定义要使用喜鹊文件的哪个部分在Xsheet/Timeline中创建唇形同步列。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1604
msgid ""
"Use the **Animation Level** section to retrieve the animation level you want to "
"expose in the Xsheet/Timeline, and to specify which frame of the level has to "
"be assigned to each phoneme; you can also use the viewer available at the "
"bottom of the dialog to examine the frames of the selected animation level."
msgstr ""
"使用**动画级别**部分检索要在Xsheet/Timeline中显示的动画级别，并指定必须将级别的"
"哪个帧分配给每个音素；您还可以使用对话框底部的查看器来检查所选动画级别的帧。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1606
msgid "Click the **Import** button."
msgstr "单击**导入**按钮。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1612
msgid "Using Memos"
msgstr "使用备忘录"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1613
msgid ""
"Memos can be posted in the Xsheet/Timeline at specific positions in order to "
"add notes and comments to the scene."
msgstr "备忘录可以在Xsheet/Timeline的特定位置发布，以便为场景添加注释和评论。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1615
msgid "|memo|"
msgstr "|备忘录|"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1617
msgid ""
"When editing a memo its color can be set, and the text you write can be "
"formatted. Once posted, memos display the first letters of their content in "
"order to be identified, and can be retrieved in the Xsheet/Timeline by "
"navigating them."
msgstr ""
"编辑备忘录时，可以设置其颜色，也可以设置所写文本的格式。一旦发布，备忘录会显示其"
"内容的第一个字母以便识别，并且可以通过导航在Xsheet/Timeline中检索。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1619
msgid "**To post a memo:**"
msgstr "**要发布备忘录：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1621
msgid ""
"Click the **Add New Memo** button at the top of the frame number column in the "
"Xsheet (or at the top of the layers headers, in the Timeline)."
msgstr "单击Xsheet中帧号列顶部（或Timeline中层标题顶部）的**添加新备忘录**按钮。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1623
msgid ""
"Type the memo text in the window that opens, format it and choose the memo "
"color (see below) then click the **Post** button: the memo is posted at the "
"current frame in the current column."
msgstr ""
"在打开的窗口中键入备忘录文本，设置格式并选择备忘录颜色（见下文），然后单击**发布"
"**按钮：备忘录将发布在当前列的当前帧上。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1625
msgid "Click and drag the posted memo to change its position."
msgstr "单击并拖动已发布的备忘录以更改其位置。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1627
msgid "**To format the text in the memo:**"
msgstr "**要格式化备忘录中的文本，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1629
msgid "Select the text you want to format."
msgstr "选择要设置格式的文本。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1631
msgid ""
"Click the arrow (|additional_settings|) displayed on the right of the selection "
"to open the Text Toolbar."
msgstr "单击选择右侧显示的箭头（|additional_settings|）打开文本工具栏。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1633
msgid "|memo_text_format|"
msgstr "|memo_text_format|"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1635
msgid ""
"Choose the font family, size, color, style and paragraph alignment by clicking "
"on the relevant menu and buttons in the Text Toolbar."
msgstr ""
"通过单击文本工具栏中的相关菜单和按钮，选择字体系列、大小、颜色、样式和段落对齐方"
"式。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1637
msgid "**To change the memo color:**"
msgstr "**要更改备忘录颜色，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1639
msgid ""
"Choose a color in the palette available at the bottom of the open memo; palette "
"colors can also be selected and edited by using the Style Editor."
msgstr ""
"在打开的备忘录底部可用的调色板中选择一种颜色；也可以使用样式编辑器选择和编辑调色"
"板颜色。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1641
msgid "**To navigate the memos posted in the Xsheet:**"
msgstr "**要浏览Xsheet中发布的备忘录：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1643
msgid ""
"Click the arrow buttons next to the Add New Memo button to check the previous "
"or next memo: the Xsheet/Timeline automatically pans to show where the selected "
"memo is posted."
msgstr ""
"单击“添加新备忘录”按钮旁边的箭头按钮以检查上一个或下一个备忘录：Xsheet/Timeline"
"会自动平移以显示所选备忘录的发布位置。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1645
msgid "**To open a memo:**"
msgstr "**要打开备忘录，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1649
msgid "Double-click it."
msgstr "双击它。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1651
msgid "Right-click it and choose **Open Memo** from the menu that opens."
msgstr "右键单击它，然后从打开的菜单中选择**打开备忘录**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1653
msgid "**To delete a memo:**"
msgstr "**要删除备忘录，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1657
msgid "Open it and click the **Discard** button."
msgstr "打开它并单击**放弃**按钮。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1659
msgid "Right-click it and choose **Delete Memo** from the menu that opens."
msgstr "右键单击它，然后从打开的菜单中选择**删除备忘录**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1665
msgid "Saving and Loading Scenes"
msgstr "保存和加载场景"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1666
msgid ""
"When working on a new scene the default name (untitled) followed by a "
"progressive number is assigned to the scene until you save it with a different "
"name. This name is also used in case the *$scenepath* variable is used in the "
"project settings to store temporarily the material used in the scene."
msgstr ""
"在处理新场景时，将为场景指定默认名称（无标题），后跟一个递增的数字，直到您用其他"
"名称保存它。如果在项目设置中使用*$scenepath*变量来临时存储场景中使用的材质，也会"
"使用此名称。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1668
msgid ""
"Untitled scenes and related material are stored in the ``OpenToonz stuff"
"\\projects\\temp``  folder, and deleted when the scene is saved with a proper "
"name or not saved at all. Check regularly the ``temp``  folder, and if there is "
"some content, delete it to free disk space."
msgstr ""
"未命名的场景和相关材料存储在“OpenToonz stuff\\projects\\temp”文件夹中，当场景以"
"正确名称保存或根本不保存时，会被删除。定期检查“temp”文件夹，如果有内容，请将其删"
"除以释放磁盘空间。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1670
msgid ""
"Scene files can be saved and loaded as TNZ files using the related menu "
"commands. Scenes have to be saved in the current project *+scenes* folder, or "
"any of its sub-folders, in order to retrieve all the material when they are "
"loaded back."
msgstr ""
"场景文件可以使用相关菜单命令保存和加载为TNZ文件。场景必须保存在当前项目*+Scenes*"
"文件夹或其任何子文件夹中，以便在重新加载时检索所有材质。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1672
msgid ""
"When you use the **Save As...** command, if the *$scenepath* is used in the "
"default folders definition, all the material used in the scenes and located in "
"project default folders will be duplicated in folders related to the new scene "
"(see  :ref:`Using the $scenepath Variable in Folder Definition <using_the_"
"$scenepath_variable_in_folder_definition>`  )."
msgstr ""
"当您使用**另存为…**命令时，如果在默认文件夹定义中使用了*$scenepath*，则场景中使"
"用的所有材质以及位于项目默认文件夹中的材质都将复制到与新场景相关的文件夹中（请参"
"阅：ref:`在文件夹定义中使用$scenepath变量<Using_the_"
"$scenepathy_Variable_in_Folder_definition>`）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1674
msgid ""
"An option **Save Automatically** allows to save the scene every given number of "
"minutes, and is available in the Preferences...  →  Saving dialog section. If "
"the option is activated, during the saving operation a message is displayed to "
"notify the process."
msgstr ""
"选项**自动保存**允许每给定分钟保存一次场景，该选项在首选项中可用。..  →  保存对"
"话框部分。如果该选项被激活，则在保存操作期间会显示一条消息来通知该过程。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1676
msgid ""
"An asterisk to the right of the scene name in the Viewer and Xsheet/Timeline "
"title bars, denotes that there are unsaved changes for the current scene."
msgstr ""
"查看器和Xsheet/Timeline标题栏中场景名称右侧的星号表示当前场景有未保存的更改。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1678
msgid "**To work on a new scene:**"
msgstr "**要处理新场景，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1680
msgid "Choose File  →  **New Scene**."
msgstr "选择文件→  **新场景**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1682
msgid "**To save a scene and all its related levels:**"
msgstr "**要保存场景及其所有相关级别，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1684
msgid "Choose File  →  **Save All**."
msgstr "选择文件→  **全部保存**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1686
msgid "**To save a scene:**"
msgstr "**要保存场景，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1688
msgid "Choose File  →  **Save Scene**."
msgstr "选择文件→  **保存场景**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1690
msgid "**To save the current scene with a different name:**"
msgstr "**要使用其他名称保存当前场景，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1692
msgid "Choose File  →  **Save Scene As...**"
msgstr "选择文件→  **将场景另存为**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1694
msgid ""
"In the browser that opens select the current project *+scenes* folder, or any "
"of its sub-folders, where you want to save the scene."
msgstr ""
"在打开的浏览器中，选择要保存场景的当前项目*+scenes*文件夹或其任何子文件夹。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1696
msgid "Assign a name to the scene and click the **Save** button."
msgstr "为场景指定一个名称，然后单击**保存**按钮。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1698
msgid "**To load a scene from the Load Scene browser:**"
msgstr "**要从“加载场景”浏览器加载场景，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1700
msgid "Choose File  →  **Load Scene...**"
msgstr "选择文件→  **加载场景。..**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1702
msgid ""
"In the browser that opens retrieve, in the *+scenes* folder of the current "
"project or any of its sub-folders, the scene you want to load and click the "
"**Load** button."
msgstr ""
"在打开的浏览器中检索当前项目的*+scenes*文件夹或其任何子文件夹中要加载的场景，然"
"后单击**加载**按钮。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1704
msgid "**To load a scene from the OpenToonz standard browser:**"
msgstr "**要从OpenToonz标准浏览器加载场景，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1708
msgid ""
"Right-click the scene icon and choose **Load Scene...** from the menu that "
"opens."
msgstr "右键单击场景图标，然后选择**加载场景。..**从打开的菜单中选择。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1710
msgid "Drag and drop the scene icon to the clapboard icon in the scene cast pane."
msgstr "将场景图标拖放到场景投射窗格中的隔板图标上。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1712
msgid ""
"Scenes can also be loaded by dragging and dropping them from the Windows "
"Explorer or Mac OS Finder to the clapboard icon in the scene cast."
msgstr ""
"还可以通过将场景从Windows资源管理器或Mac OS Finder拖放到场景投射中的隔板图标来加"
"载场景。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1714
msgid "**To load back a recently loaded scene:**"
msgstr "**要重新加载最近加载的场景，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1716
msgid ""
"Choose File  →  **Open Recent Scene File**, then select the scene you want to "
"load from the available submenu."
msgstr ""
"选择文件→  **打开“最近使用的场景文件”**，然后从可用子菜单中选择要加载的场景。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1718
msgid "**To revert the current scene to the last saved version:**"
msgstr "**要将当前场景还原为上次保存的版本，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1720
msgid "Choose File  →  **Revert Scene**."
msgstr "选择文件→  **还原场景**。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1722
msgid "**To automatically save a scene every given number of minutes:**"
msgstr "**要每隔给定的分钟数自动保存一个场景，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1724
msgid "Choose File  →  Preferences...  →  Saving."
msgstr "选择文件→  偏好。..  →  节省。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1726
msgid ""
"Activate the **Save Automatically** option and enter the number of minutes that "
"have to pass between each saving operation."
msgstr "激活**自动保存**选项，并输入每次保存操作之间必须经过的分钟数。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1728
msgid ""
"Choose to activate which file will be saved by this function, either or both of "
"the Scene File and Non-Scene Files."
msgstr "选择激活此功能将保存的文件，场景文件和非场景文件中的一个或两个。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1734
msgid "Importing and Exporting Scenes"
msgstr "导入和导出场景"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1735
msgid ""
"In OpenToonz each scene file belongs to a specific project, so that the "
"material created and used in the scene is located and can be retrieved from the "
"project default folders."
msgstr ""
"在OpenToonz中，每个场景文件都属于一个特定的项目，因此可以定位在场景中创建和使用"
"的材质，并可以从项目默认文件夹中检索。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1737
msgid ""
"If you need to copy the scene and the related material to a different project, "
"it is possible either to import any scene file in the current project, or to "
"export it to any other project available in the projectroot (see  :ref:`Setting "
"up Projects <setting_up_projects>`  )."
msgstr ""
"如果需要将场景和相关材质复制到其他项目，可以导入当前项目中的任何场景文件，也可以"
"将其导出到项目根中可用的任何其他项目（请参阅：ref:`设置项目"
"<Setting_up_Projects>`）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1743
msgid "Importing Scenes from a Different Project"
msgstr "从其他项目导入场景"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1744
msgid ""
"When trying to load a scene created in a different project, or not located in "
"the current project *+scenes* folder or any of its sub-folders, you are "
"prompted to decide whether you want to import the scene (**Import Scene**) or "
"change the current project (**Change Project**) (see  :ref:`Setting up Projects "
"<setting_up_projects>`  )."
msgstr ""
"当尝试加载在其他项目中创建的场景，或不在当前项目*+scenes*文件夹或其任何子文件夹"
"中时，系统会提示您决定是导入场景（**导入场景**）还是更改当前项目（**更改项目**）"
"（请参阅：ref:`设置项目<Setting_up_Projects>`）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1746
msgid ""
"If you decide to import the scene, the scene will be loaded, and all the scene "
"material will be imported in the following way:"
msgstr "如果决定导入场景，将加载场景，并按以下方式导入所有场景材质："

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1748
msgid ""
"All the files that were located in the original project default folders (i.e. "
"the ones loaded in the scene by using relative paths) will be copied into the "
"related default folders of the current project (see  :ref:`Project Default "
"Folders <project_default_folders>`  )."
msgstr ""
"位于原始项目默认文件夹中的所有文件（即使用相对路径加载到场景中的文件）都将被复制"
"到当前项目的相关默认文件夹中（请参阅：ref:“项目默认文件夹"
"<project_default_folders>”）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1750
msgid ""
"All the files that were located in external folders (i.e. the ones loaded in "
"the scene by using absolute paths), will remain where they are."
msgstr ""
"位于外部文件夹中的所有文件（即使用绝对路径加载到场景中的文件）将保留在原位。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1752
msgid ""
"While the material is automatically imported and saved in the current project, "
"the scene file will not be saved until you will save it by using the **Save "
"Scene** or **Save Scene As...** commands."
msgstr ""
"当材质自动导入并保存在当前项目中时，场景文件将不会被保存，直到您使用**保存场景**"
"或**将场景另存为…**命令进行保存。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1754
msgid ""
"It is also possible to import one or several scenes into the current project "
"with no need to load and save them by using the **Import Scene** command."
msgstr ""
"还可以使用**导入场景**命令将一个或多个场景导入到当前项目中，而无需加载和保存它"
"们。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1756
msgid ""
"In this case both the material files located in the original project default "
"folders and the scene file will be copied in the related default folders of the "
"current project."
msgstr ""
"在这种情况下，位于原始项目默认文件夹中的材质文件和场景文件都将复制到当前项目的相"
"关默认文件夹中。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1758
msgid ""
"If the scene you import contains a file whose name is the same as a file "
"already existing in the destination default folder, you will prompted whether "
"to keep the existing file, overwrite it with the new one, or rename it adding a "
"suffix you can decide. In this way you can control if files you are importing "
"were already imported previously, or manage files that share the same name."
msgstr ""
"如果导入的场景包含一个文件，其名称与目标默认文件夹中已存在的文件相同，系统将提示"
"您是保留现有文件、用新文件覆盖它，还是重命名它并添加您可以决定的后缀。通过这种方"
"式，您可以控制要导入的文件是否以前已导入，或者管理共享相同名称的文件。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1760
msgid "**To load and import a scene from a different project:**"
msgstr "**要从其他项目加载和导入场景，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1762
msgid ""
"Load the scene you want to import by using the **Load Scene...** browser or the "
"OpenToonz standard browser."
msgstr "使用**加载场景加载要导入的场景。..**浏览器或OpenToonz标准浏览器。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1764
msgid ""
"Choose **Import Scene** in the dialog that opens: the scene is loaded and the "
"related files will be copied into the default folders of the current project."
msgstr ""
"在打开的对话框中选择**导入场景**：场景将被加载，相关文件将被复制到当前项目的默认"
"文件夹中。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1766
msgid "Save the scene file in the current project *+scenes* folder"
msgstr "将场景文件保存在当前项目的*+scenes*文件夹中"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1768
msgid ""
"**To import one or several scenes from a different project, without loading "
"them:**"
msgstr "**要从其他项目导入一个或多个场景，而不加载它们，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1770
msgid "Select the scenes you want to import in the OpenToonz standard browser."
msgstr "在OpenToonz标准浏览器中选择要导入的场景。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1772
msgid ""
"Right-click the selection and choose **Import Scene** from the menu that opens: "
"the scene and the related material files copied in the default folders of the "
"current project."
msgstr ""
"右键单击所选内容，然后从打开的菜单中选择**导入场景**：复制到当前项目默认文件夹中"
"的场景和相关材质文件。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1778
msgid "Exporting Scenes to a Different Project"
msgstr "将场景导出到其他项目"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1779
msgid ""
"Scenes can be exported if you need either to copy them from a project to any "
"other existing project, or to copy them to a new project that can be "
"automatically created according to the current project settings."
msgstr ""
"如果需要将场景从项目复制到任何其他现有项目，或者将场景复制到可以根据当前项目设置"
"自动创建的新项目，则可以导出场景。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1781
msgid ""
"In both cases the scenes files and the related assets will be automatically "
"collected and copied in the related default folders of the destination project "
"(see  :ref:`Collecting Assets <collecting_assets>`  )."
msgstr ""
"在这两种情况下，场景文件和相关资产都将自动收集并复制到目标项目的相关默认文件夹中"
"（请参阅：ref:“收集资产<Collecting_assets>”）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1783
msgid "|export_scene|"
msgstr "|导出场景|"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1785
msgid ""
"If the scene you export contains any file whose name is the same of a file "
"already existing in the destination default folder, you will prompted whether "
"to keep the existing file, overwrite it with the new one, or rename it adding a "
"suffix you can decide. In this way you can control if files you are exporting "
"were already exported previously, or manage files that share the same name."
msgstr ""
"如果导出的场景包含任何名称与目标默认文件夹中已存在的文件相同的文件，系统将提示您"
"是保留现有文件、用新文件覆盖它，还是重命名它并添加您可以决定的后缀。通过这种方"
"式，您可以控制要导出的文件是否以前已导出，或者管理共享相同名称的文件。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1787
msgid "**To export one or several scenes to a different project:**"
msgstr "**要将一个或多个场景导出到其他项目，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1789
msgid "Select the scenes you want to export in the OpenToonz standard browser."
msgstr "在OpenToonz标准浏览器中选择要导出的场景。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1791
msgid ""
"Right-click the selection and choose **Export Scene...** from the menu that "
"opens: the Export Scene dialog opens."
msgstr ""
"右键单击所选内容，然后选择**导出场景。..**从打开的菜单中：“导出场景”对话框打开。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1793
msgid "In the dialog do one of the following:"
msgstr "在对话框中执行以下操作之一："

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1795
msgid ""
"Select the **Choose Existing Project** option if you want to export the "
"selected scenes to an existing project, then navigate the folder tree to choose "
"the destination project."
msgstr ""
"如果要将所选场景导出到现有项目，请选择**选择现有项目**选项，然后导航文件夹树以选"
"择目标项目。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1797
msgid ""
"Choose the **Create New Project** option if you want to export the selected "
"scenes to a new project based on the current one, then assign a name for the "
"new project."
msgstr ""
"如果要将所选场景导出到基于当前场景的新项目，请选择**创建新项目**选项，然后为新项"
"目指定一个名称。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1799
msgid "Click the **Export** button."
msgstr "单击**导出**按钮。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1805
msgid "Collecting Assets"
msgstr "收集资产"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1806
msgid ""
"Files used in a scene can be located in the default folders of the current "
"project, or loaded from an external folder (see  :ref:`Project Default Folders "
"<project_default_folders>`  and  :ref:`Using the File Browser "
"<using_the_file_browser>`  )."
msgstr ""
"场景中使用的文件可以位于当前项目的默认文件夹中，也可以从外部文件夹加载（请参阅："
"ref:`项目默认文件夹<project_default_folders>'和：ref:'使用文件浏览器"
"<Using_the_File_Browser>'）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1808
msgid ""
"This means that when a project has to change location for any reason (e.g. for "
"a backup), moving all the default folders does not grant that all the files "
"required for the project scenes are moved along, because files loaded from "
"external folders will remain where they are."
msgstr ""
"这意味着，当项目因任何原因（例如备份）必须更改位置时，移动所有默认文件夹并不意味"
"着项目场景所需的所有文件都会移动，因为从外部文件夹加载的文件将保持原位。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1810
msgid ""
"For this reason it's possible to collect all the files used in a scene, thus "
"importing automatically to the project default folders all the files that were "
"not imported at loading time. At the same time the scene file for which you are "
"collecting assets will be automatically updated in order to correct all the "
"loading paths of the newly imported files to keep consistency."
msgstr ""
"因此，可以收集场景中使用的所有文件，从而将加载时未导入的所有文件自动导入到项目默"
"认文件夹中。同时，您正在收集资源的场景文件将自动更新，以纠正新导入文件的所有加载"
"路径，保持一致性。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1812
msgid "**To collect the assets of one or several scenes:**"
msgstr "**要收集一个或多个场景的资产：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1814
msgid "Select the scenes for which you want to collect assets."
msgstr "选择要为其收集资源的场景。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1816
msgid ""
"Right-click the selection and choose **Collect Assets** from the menu that "
"opens: all the scene files that were located in external folders are copied "
"into the default folders of the project, and the related paths used in the "
"scene files are updated."
msgstr ""
"右键单击所选内容，然后从打开的菜单中选择**收集资源**：位于外部文件夹中的所有场景"
"文件都将复制到项目的默认文件夹中，场景文件中使用的相关路径也将更新。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1822
msgid "Scene Backup Files"
msgstr "场景备份文件"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1823
msgid ""
"When scenes are saved, backup files of previous versions are automatically "
"stored in a folder named as the scene, that is located in ``+scenes\\backups``  "
"of the current project."
msgstr ""
"保存场景时，以前版本的备份文件会自动存储在名为场景的文件夹中，该文件夹位于当前项"
"目的“+scenes\\backups”中。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1825
msgid ""
"The four previous scene versions are retained, and they are named as the scene, "
"with a progressive backup number: the highest the number, the more recent the "
"backup."
msgstr ""
"保留了之前的四个场景版本，它们被命名为场景，并具有渐进的备份编号：编号越高，备份"
"越新。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1827
msgid ""
"For example if you have saved seven times the scene named my_scene, 4 backup "
"versions of the scene named ``my_scene_3`` , ``my_scene_4`` , ``my_scene_5``  "
"and ``my_scene_6``  are available in the ``+scenes\\backups\\my_scene`` folder."
msgstr ""
"例如，如果您已将名为my_scene的场景保存了七次，则在“+scenes\\backups"
"\\my_scene`”文件夹中可以找到名为“my_scene_3”、“my_scente_4”、“my _scene_5”和“my "
"_scente_6”的场景的4个备份版本。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1829
msgid ""
"If you want to recover a scene backup version of a scene, you have to remove "
"the backup number so to have the correct scene name, and move the file into the "
"*+scenes* folder."
msgstr ""
"如果要恢复场景的场景备份版本，则必须删除备份编号以获得正确的场景名称，并将文件移"
"动到*+scenes*文件夹中。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1831
msgid "**To recover a backup version of a scene:**"
msgstr "**要恢复场景的备份版本，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1833
msgid ""
"Retrieve in *+scenes\\backups* the folder named as the scene whose backup you "
"want to recover."
msgstr "在*+scenes\\backups*中检索名为要恢复其备份的场景的文件夹。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1835
msgid ""
"In the folder, retrieve the TNZ file related to the latest backup you want to "
"recover, and rename it, removing the backup number so to have the correct scene "
"name."
msgstr ""
"在文件夹中，检索与要恢复的最新备份相关的TNZ文件，并对其进行重命名，删除备份编号"
"以获得正确的场景名称。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1837
msgid ""
"Copy and paste it into the *+scenes* folder to replace the version you want to "
"scratch."
msgstr "将其复制并粘贴到*+scenes*文件夹中，以替换您要抓取的版本。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1843
msgid "Printing Xsheets"
msgstr "打印X表格"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1844
msgid ""
"An Xsheet can be saved as HTML file in order to view it on any computer by "
"using an Internet browser, and to print it on paper."
msgstr ""
"Xsheet可以另存为HTML文件，以便使用互联网浏览器在任何计算机上查看，并在纸上打印。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1846
msgid ""
"The HTML file contains a header with general information, several tables, whose "
"length and width you can decide, representing the Xsheet with exposed levels "
"and objects movements, and a list of the levels exposed in the Xsheet with the "
"related location on disk."
msgstr ""
"The HTML file contains a header with general information, several tables, whose "
"length and width you can decide, representing the Xsheet with exposed levels "
"and objects movements, and a list of the levels exposed in the Xsheet with the "
"related location on disk."

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1848
msgid ""
"If any Sub-Xsheets are used in the scene, they are displayed after the main "
"Xsheet where they are exposed."
msgstr "如果场景中使用了任何子Xsheet，则它们将显示在主Xsheet之后。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1850
msgid ""
"The information displayed in the header and the appearance of the HTML table "
"can be set by editing the following files located in the folder ``OpenToonz "
"stuff\\profiles\\layouts\\settings`` :"
msgstr ""
"通过编辑位于文件夹“OpenToonz stuff\\profiles\\layouts\\sets”中的以下文件，可以设"
"置标题中显示的信息和HTML表格的外观："

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1852
msgid ""
"``xsheet_html.xml``  contains the information used for the HTML Xsheet header, "
"and the size for the tables used to represent the Xsheet content."
msgstr "``xml`包含用于html xsheet标头的信息，以及用于表示xsheet内容的表的大小。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1854
msgid ""
"``xsheet.css``  is a Cascading Style Sheet file that is used to define the "
"colors, layout, and other aspects of the HTML Xsheet file (see below )."
msgstr ""
"``css是一个级联样式表文件，用于定义HTML xsheet文件的颜色、布局和其他方面（见下"
"文）。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1856
msgid ""
"When using the Print Xsheet command, a dialog with information about the "
"location and name of the generated HTML file is displayed; then the generated "
"HTML file is displayed in your default browser."
msgstr ""
"使用Print Xsheet命令时，将显示一个对话框，其中包含有关生成的HTML文件的位置和名称"
"的信息；则生成的HTML文件将显示在默认浏览器中。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1858
msgid ""
"The HTML file is saved in the same location as the TNZ file; the CSS file used "
"for its formatting is generated as well, by copying the one located in the "
"folder ``OpenToonz stuff\\profiles\\layouts\\settings`` . If a CSS file is "
"already available in the location where the HTML Xsheet file is saved, it will "
"be used instead of generating a new one."
msgstr ""
"HTML文件保存在与TNZ文件相同的位置；用于格式化的CSS文件也是通过复制位于文件"
"夹“OpenToonz stuff\\profiles\\layouts\\sets”中的文件来生成的。如果HTML Xsheet文"
"件保存的位置已经有CSS文件可用，则将使用该文件，而不是生成新文件。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1860
msgid ""
"If you want to move the HTML Xsheet file, you should move the CSS file as well, "
"in order to preserve the HTML file appearance as defined by the CSS file."
msgstr ""
"如果你想移动HTML Xsheet文件，你也应该移动CSS文件，以保持CSS文件定义的HTML文件外"
"观。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1866
msgid "Editing the HTML Xsheet Header and Table Size"
msgstr "编辑HTML Xsheet标题和表格大小"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1867
msgid ""
"The HTML Xsheet header and the size for the tables used to represent the Xsheet "
"content can be defined by editing the`` xsheet_html.xml``  file available in "
"the folder ``OpenToonz stuff\\profiles\\layouts\\settings`` . It can be edited "
"with any text editor software, e.g. Notepad or TextEdit."
msgstr ""
"通过编辑文件夹“OpenToonz stuff\\profiles\\layouts\\sets”中的“Xsheet_HTML.xml”文"
"件，可以定义用于表示Xsheet内容的HTML Xsheet标题和表的大小。它可以用任何文本编辑"
"器软件进行编辑，例如记事本或TextEdit。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1869
msgid ""
"The whole text is included in the tag ``xsheet_html`` , that contains the "
"elements ``page``  and ``info`` , where the different users and roles are "
"defined. The basic structure of the file is the following:"
msgstr ""
"整个文本包含在标签“xsheet_html”中，该标签包含元素“page”和“info”，其中定义了不同"
"的用户和角色。文件的基本结构如下："

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1881
msgid ""
"By editing the ``page row``  and ``page columns``  values you can set the size "
"of the table used for splitting the Xsheet in sections. The size of the table "
"allows you to fit each Xsheet section to the paper size you want to use to "
"print the Xsheet on paper."
msgstr ""
"通过编辑“页面行”和“页面列”值，您可以设置用于将Xsheet拆分为部分的表的大小。表格的"
"大小允许您将每个Xsheet部分调整到要在纸上打印Xsheet的纸张大小。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1883
msgid ""
"The ``info``  lines allows you to set information to be displayed in the "
"header, for example the production name."
msgstr "“info”行允许您设置要在标题中显示的信息，例如生产名称。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1885
msgid "In the example file you can find the following lines:"
msgstr "在示例文件中，您可以找到以下行："

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1892
msgid ""
"These lines can be edited, and new lines, with the same syntax, can be "
"appended, to provide all the information you want to appear in the header of "
"the HTML Xsheet file."
msgstr ""
"这些行可以编辑，并且可以附加具有相同语法的新行，以提供您希望出现在HTML Xsheet文"
"件标题中的所有信息。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1894
msgid ""
"By default the header contains the Project and Scene names and the number of "
"frames the scene consists of; this information cannot be edited, as they are "
"retrieved automatically from the scene file."
msgstr ""
"默认情况下，标题包含项目和场景名称以及场景包含的帧数；此信息无法编辑，因为它们是"
"从场景文件中自动检索的。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1896
msgid ""
"The ``xsheet_html.xml``  file has to be well-formed, and so it can not contain "
"an opening tag without its related closing tag, otherwise OpenToonz will not "
"run. If you decide to edit the ``xsheet_html.xml``  file, make a backup copy "
"first in case you need to revert the file to the original version."
msgstr ""
"“xsheet_html.xml”文件必须格式良好，因此它不能包含没有相关结束标记的开始标记，否"
"则OpenToonz将无法运行。如果您决定编辑“xsheet_html.xml”文件，请先制作一个备份副"
"本，以防需要将文件还原为原始版本。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1898
msgid "**To edit the xsheet_html.xml file:**"
msgstr "**要编辑xsheet_html.xml文件，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1900
msgid ""
"Open the ``xsheet_html.xml``  file available in the folder ``OpenToonz stuff"
"\\profiles\\layouts\\settings`` with a text editor application (e.g. Notepad or "
"TextEdit)."
msgstr ""
"使用文本编辑器应用程序（例如记事本或TextEdit）打开文件夹“OpenToonz stuff"
"\\profiles\\layouts\\sets”中的“xsheet_html.xml”文件。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1902
msgid ""
"**To change the size of the table used for splitting the Xsheet in sections:**"
msgstr "**要更改用于将Xsheet拆分为部分的表的大小，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1904
msgid ""
"Change the ``page row``  and ``page columns``  values in the ``xsheet_html."
"xml``  file."
msgstr "更改“xsheet_html.xml”文件中的“页面行”和“页面列”值。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1906
msgid "**To edit the information displayed in the header:**"
msgstr "**要编辑标题中显示的信息，请执行以下操作：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1908
msgid ""
"Edit the ``info``  lines available in the ``xsheet_html.xml``  file, and append "
"new ones if needed."
msgstr "编辑“xsheet_html.xml”文件中可用的“info”行，并在需要时附加新的行。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1910
msgid "**To check if the xsheet_html.xml file is well-formed:**"
msgstr "**要检查xsheet_html.xml文件是否格式正确：**"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1912
msgid ""
"Open it with an Internet browser and check if all the elements are displayed in "
"a nested list where they can be opened and closed to display or hide the "
"related contents."
msgstr ""
"用互联网浏览器打开它，检查所有元素是否都显示在嵌套列表中，可以在其中打开和关闭以"
"显示或隐藏相关内容。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1918
msgid "Editing HTML Xsheet Appearance"
msgstr "编辑HTML表格外观"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1919
msgid ""
"The HTML Xsheet appearance can be defined by editing thexsheet.css file "
"available in the folder ``OpenToonz stuff\\profiles\\layouts\\settings`` ."
msgstr ""
"HTML Xsheet外观可以通过编辑文件夹“OpenToonz stuff\\profiles\\layouts\\sets”中的"
"Xsheet.css文件来定义。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1921
msgid ""
"The ``xsheet.css``  is a Cascading Style Sheet file that is used to define the "
"colors, layout, and other aspects of the HTML Xsheet file. It can be edited "
"with any text editor software, e.g. Notepad or TextEdit."
msgstr ""
"`xsheet.css`是一个级联样式表文件，用于定义HTML xsheet文件的颜色、布局和其他方"
"面。它可以用任何文本编辑器软件进行编辑，例如记事本或TextEdit。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1923
msgid ""
"Editing the CSS file requires some skill in the CSS language, but some changes "
"like table ruling thickness, or cell colors, can be easily done by expressing "
"the thickness in pixels and colors as an RGB triplet in hexadecimal format."
msgstr ""
"编辑CSS文件需要一些CSS语言技能，但一些更改，如表格规则厚度或单元格颜色，可以通过"
"将像素和颜色的厚度表示为十六进制格式的RGB三元组来轻松完成。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1925
msgid "Elements defined in the CSS are the following:"
msgstr "CSS中定义的元素如下："

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1927
msgid "``header``  refers to the table used as header in the HTML Xsheet file."
msgstr "``header `是指HTML Xsheet文件中用作标题的表。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1929
msgid "``table``  refers to the table used for displaying the Xsheet sections."
msgstr "``表“”是指用于显示Xsheet部分的表。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1931
msgid "``TH``  refers to the header cells of the tables."
msgstr "``TH代表表格的标题单元格。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1933
msgid ""
"``first_numeric``  refers to the first numerical column of the Xsheet tables."
msgstr "``first_numeric“”表示Xsheet表的第一个数字列。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1935
msgid "``fxcell``  refers to the table cells belonging to special FX columns."
msgstr "``fxcell“”指属于特殊FX列的表单元格。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1937
msgid ""
"``subxsheetcell``  refers to the table cells belonging to Sub-Xsheet columns."
msgstr "``subxsheetcell“”是指属于Sub Xsheet列的表单元格。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1939
msgid "``TD``  refers to the generic table cells."
msgstr "``TD“”指的是通用表单元格。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1941
msgid "``TH.frame``  refers to the frame column"
msgstr "``TH.frame“”指的是框架列"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1943
msgid ""
"``TD.levelcell``  refers to the table cells belonging to standard level columns."
msgstr "``TD.levelcell“”是指属于标准级别列的表单元格。"

#: ../../source/working_in_xsheet.rst:1945
msgid ""
"The CSS files have to be written according to a specific syntax. If you decide "
"to edit the ``xsheet.css``  file, make a backup copy first in case you need to "
"revert the file to the original version."
